eats both arrived in perfect condition. Customer support even helped me pick the right size harness. Will definitely order again!\", \"rating\": 4.5}, {\"name\": \"Rudra Pandya\", \"text\": \"Yes It is very Good website for me, As I have a very good experience here, Like the products I order are so good and so premium\", \"rating\": 5}, {\"name\": \"Dynamic Review\", \"text\": \"This review is not static and it is added from Vendure\", \"rating\": 3.5}, {\"name\": \"Testing Review\", \"text\": \"This review is also added from vendure but it is just testing review\", \"rating\": 5}], \"publishedReviews\": [{\"name\": \"Sumit Joshi\", \"text\": \"I’ve ordered from several pet sites before, but this one actually feels like it was made by people who love animals. The category pages are clean and easy to browse, product photos are honest, and delivery was faster than expected. My Labrador’s new chew toys and the grain-free treats both arrived in perfect condition. Customer support even helped me pick the right size harness. Will definitely order again!\", \"rating\": 4.5}, {\"name\": \"Rudra Pandya\", \"text\": \"Yes It is very Good website for me, As I have a very good experience here, Like the products I order are so good and so premium\", \"rating\": 5}, {\"name\": \"Dynamic Review\", \"text\": \"This review is not static and it is added from Vendure\", \"rating\": 3.5}, {\"name\": \"Testing Review\", \"text\": \"This review is also added from vendure but it is just testing review\", \"rating\": 5}]}',9,4),('2026-09-09 14:08:40.912658','2026-09-09 14:16:26.013465','hero',2,'{\"images\": [{\"source\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/dphhm1agg/image/upload/v1788957122/petsupright/source-40-peakpx.jpg\", \"assetId\": \"51\", \"preview\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/dphhm1agg/image/upload/v1788957124/petsupright/preview-5e-peakpx__preview.jpg\"}, {\"source\": \"https://res.cloudinary.com/dphhm1agg/image/upload/v1788956996/petsupright/source-93-pets-image.jpg\", \"assetId\":