 sensitive payment information such as complete card details.\\n\\n5. Cookies\\n\\nOur website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and understand how our website is used.\\n\\n6. Sharing of Information\\n\\nWe may share necessary information with trusted service providers such as payment providers, shipping partners, and other services required to complete your order.\\n\\n7. Data Security\\n\\nWe take reasonable measures to protect personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, loss, or disclosure.\\n\\n8. Your Choices\\n\\nYou may contact us if you want to update or correct personal information associated with your account.\\n\\n9. Changes to This Privacy Policy\\n\\nWe may update this Privacy Policy when our services or policies change. Updated information will be published on this page.\\n\\n10. Contact Us\\n\\nIf you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact PetsUpright through our Contact Us page.\", \"publishedText\": \"Last Updated: September 2026\\n\\n1. Introduction\\n\\nWelcome to PetsUpright. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us while using our website and services.\\n\\n2. Information We Collect\\n\\nWe may collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, delivery address, and order details when you create an account, place an order, or contact us.\\n\\n3. How We Use Your Information\\n\\nWe may use your information to process and deliver orders, provide customer support, improve our website and services, and communicate important updates related to your account or orders.\\n\\n4. Payment Information\\n\\nPayments may be processed through third-party payment service providers. PetsUpright does not directly store sensitive payment information such as complete card details.\\n\\n5. Cookies\\n\\nOur website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and understand how our website is used.\\n\\n6. Sharing of Information\\n\\nWe may share necessary information with trusted service providers such as payment providers, shipping partners, and other services required to complete your order.\\n\\n7. Data Security\\n\\nWe take reasonable measures to protect personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, loss, or disclosure.\\n\\n8. Your Choices\\n\\nYou may contact us if you want to update or correct personal information associated with your account.\\n\\n9. Changes to This Privacy Policy\\n\\nWe may update this Privacy Policy when our services or policies change. Updated information will be published on this page.\\n\\n10. Contact Us\\n\\nIf you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact PetsUpright through our Contact Us page.\"}',12,5),('2026-09-14 10:22:58.780648','2026-09-15 05:33:01.629923','text',1,'{\"text\": \"Terms of Use\\n\\nBy using PetsUpright, you agree to use our website and services responsibly and lawfully.\\n\\n1. Products & Orders\\nWe aim to provide accurate product information, pricing, and availability. Orders may be cancelled if a product is unavailable or payment cannot be completed.\\n\\n2. Payments\\nCustomers must provide valid payment information. Payments may be processed through trusted third-party payment providers.\\n\\n3. Shipping & Returns\\nShipping, delivery, returns, and refunds are handled according to our applicable policies.\\n\\n4. User Accounts\\nYou are responsible for keeping your account information accurate and your login credentials secure.\\n\\n5. Website Content\\nPetsUpright website content, branding, images, and materials may not be copied or reused without permission.\\n\\n6. Changes\\nWe may update these Terms of Use when required. Updated terms will be available on this page.\\n\\n7. Contact\\nFor questions regarding these terms, please contact us through our Contact Us page.\", \"publishedText\": \"Terms of Use\\n\\nBy using PetsUpright, you agree to use our website and services responsibly and lawfully.\\n\\n1. Products & Orders\\nWe aim to provide accurate product information, pricing, and availability. Orders may be cancelled if a product is unavailable or payment cannot be completed.\\n\\n2. Payments\\nCustomers must provide valid payment information. Payments may be processed through trusted third-party payment providers.\\n\\n3. Shipping & Returns\\nShipping, delivery, returns, and refunds are handled according to our applicable policies.\\n\\n4. User Accounts\\nYou are responsible for keeping your account information accurate and your login credentials secure.\\n\\n5. Website Content\\nPetsUpright website content, branding, images, and materials may not be copied or reused without permission.\\n\\n6. Changes\\nWe may update these Terms of Use when required. Updated terms will be available on this page.\\n\\n7. Contact\\nFor questions regarding these terms, please contact us through our Contact Us page.\"}',13,6);
