y odour control Environmentally friendly',NULL,'Germany','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG 73494 Rosenberg','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG'),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.503295','2026-10-09 09:30:21.015000',NULL,1,247,1142,'Cat',0,NULL,'Filling Pour Joe\'s Cat Clumping Litter into the litter box to a depth of at least 5 to 7 centimeters. This ensures optimal clumping and odor control. Daily Maintenance Use a litter scoop to remove clumps and solid waste regularly. This helps maintain hygiene and freshness in the litter box. No Weekly Box Change Needed A full change of the litter box is not required weekly. One basic filling of Joe’s Cat lasts up to 3 weeks for a single cat when maintained properly. Waste Disposal Dispose of clumps and solid waste in the household trash. Individual clumps may also be flushed down the toilet in small amounts, as they are water dissolvable.*',NULL,'Natural and Biodegradable Ingredients Made from sustainable wood fibers and recycled paper, offering a natural and eco conscious litter solution Exceptional Absorbency Absorbs up to 600 percent of its weight in liquid, ensuring a dry and clean litter box for your cat Effective Odor Control Neutralizes bad odors effectively to maintain a fresh smelling home all day long Low Dust Formula Minimizes dust to keep the air clean, ideal for cats with respiratory sensitivity and allergy prone households Strong Clumping Action Forms hard clumps that are easy to scoop, reducing mess and simplifying daily maintenance Flushable for Easy Disposal Can be flushed in small amounts, providing a safe and sanitary disposal option Long Lasting and Economical One 3 kg pack lasts up to three weeks, making it a cost effective choice for every cat owner',NULL,'Germany','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG 73494 Rosenberg','JRS Petcare GmbH & Co. KG'),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.530629','2026-10-09 09:30:21.026000',NULL,1,248,1141,'Hamster / Guinea Pig / Turtle / Rabbit',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hygien