xtract, butyrospermum parkii butter, polyaminopropyl biguanide, phenoxyethanol, ethylhexylglycerin, raspberry ketone, caprylyl glycol, cucumis sativus fruit extract, punica granatum extract, tocopheryl acetate, citric acid, sodium citrate, sodium bicarbonate, decyl glucoside, parfum.',NULL,NULL,'Hypoallergenic Formula: Gentle enough for sensitive skin and daily use Dermatologist Tested: Safe for dogs with allergies and skin sensitivities Multi-Purpose Cleaning: Perfect for paws, body, face, and bum No Bath Required: Quick cleanups that save time and reduce stress Cruelty-Free Certified: Leaping Bunny certified - never tested on animals',NULL,'Canada','Earth Rated','8500 decarie blvd 7th floor montreal quebec H4P 2N2 Canada','Earth Rated'),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.377938','2026-10-09 09:30:22.723000',NULL,1,364,1826,'Dog',1,'Aqua, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Glycerin, Decyl Glucoside, Propanediol, Lactic Acid, Natural Fragrance, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Phytate, Sodium Hydroxide, Salicylic Acid, Sodium Benzoate.',NULL,NULL,'REMOVES DIRT AND ODOR: Our extra large wipes allow for a convenient, mess free and comfortable clean and removal of wax build up. Perfect for regular ear grooming. HYPOALLERGENIC AND CRUELTY-FREE: Our hypoallergenic wipes are made with FSC-certified and FSC-controlled plant-based viscose fibres (C198176). Leaping Bunny Cruelty-Free Certified. CALMING AND SOOTHING: Formulated with aloe vera and chamomile to help soothe skin. Wild oat scented to address bad odors and leave ears smelling fresh. A SINGLE WIPE GOES A LONG WAY - up to 5 times larger than standard options. Just one wipe is all you need to gently and thoroughly clean both ears, simplifying your routine with full coverage. EARTH RATED: Our mission is to make everyday moments for people and their dogs simpler and better. We do this by designing innovative products that are thoughtfully unexpected. We are also proudly B Corp Certified.',NULL,'Canada','Earth Rated','8500 decarie blvd 7th floor montreal quebec H4P 2N2 Canada','Earth Rated'),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.395993','2026-10-09 09:30:22.733000',NULL,1,365,1832,'Dog',1,'Aqua, Glycerin, Pelargonium Graveolens (Geranium) Oil, Decyl Glucoside, Boric Acid, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Oil, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Phytate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate.',NULL,NULL,'REMOVES TEAR STAINS AND EYE DISCHARGE: Our extra large wipes allow for a convenient and comfortable clean to help remove dirt and reduce tear stains. perfect for regular daily eye cleaning. HYPOALLERGENIC AND CRUELTY-FREE: Our hypoallergenic wipes are madewith FSC-certified and FSC-controlled plant-based viscose fibres (C198176). Leaping Bunny Cruelty-Free Certified. CALMING AND SOOTHING: Formulated With chamomile extract to help soothe skin around eye area. A SINGLE WIPE GOES A LONG WAY: up to 5 times larger than standard options. Just one wipe is all you need to gently and thoroughly clean both eye areas, simplifying your routine with full coverage. EARTH RATED: Our mission is to make everyday moments for people and their dogs simpler and better. We do this by designing innovative products that are thoughtfully unexpected. We are also proudly B Corp Certified.',NULL,'Canada','Earth Rated','8500 decarie blvd 7th floor montreal quebec H4P 2N2 Canada','Earth Rated');
