INSERT INTO `product_translation` VALUES ('2026-10-08 13:21:16.174734','2026-10-08 13:21:16.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Wetlands Canine (Wild Fowl)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-wetlands-canine-wild-fowl','With 32% protein this formula is packed with highly digestible energy from duck quail and turkey along with nutrient-packed vegetables legumes and fruits. This unique combination of fowl gives dogs the taste of wild game they can’t resist with the balanced nutrition nature intended.',1,1),('2026-10-08 13:21:16.187046','2026-10-08 13:21:16.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Pacific Stream Canine (Smoked Salmon)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-pacific-stream-canine-smoked-salmon','This egg-free recipe gets all its animal protein from fish meaning that it’s rich in the omega fatty acids that help keep skin healthy and fur smooth and shiny and may be a good option for dogs with food sensitivities. The sustainably sourced smoked salmon taste will satisfy any dog’s inner-wolf while meticulously selected ingredients provide the ideal nutrient levels for the overall health and vitality of adult dogs.',2,2),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.858620','2026-10-09 07:45:46.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Pacific Stream Puppy (Smoked Salmon)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-pacific-stream-puppy-smoked-salmon','This egg-free recipe gets all its animal protein from fish meaning that it’s rich in the omega fatty acids that help keep skin healthy and fur smooth and shiny. Unique flavors from smoked salmon vegetables legumes and fruits in a small kibble size make it easy for puppies to enjoy the nutrients they need for overall vitality. Because of the guaranteed levels of DHA and perfectly balanced nutrition this formula is great for pregnant or nursing mothers and other adult dogs as well.',3,3),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.858724','2026-10-09 07:45:46.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Sierra Mountain Canine (Roasted Lamb)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-sierra-mountain-canine-roasted-lamb','Roasted lamb and egg combine with sweet potatoes and peas to give dogs the energy they need for overall vitality with a flavor they will crave. Grain-free and highly digestible this formula may be a good choice for dogs with food allergies or intolerances.',4,5),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.858958','2026-10-09 07:45:46.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Wetlands Canine (Wild Fowl)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-wetlands-canine-wild-fowl','With 32% protein this formula is packed with highly digestible energy from duck quail and turkey along with nutrient-packed vegetables legumes and fruits. This unique combination of fowl gives dogs the taste of wild game they can’t resist with the balanced nutrition nature intended.',5,4),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.859062','2026-10-09 07:45:46.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Cat Food Canyon River Feline (Trout And Smoke Salmon)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-cat-food-canyon-river-feline-trout-and-smoke-salmon','What wild cat doesn’t crave the taste of a fish dinner? Made with trout and smoked salmon the only source of animal protein in this formula is fish so it can be a good option for cats with food allergies or sensitivities. Nutrient-packed vegetables and fruits provide antioxidants to help support a healthy immune system and overall vitality just like nature intended.',6,6),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.859123','2026-10-09 07:45:46.000000','en','Taste of the Wild Dry Dog Food Pacific Stream Canine (Smoked Salmon)','taste-of-the-wild-taste-of-the-wild-dry-dog-food-pacific-stream-canine-smoked-salmon','This egg-free recipe gets all its animal protein from fish meaning that it’s rich in the omega fatty acids that help keep skin healthy and fur smooth and shiny and may be a good option for dogs with food sensitivities. The sustainably sourced smoked salmon taste will satisfy any dog’s inner-wolf while meticulously selected ingredients provide the ideal nutrient levels for the overall health and vitality of adult dogs.',7,7),('2026-10-09 07:45:46.996739','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Cat Exclusive Clumping Cat Litter – Baby Powder Scent, Scoopable, Low Dust, Hard Clumps – All Breed Cats, Long-Lasting Odor Control, Easy to Clean (10 kg, Pack of 1)','cat-exclusive-intersand-cat-exclusive-clumping-cat-litter-baby-powder-scent-scoopable-low-dust-hard-clumps-all-breed-cats-long-lasting-odor-control-easy-to-clean-10-kg-pack-of-1','Boost freshness and cleanliness in your cat’s litter area with Intersand Cat Exclusive Clumping Cat Litter – Baby Powder Scent. Specially designed for all cat breeds, this high-quality clumping litter forms strong, easy-to-scoop clumps for quick cleaning and maximum hygiene. The low-dust formula ensures cleaner air and minimizes mess during pouring and scooping. Enriched with a gentle baby powder fragrance, it provides long-lasting odor control, leaving your home smelling fresh and pleasant. This litter is safe, non-toxic, and ideal for multi-cat households. It absorbs moisture quickly, reducing tracking and making daily maintenance easy for cat parents. Whether you’re a new pet owner or a seasoned cat lover, this litter combines powerful performance with a soft, welcoming scent. Discover the perfect balance of cleanliness and comfort with every use – trusted by cat owners worldwide for its superior quality and value.',8,8),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.051961','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Cat Exclusive Cat Litter for All Cats Scoopable, Unscented, Clumping New Packaging 18 Kg Bag','cat-exclusive-intersand-cat-exclusive-cat-litter-for-all-cats-scoopable-unscented-clumping-new-packaging-18-kg-bag','Innovative, hygienic and simple to use, Intersands\' Cat Litter - Exclusive is a highly absorbent, Low Dust, quick-clumping formula that lets you easily scoop out the source of odours to keep your cat\'s litter box fresh at all times. This superior quality litter meets all your needs in terms of cleanliness! With an good absorption level, your feline friend is bound to enjoy a healthy environment. After all, a healthy kitty is a happy kitty!',9,9),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.081239','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Cat Exclusive Cat Litter for All Cats Scoopable, Unscented, Clumping New Packaging 10 Kg Bag','cat-exclusive-intersand-cat-exclusive-cat-litter-for-all-cats-scoopable-unscented-clumping-new-packaging-10-kg-bag','Innovative, hygienic and simple to use, Intersands\' Cat Litter - Exclusive is a highly absorbent, Low Dust, quick-clumping formula that lets you easily scoop out the source of odours to keep your cat\'s litter box fresh at all times. This superior quality litter meets all your needs in terms of cleanliness! With an good absorption level, your feline friend is bound to enjoy a healthy environment. After all, a healthy kitty is a happy kitty!',10,10),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.153515','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Odourlock Multi Cat Formula Litter Unscented Block Ammonia Extra Hard Clumping Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 Kg Bag','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-multi-cat-formula-litter-unscented-block-ammonia-extra-hard-clumping-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed-12-kg-bag','Our OdourLock mineral litter is produced from high-quality clay 100% pure and natural for maximum efficiency without compromise:',11,11),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.174516','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Odourlock Multi Cat Formula Litter Unscented Block Ammonia Extra Hard Clumping Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 6 Kg Bag','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-multi-cat-formula-litter-unscented-block-ammonia-extra-hard-clumping-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed-6-kg-bag','Our OdourLock mineral litter is produced from high-quality clay 100% pure and natural for maximum efficiency without compromise:',12,12),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.190185','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Odourlock Calming Breeze Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-calming-breeze-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammonia-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed','Our OdourLock mineral litter is produced from high-quality clay 100% pure and natural for maximum efficiency without compromise:',13,13),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.217734','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Odourlock Baby Powder Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 Kg Bag','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-baby-powder-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammonia-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed-12-kg-bag','Thanks to its patented technology, our OdourLock litter neutralizes ammonia formation for unparalleled control of urine and feces odours. Cat urine does not contain ammonia per se; rather, it is formed in the litter box when the urine comes into contact with oxygen and develops bacteria. Ammonia is responsible for the unpleasant smell that comes from the litter box. Our technology is activated when it comes into contact with urine to neutralize odours for more than 40 days. OdourLock is perfect for a multi-cat environment: Just scoop once a day for optimal cleanliness that will delight you and your cats! Our OdourLock litter is made of a 100% pure natural clay, sodium bentonite. This mineral essential to our exclusive formula comes directly from Wyoming mines. We pay close attention to its extraction and processing to ensure a clay of very high quality while respecting the environment. The high capacity and rapid absorption of our litter allows the formation of smaller and stronger clumps, which greatly facilitates cleaning and daily maintenance. OdourLock can absorb up to 6 times its weight in liquid! As it generates less waste, it lasts longer than a competing litter and therefore costs you less. The amount of litter used each year can be reduced by up to 45%!',14,14),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.288067','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Intersand Odourlock Lavender Field Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 Kg Bag','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-lavender-field-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammonia-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed-12-kg-bag','Thanks to its patented technology, our OdourLock litter neutralizes ammonia formation for unparalleled control of urine and feces odours. Cat urine does not contain ammonia per se; rather, it is formed in the litter box when the urine comes into contact with oxygen and develops bacteria. Ammonia is responsible for the unpleasant smell that comes from the litter box. Our technology is activated when it comes into contact with urine to neutralize odours for more than 40 days. OdourLock is perfect for a multi-cat environment: Just scoop once a day for optimal cleanliness that will delight you and your cats! Our OdourLock litter is made of a 100% pure natural clay, sodium bentonite. This mineral essential to our exclusive formula comes directly from Wyoming mines. We pay close attention to its extraction and processing to ensure a clay of very high quality while respecting the environment. The high capacity and rapid absorption of our litter allows the formation of smaller and stronger clumps, which greatly facilitates cleaning and daily maintenance. OdourLock can absorb up to 6 times its weight in liquid! As it generates less waste, it lasts longer than a competing litter and therefore costs you less. The amount of litter used each year can be reduced by up to 45%!',15,15),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.320467','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','OdourLock Maxcare Unscented','odourlock-odourlock-maxcare-unscented','Ultra premium health monitoring clay litter. Contains patented Blücare® technology that detects the presence of blood and glucose in urine. Technology activated on contact with urine to neutralize odour development for over 40 days. Rapid absorption and formation of smaller, stronger agglomerates to facilitate daily cleaning and maintenance. Respects human and cat respiratory tracts. Fast, easy cleaning, ideal for multi-cat environments.',16,16),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.330821','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Bird Food For Budgie','vitapol-vitapol-economic-bird-food-for-budgie','suitable for this small species of grain eater. All ingredients are of the highest quality fully ripe and free from contamination. The basis of the mixture are three types of millet that provide the energy and trace elements necessary for life. As well as shelled millet otherwise millet which is more digestible and digestible than husked millet. There are also nutritious canary seed seeds which are easily digestible recommended in the diet of birds with gastrointestinal disorders. Shelled oats the so-called Pinworm exceeds the nutritional value of all other types of cereals it occupies a relatively small share in the mixture due to its high carbohydrate content. It is also a valuable source of calcium magnesium sodium and copper. The lack of husk prevents it from irritating the delicate digestive tract. The admixture of tasty high-fat sunflower seeds provides valuable protein rich in amino acids not produced by the bird\'s body. Linseed provides a healthy-looking skin and shiny plumage. The whole is enriched with granules based on cereal flour with the addition of anise seeds to ensure a pleasant smell. Anise has antimicrobial and insect repellent properties and is treated by birds as a neutral odor.',17,17),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.393049','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Food for Cockatiels 1200 Gram Nutritious High-Fiber Bird Diet with Millet Safflower Flax Seed Carrot Raisins Supports Digestion & Feather Health','vitapol-vitapol-economic-food-for-cockatiels-1200-gram-nutritious-high-fiber-bird-diet-with-millet-safflower-flax-seed-carrot-raisins-supports-digestion-and-feather-health','Vitapol Economic Food for Cockatiels is a high-quality, affordable complete diet formulated to meet the daily nutritional needs of your bird. Enriched with a variety of premium seeds, including yellow millet, red millet, safflower, and flax seed, this blend ensures optimal digestion, energy levels, and feather health. The inclusion of dehydrated carrots, raisins, and anise powder provides essential vitamins and minerals, boosting immunity and overall well-being. This balanced diet contains oat groats, wheat flour, and corn flour, supporting high digestibility and sustained energy release. The addition of alfalfa meal and carotene contributes to strong bones and vibrant plumage. Designed for high palatability and easy consumption, Vitapol Economic Food ensures that your cockatiel gets a varied and nutritious diet every day.',18,18),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.414586','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Food for Cockatiels 800 Gram Nutritious High-Fiber Bird Diet with Millet Safflower Flax Seed Carrot Raisins Supports Digestion & Feather Health','vitapol-vitapol-economic-food-for-cockatiels-800-gram-nutritious-high-fiber-bird-diet-with-millet-safflower-flax-seed-carrot-raisins-supports-digestion-and-feather-health','Vitapol Economic Food for Cockatiels is a high-quality, affordable complete diet formulated to meet the daily nutritional needs of your bird. Enriched with a variety of premium seeds, including yellow millet, red millet, safflower, and flax seed, this blend ensures optimal digestion, energy levels, and feather health. The inclusion of dehydrated carrots, raisins, and anise powder provides essential vitamins and minerals, boosting immunity and overall well-being. This balanced diet contains oat groats, wheat flour, and corn flour, supporting high digestibility and sustained energy release. The addition of alfalfa meal and carotene contributes to strong bones and vibrant plumage. Designed for high palatability and easy consumption, Vitapol Economic Food ensures that your cockatiel gets a varied and nutritious diet every day.',19,19),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.429863','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Small Animal Food For Guinea Pig','vitapol-vitapol-economic-small-animal-food-for-guinea-pig','Economic guinea pig food has been enriched in granules from meadow hay vegetables and fruits ensures high proportion of fiber in the diet of this herbivorous rodents. To assure the right nutrition the food mix contains complete granules that provide all the necessary ingredients in the daily diet. Presence of vegetables like carrot beet or parsnip ensures complete nutrition. Carotenes present in carrots assure protection from harmful for the organism free radicals and enhance sight of the animal. Parsnip lowers blood pressure prevents kidney stones and cholelithiasis. It is a source of vitamin C B and mineral salts. For balanced nutritions and presence of natural vitamin C in the mix there is added currant and parsley. Branch of linden take care of incisors by regular abrasion. Bean flakes are essential source of digestible and valuable protein necessary for proper development of the animal.',20,20),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.451060','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Food for Hamsters 1200 Gram Nutritious Mix with Grains, Seeds, Peanuts & Carrots High-Fiber Diet Supports Digestion, Growth & Healthy Fur','vitapol-vitapol-economic-food-for-hamsters-1200-gram-nutritious-mix-with-grains-seeds-peanuts-and-carrots-high-fiber-diet-supports-digestion-growth-and-healthy-fur','Vitapol Economic Food for Hamsters is a high-quality, budget-friendly complete diet formulated to support healthy growth, digestion, and energy levels. This premium mix contains essential grains, seeds, and vegetables to mimic a hamster’s natural diet, ensuring optimal health and well-being. The high-protein blend includes wheat bran, barley, corn, red sorghum, and oat groats, promoting muscle development and sustained energy. Carrot dices and peas provide beta-carotene and amino acids, enhancing vision, immunity, and digestion. Flax seeds support a healthy coat and skin, while roasted peanuts deliver essential fats for heart and brain function. The inclusion of raisins and beet pulp ensures a fiber-rich diet for smooth digestion.',21,21),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.503447','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Food for Rabbits 1200 Gram High-Fiber Complete Diet with Meadow Hay Carrot Beetroot Apple and Flax Seed Supports Digestion and Dental Health','vitapol-vitapol-economic-food-for-rabbits-1200-gram-high-fiber-complete-diet-with-meadow-hay-carrot-beetroot-apple-and-flax-seed-supports-digestion-and-dental-health','Vitapol Economic Food for Rabbits is a nutritionally balanced complete food designed to provide essential nutrients at an affordable price. This high-fiber formula is enriched with 20% meadow hay granules, ensuring optimal digestive health and natural tooth abrasion. The blend includes grass meal, grains, alfalfa meal, flax seed, and dried apple, supplying the necessary fiber, protein, and essential fatty acids to support energy levels, coat health, and overall well-being. With dehydrated carrots, beetroot, and pea flakes, this food delivers natural vitamins (B, A, C, and PP) and minerals to boost immunity, red blood cell production, and muscle function. The inclusion of flax seeds ensures a shiny, healthy coat, while apple promotes digestive function by supporting gut movement. This carefully formulated diet meets the daily nutritional needs of rabbits, offering a complete, well-rounded meal for long-term health.',22,22),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.526871','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Smakers for Budgies 60 Gram Affordable Nutritious Bird Treat with Millet Sunflower Seeds Flax Seed and Anise Supports Digestion and Foraging','vitapol-vitapol-economic-smakers-for-budgies-60-gram-affordable-nutritious-bird-treat-with-millet-sunflower-seeds-flax-seed-and-anise-supports-digestion-and-foraging','Vitapol Economic Smakers for Budgies is a high-quality, budget-friendly bird treat designed to provide essential nutrition while adding variety to your budgie’s diet. Made with a premium blend of yellow millet, white millet, red millet, canary grass seed, and husked oats, this snack is rich in fiber, protein, and healthy fats to support digestion, energy levels, and feather health. Enriched with flax seed, sunflower seeds, anise powder, and alfalfa meal, it delivers natural vitamins, antioxidants, and minerals for overall well-being. This crunchy and flavorful treat is specially formulated to stimulate natural foraging behavior, keeping your budgie engaged and active. With a convenient stick format, it can be easily attached to the cage for mess-free feeding. Designed to complement daily meals, it ensures a nutritionally balanced diet at an affordable price.',23,23),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.545140','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Economic Smakers For Cockatiel','vitapol-vitapol-economic-smakers-for-cockatiel','',24,24),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.563758','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Complete Food for Big Parrots','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-complete-food-for-big-parrots','The formula of this perfectly balanced mixture has been developed with large parrots in mind to provide them with exceptionally tasty food, which at the same time provides all the necessary ingredients to support the health and proper functioning of the bird\'s organism. . Composed of a diverse range of seeds and cereals with the addition of parrot delicacies: pumpkin seeds, rosehips, dried chillies, which are the delicacy of parrots. Nuts are a good source of protein, minerals and healthy fats. Mung beans contain a lot of valuable protein, the amino acids of which contribute to the formation of feathers and their healthy appearance. It is also a rich source of fiber, vitamins and mineral salts.',25,25),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.587510','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Complete Food For Budgie','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-complete-food-for-budgie','Complete mix for budgie\'s daily diet. Among selected, best quality, properly balanced nuts, it contains fruits and vegetables (strawberry, apple, carrot). Thanks to rich and diversified composition, this food provides necessary vitamins, minerals and elements in bird\'s diet. The food also contains vitaminised granules, completing parrot\'s diet in vitamins A, D3, E, C and calcium and phosphorus.',26,26),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.616803','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Food For Canary','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-food-for-canary','A basic mixture for everyday nutrition, containing selected, best-quality seeds matched to the nutritional requirements of canaries. The basic mixtures are canary seeds supplemented with turnip and millet. Linseed rich in vitamins A, A2, B6, B12, E, enzymes, magnesium, iron, zinc, copper, cobalt, phosphorus and mineral salts, plant mucilage, beneficial to the digestive system. Hemp stimulates males to sing and breed. Crushed shells of spikers are a valuable source of natural calcium, and carrot grits of beta-carotenes. The food contains the addition of extruded ingredients with a high degree of digestibility, which include alfalfa and papaya flour.',27,27),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.641884','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Cockatiel Food 500 Gram Complete Balanced Diet with Millet Flax Seed Sunflower Seeds Fruits and Herbs Supports Digestion and Feather Health','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-cockatiel-food-500-gram-complete-balanced-diet-with-millet-flax-seed-sunflower-seeds-fruits-and-herbs-supports-digestion-and-feather-health','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Cockatiel Food is a complete and balanced diet designed to meet the nutritional needs of cockatiels. This premium blend contains yellow millet, red millet, canary grass seed, hulled oats, buckwheat, and flax seeds, ensuring a nutrient-rich formula that supports optimal digestion, energy, and feather health. Enriched with striped sunflower seeds, peanuts, dried hawthorn fruit, raisins, and eucalyptus leaf, it provides essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants to enhance overall well-being. The high fiber content promotes a healthy digestive system, while natural oils from linseed and sunflower seeds support vibrant plumage. This carefully selected mix of grains, seeds, and dried fruits encourages natural foraging behavior, keeping your bird active and engaged. Serve 2-4 teaspoons per day based on your bird’s appetite, ensuring access to fresh and clean drinking water.',28,28),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.664902','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Cockatiel Food 400 Gram Complete Balanced Diet with Millet Flax Seed Sunflower Seeds Fruits and Herbs Supports Digestion and Feather Health','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-cockatiel-food-400-gram-complete-balanced-diet-with-millet-flax-seed-sunflower-seeds-fruits-and-herbs-supports-digestion-and-feather-health','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Cockatiel Food is a complete and balanced diet designed to meet the nutritional needs of cockatiels. This premium blend contains yellow millet, red millet, canary grass seed, hulled oats, buckwheat, and flax seeds, ensuring a nutrient-rich formula that supports optimal digestion, energy, and feather health. Enriched with striped sunflower seeds, peanuts, dried hawthorn fruit, raisins, and eucalyptus leaf, it provides essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants to enhance overall well-being. The high fiber content promotes a healthy digestive system, while natural oils from linseed and sunflower seeds support vibrant plumage. This carefully selected mix of grains, seeds, and dried fruits encourages natural foraging behavior, keeping your bird active and engaged. Serve 2-4 teaspoons per day based on your bird’s appetite, ensuring access to fresh and clean drinking water.',29,29),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.714383','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Food for Guinea Pigs 400 Gram High-Fiber Complete Diet with Carrot Parsnip Beetroot Black Currants and Thyme Supports Digestion & Immunity','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-food-for-guinea-pigs-400-gram-high-fiber-complete-diet-with-carrot-parsnip-beetroot-black-currants-and-thyme-supports-digestion-and-immunity','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Food for Guinea Pigs is a high-quality, nutritionally complete diet designed to support healthy digestion, immunity, and overall well-being. Made with a carefully balanced blend of wheat bran, alfalfa meal, corn flour, granulated hay, and flaxseed, it provides essential fiber, proteins, and natural nutrients for optimal health and vitality. Enriched with dried carrot, parsnip, beetroot, and black currants, this formula delivers key vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants that support immunity and promote healthy skin and coat. The inclusion of pumpkin seeds, thyme, and dried parsley aids in gut health and digestion, while pea flakes and oat bran provide energy. Designed for high digestibility, this food ensures your guinea pig gets the necessary nutrients for daily wellness.',30,30),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.732267','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Small Animal Food For Hamster','vitapol-vitapol-small-animal-food-for-hamster','Complete mixture for hamsters, properly balanced, which includes components of the diet of rodents found in the natural environment. It is a mixture of the best quality grains, seeds and granules. In addition, the food has been enriched with extruded ingredients with a composition and shape adapted to the nutritional requirements of this species of rodents. This makes the food more digestible. The feed has also been enriched with carrots, legumes and carob. Carob provides many vitamins such as A, B2, B3, D, E and mineral salts: calcium, phosphorus, potassium, magnesium and iron. It has a positive effect on the digestive system and contributes to lowering the level of cholesterol in the blood. The addition of carrots with a high content of beta-carotene, i.e. provitamin A, provides important minerals such as calcium, iron, phosphorus, copper, zinc, molybdenum, magnesium, iodine and potassium. The addition of linseed, rich in unsaturated fatty acids, affects the skin and coat, improving their overall condition. The varied composition ensures that the food is tasty, attractive and provides the necessary nutrients for the proper development and functioning of the hamster\'s organism.',31,31),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.753652','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Complete Food For Lovebirds','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-complete-food-for-lovebirds','A basic mixture intended for everyday nutrition, containing selected, best-quality, properly balanced seeds matched to the nutritional requirements of lovebirds. The basic mixtures are seeds of red and white millet and canary, which provide valuable and easily digestible protein. Linseed rich in vitamins A, A2, B6, B12, E, enzymes, magnesium, iron, zinc, copper, cobalt, phosphorus and mineral salts, plant mucilages, positively influencing the digestive system. Hemp seeds provide energy and are a bird\'s delicacy. The addition of locust beans provides the body with natural vitamins A, E, B1, B2. It also contains fiber and mineral salts, is a source of easily digestible carbohydrates and can be served daily as a delicacy or addition to food.',32,32),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.799695','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Food For Medium Parrots','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-food-for-medium-parrots','Complete mixture for medium parrots, especially for monks and monks, rosella. The formula with exotic fruits (papaya, coconut, banana) and vegetables (beetroot) as well as healthy seeds, grains and shelled nuts is sure to stimulate your bird\'s appetite and natural eating instinct. All ingredients are of the right size for your pet to enjoy the food',33,33),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.844217','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Rabbit Food 400 Gram Complete and Nutritious Diet with Alfalfa Carrot Beetroot Flax Seed and Herbs Supports Digestion and Dental Health','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-rabbit-food-400-gram-complete-and-nutritious-diet-with-alfalfa-carrot-beetroot-flax-seed-and-herbs-supports-digestion-and-dental-health','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Rabbit Food is a complete and balanced diet designed to support the health and well-being of rabbits of all breeds and ages. Formulated with alfalfa meal, pea flakes, dried carrots, beetroot, flax seeds, and natural herbs, this nutrient-rich food provides essential fiber, proteins, and vitamins for optimal digestion, strong teeth, and overall vitality. The high fiber content promotes gut health, while thyme and dill aid digestion and enhance flavor. This grain-rich, pelleted formula encourages natural chewing behavior, helping to prevent overgrown teeth and ensuring better dental health. The blend of wheat bran, sunflower seed meal, corn flakes, and barley ensures an ideal balance of energy, minerals, and essential nutrients. Perfect for daily feeding, it mimics a rabbit’s natural diet. Feed 50-85g per day, depending on weight, breed, and age.',34,34),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.875784','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Food For Rodents And Rabbit Pellets','vitapol-vitapol-food-for-rodents-and-rabbit-pellets','Complete pellets for rodents providing the nutrients necessary for the proper functioning of the body. Enriched with vitamins such as: A, D3 and E and minerals: copper, zinc, iron, manganese, selenium, calcium. It provides valuable proteins and has a high fiber content.',35,35),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.917126','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Karmeo Premium Food For Zebra Finch','vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-food-for-zebra-finch','best-quality seeds matched to the nutritional requirements of zebra finches and small exotic birds. The food contains nutritious and easily digestible canary seeds and linseeds rich in vitamins A, A2, B6, B12, E, enzymes, magnesium, iron, zinc, copper, cobalt, phosphorus and mineral salts, plant mucilages, beneficial to the digestive system. Hemp stimulates males to sing and breed. Crushed spear shells are a valuable source of natural calcium and carrot grits of beta-carotenes. The food contains the addition of extruded ingredients with a high degree of digestibility, which include alfalfa and papaya flour.',36,36),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.945325','2026-10-09 07:45:47.000000','en','Vitapol Forest Fruits Smakers For Rodents And Rabbit','vitapol-vitapol-forest-fruits-smakers-for-rodents-and-rabbit','Wheat (38%) Wheat Flour Husked Oat (11%) Rosehips Dried Chokeberry Dried Black Juniper Berry (4%) Dried Rowanberry (4%) Dried Elderberry (4%) Dried Blackcurrant Dried Redcurrant.',37,37),('2026-10-09 07:45:47.985929','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Fruit Smakers for Budgies 90 gram Nutritious Bird Treat with Elderberry Apple Orange Peel Coconut Natural Healthy Snack Supports Digestion and Feathers','vitapol-vitapol-fruit-smakers-for-budgies-90-gram-nutritious-bird-treat-with-elderberry-apple-orange-peel-coconut-natural-healthy-snack-supports-digestion-and-feathers','Vitapol Fruit Smakers for Budgies is a premium bird treat formulated to provide essential nutrients while satisfying natural foraging instincts. Made with high-quality ingredients like elderberry, apple, orange peel, and coconut, this complementary food enhances your budgie\'s diet with vital vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. The blend of yellow millet, red sorghum, and niger seed supports overall health, while added yeast promotes digestive wellness. Designed as a crunchy stick, this treat encourages pecking behavior, reducing boredom and keeping your bird active. The combination of proteins, fibers, and healthy fats helps maintain strong feathers, vibrant plumage, and optimal energy levels. Ideal for daily feeding as a snack, it provides variety to your budgie’s diet. Easy to attach to the cage, making feeding convenient and mess-free.',38,38),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.023553','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Fruit Smakers for Cockatiels 90 Gram Nutritious Bird Treat with Millet Sunflower Seeds Coconut Apple and Orange Peel Supports Digestion and Foraging','vitapol-vitapol-fruit-smakers-for-cockatiels-90-gram-nutritious-bird-treat-with-millet-sunflower-seeds-coconut-apple-and-orange-peel-supports-digestion-and-foraging','Vitapol Fruit Smakers for Cockatiels is a delicious and nutritious complementary snack designed to enhance your bird’s diet. Made with a premium blend of yellow millet, red sorghum, safflower seeds, red millet, and husked oats, this treat provides essential proteins, fibers, and healthy fats to support digestion, energy, and feather health. Enriched with dried apple, dried orange peel, coconut, and sunflower seeds, it delivers natural vitamins, antioxidants, and minerals to boost immunity and overall well-being. This crunchy and flavorful treat is designed to encourage natural foraging behavior, keeping your cockatiel engaged and active. The stick format makes it easy to attach to the cage for mess-free feeding. It serves as a healthy, enriching snack to complement your bird’s main meals, providing variety and excitement in their diet.',39,39),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.093596','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Fruit Smakers For Lovebirds','vitapol-vitapol-fruit-smakers-for-lovebirds','',40,40),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.116997','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Honey Smakers for Budgies 90 Gram Nutritious Bird 