getable-smakers-for-rodents-and-rabbit','Smakers® is a variety and supplement to the diet of rodents and rabbits. Rich in many vitamins, minerals and pectins, the source of which are ripe, best-quality vegetables such as beetroot, carrots and parsley. Carrots and beetroot are valuable sources of carotenoids. Parsley contains large amounts of vitamin C and A, B1, B2, P as well as potassium, calcium, magnesium, phosphorus and iron.',50,50),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.446018','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Feed Supplement - Algae For Birds','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-feed-supplement-algae-for-birds','Caring for your flappy friend’s nutritional needs Vitapols\' Vitaline Algae for Birds is a natural diet supplement enriched with the goodness of seaweed. Known for its high concentration of iodine proteins and vitamins the mix boosts the immune system supports the thyroid and aids proper digestion. Making this a regular feature of your pet bird’s health regime will keep your bird healthy and its feathers shiny. After all a healthy bird is a happy bird!',51,51),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.473671','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Feed Supplement - Charcoal For Birds','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-feed-supplement-charcoal-for-birds','A trusted feed supplement that aids digestion and toxin absorption Vitapols\' Vitaline Charcoal for Birds is an all natural vegetal coal for your avian friend. Specially packed to retain its freshness your pet bird will love it. The natural carbon also provides a rich source of minerals. Regular use helps ensure that your bird maintains a proper digestive system to live a healthy life. After all a healthy bird is a happy bird!',52,52),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.497042','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Feed Supplement Chitchat For Budgie','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-feed-supplement-chitchat-for-budgie','',53,53),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.536223','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Feed Supplement Iodine Pearls for Budgie','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-feed-supplement-iodine-pearls-for-budgie','Complementary pet food. Compositions rich in vitamins and minerals, recommended for daily application for prohyhlaxis.',54,54),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.568594','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Thick Feathers For Budgie','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-thick-feathers-for-budgie','Complementary pet food. Add 1 teaspoon to food 2 times a week.',55,55),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.593541','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vitaline Feed Supplement Super Colour For Canary','vitapol-vitapol-vitaline-feed-supplement-super-colour-for-canary','Complementary pet food. Add 1 teaspoon to food 2 times a week',56,56),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.618690','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Xl Mineral Block For Birds - Natural','vitapol-vitapol-xl-mineral-block-for-birds-natural','Mineral supplementation of the daily diet with calcium essential for the proper development growth and life. It is responsible from the first days of life for the proper growth of bones claws feathers and other structures that require the presence of calcium. It prevents rickets.',57,57),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.645657','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitaline Shells and Calcium','vitapol-vitaline-shells-and-calcium','',58,58),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.671223','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Complete Junior Food For Young Rabbits','vitapol-vitapol-complete-junior-food-for-young-rabbits','Food designed for rabbits between 8 and 12 months of age, i.e. for animals in the last stage of growth, just before they are treated as adults. High fiber food ensures proper digestion. Enriched with fruits and vegetables, the amount of which adapts the digestive system to the subsequent use of food for adult rabbits. Enriched with chicory root that naturally lowers blood glucose levels. Appropriate hardness of the elements of the feed ensures proper abrasion processes of the incisors.',59,59),('2026-10-09 07:45:48