 contain harmful substances for these animals. Indications for use:  to reduce the risk of intestinal infections  prophylactically to maintain animal health  with digestive problems and loose faeces',64,64),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.817466','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vita Herbal Kokcivit Forte','vitapol-vitapol-vita-herbal-kokcivit-forte','a set of herbal extracts containing a high dose of natural salicylate, which is characterized by anti-inflammatory and analgesic properties. Additionally, it strengthens the circulatory system and improves the condition of animals. A rich complex of carefully selected herbal extracts supports the proper functioning of the digestive tract of animals. The use of the preparation stimulates the immune system and promotes the development of beneficial bacterial flora, which is why it is perfect for antibiotic treatment, for indigestion symptoms and for decreased appetite. Indications for use: against the multiplication of pathogenic protozoa (e.g. coccidiosis) to minimize disturbances in the intake, digestion and absorpcion of food to protect properly functioning digestive tract supplementary during antibiotic therapy during the convalescence period after illnesses The way of feeding APPLICATION: 1 - 4 ml / 1 liter of water After weaning: for 5 days Prophylactically: 1 - 2 times a week APPLICATION: fur animals, rodents',65,65),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.843530','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vita Herbal Vitamin C','vitapol-vitapol-vita-herbal-vitamin-c','Complementary pet food. Indications for use: for increasing the immunity of animals prophylactically for the daily functioning of the body with vitamin C deficiency. APPLICATION: Prophylactic: pour 1 ml into 1 liter of drinking water using a measuring cup. Give Vitamin C every day. During the treatment period: Double the dose - 2 ml per liter of drinking water, for 10 days. During pregnancy: Double the dose - 2 ml per liter drinking water during this period. Vitamin C is light sensitive, so it is recommended that you change your drinking water every day.',66,66),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.869738','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Xl Mineral Block For Birds - Shell','vitapol-vitapol-xl-mineral-block-for-birds-shell','Mineral supplementation of the daily diet with calcium essential for the proper development growth and life. It is responsible from the first days of life for the proper growth of bones claws feathers and other structures that require the presence of calcium. It prevents rickets.',67,67),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.891908','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vita Herbal Hay for Rabbits & Rodents | Best Natural Polish Meadow Grass with Chamomile | High Fiber Digestive & Dental Care | (1.2 Kilogram, Pack of 1)','vitapol-vitapol-vita-herbal-hay-for-rabbits-and-rodents-best-natural-polish-meadow-grass-with-chamomile-high-fiber-digestive-and-dental-care-1-2-kilogram-pack-of-1','High-quality aromatic carefully dried top-quality blades of grass straight from Polish meadows rich in vitamins and minerals. Hay is a low-calorie food with a high fiber content which affects the proper course of digestive processes in animals. The optimal diet of rodents and rabbits should ensure constant access to this type of food. In addition hay also acts as a bedding material and the basic raw material for building a nest.',68,68),('2026-10-09 07:45:48.919906','2026-10-09 07:45:48.000000','en','Vitapol Vita Herbal Hay for Rabbits & Rodents | Best Natural Polish Meadow Grass with Chamomile | High Fiber Digestive & Dental Care | (1.2 Kilogram, Pack of 2)','vitapol-vitapol-vita-herbal-hay-for-rabbits-and-rodents-best-natural-polish-meadow-grass-with-chamomile-high-fiber-digestive-and-dental-care-1-2-kilogram-pack-of-2','High-quality aromatic carefully dried top-quality blades of grass straight from Polish meadows rich in vitamins and minerals. Hay is a low-calorie food with a high fiber content which affects the proper course of digesti