en & Potato','arden-grange-arden-grange-kitten-grain-free-dry-cat-food-with-fresh-chicken-and-potato','Arden Grange Kitten Grain Free Dry Cat Food with Fresh Chicken & Potato is a premium complete diet designed to support your kitten’s healthy growth from weaning up to 12 months. Crafted with fresh chicken as a primary ingredient, this high-protein recipe helps build strong muscles while being highly palatable for even the fussiest eaters. This grain-free cat food contains no added cereals, making it ideal for kittens with sensitive stomachs or grain intolerance. The carefully balanced formula is enriched with essential vitamins and minerals to promote healthy bones, a strong immune system, and optimal digestion. The small kibble size is designed for young kittens, ensuring easy chewing and better nutrient absorption. Additionally, this nutritionally complete formula is suitable for pregnant and lactating cats, providing the extra energy and nourishment required during this critical stage. Whether you’re raising a playful kitten or caring for a mother cat, Arden Grange ensures premium nutrition, great taste, and overall wellbeing in every bite.',72,72),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.016052','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Adult Cat Grain Free Dry Cat Food with Fresh Chicken & Potato','arden-grange-arden-grange-adult-cat-grain-free-dry-cat-food-with-fresh-chicken-and-potato','Arden Grange Adult Cat Grain Free Dry Cat Food with Fresh Chicken & Potato is a premium maintenance diet designed to meet the nutritional needs of adult cats. Made with a high content of fresh chicken and chicken meal, this recipe delivers high-quality protein to support strong muscles while being highly palatable for even the fussiest eaters. This grain-free formula contains no added cereals, making it ideal for cats with sensitive digestion or grain intolerance. It is enriched with prebiotics to promote a healthy digestive system and support overall immunity. Additionally, the formula includes joint care supplements to help maintain mobility and flexibility, making it suitable for active adult cats. The inclusion of krill provides omega fatty acids for healthy skin and a shiny coat, while yucca extract helps reduce stool odour for improved litter box hygiene. With balanced nutrition, high-quality ingredients, and great taste, Arden Grange Adult Cat Dry Food ensures your cat stays healthy, active, and satisfied every day.',73,73),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.039547','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Weaning Puppy Fresh Chicken Dry Dog Food','arden-grange-arden-grange-weaning-puppy-fresh-chicken-dry-dog-food','Arden Grange Weaning / Puppy Dry Dog Food with Fresh Chicken & Rice is a premium complete diet designed for weaning puppies from as early as 3 weeks of age. With a high chicken content of 44%, this nutrient-rich formula provides high-quality protein to support muscle development and sustained energy during the crucial growth stage. This high-calorie recipe is carefully balanced with essential nutrients including calcium, phosphorus, and vitamin D to support strong bones and teeth. The small kibble size can be easily soaked in water and mashed to create a soft, highly digestible puppy porridge, making the transition from milk to solid food smooth and gentle. Enriched with prebiotics, this formula supports healthy digestion and immunity. Added joint supplements help maintain healthy mobility, while krill provides omega fatty acids for a healthy skin and shiny coat. Yucca extract helps reduce stool odour, making it beneficial for indoor hygiene. Suitable for both growing puppies and pregnant or lactating dogs, Arden Grange ensures complete and balanced nutrition for every stage of early development.',74,74),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.065775','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Puppy Junior Fresh Chicken & Rice Dry Dog Food for All Breeds','arden-grange-arden-grange-puppy-junior-fresh-chicken-and-rice-dry-dog-food-for-all-breeds','Ar