hase. This formula includes enhanced levels of joint supplements to support the extra demands placed on large breed puppies, promoting mobility and long-term joint health. Prebiotics help maintain a healthy digestive system and improve nutrient absorption. The larger kibble size is specifically designed for bigger mouths, encouraging proper chewing and aiding digestion. Enriched with krill for healthy skin and a shiny coat, along with yucca extract to help reduce stool odour, this diet provides complete care for your growing puppy. With trusted quality and balanced nutrition, Arden Grange ensures your large breed puppy gets the best start for a healthy and active life.',76,76),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.134212','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Adult Dog Dry Food with Fresh Chicken & Rice for All Breeds','arden-grange-arden-grange-adult-dog-dry-food-with-fresh-chicken-and-rice-for-all-breeds','Arden Grange Adult Dog Dry Food with Fresh Chicken & Rice is a super premium, complete diet designed for normally active adult dogs. Made with fresh chicken as a high-quality and easily digestible protein source, it supports strong muscles, sustained energy, and overall wellbeing. This highly palatable formula is ideal for daily feeding and is suitable even for fussy eaters. Enriched with prebiotics, it helps maintain a healthy digestive system and supports immunity. Added joint supplements promote mobility, while krill provides omega fatty acids for healthy skin and a shiny coat. Yucca extract also helps reduce stool odour. With balanced nutrition and premium ingredients, Arden Grange ensures your dog stays healthy, active, and satisfied every day.',77,77),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.153908','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Adult Dog Food Fresh Salmon & Rice Hypoallergenic Dry Food for All Breeds','arden-grange-arden-grange-adult-dog-food-fresh-salmon-and-rice-hypoallergenic-dry-food-for-all-breeds','Arden Grange Adult Fresh Salmon & Rice is a premium, nutri