y dog food formulated for normally active adult dogs. Made with 42% high-quality pork, this recipe provides a delicious and highly digestible alternative protein source, ideal for dogs with food sensitivities. Pork is naturally rich in essential nutrients like zinc, selenium, and B vitamins, supporting immunity, metabolism, and overall well-being. This carefully balanced formula is also egg and maize free, making it suitable for dogs with specific allergies or intolerances. The appetising kibble is designed to appeal even to fussy eaters, ensuring your dog enjoys every meal while receiving complete and balanced nutrition. Free from artificial colours, flavours, and preservatives, Arden Grange continues to deliver trusted, natural pet nutrition—now with refreshed packaging for easier selection.',83,83),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.410176','2026-10-09 07:45:49.000000','en','Arden Grange Senior Dry Dog Food Fresh Chicken & Rice Hypoallergenic Dry Food for Senior Dogs','arden-grange-arden-grange-senior-dry-dog-food-fresh-chicken-and-rice-hypoallergenic-dry-food-for-senior-dogs','Arden Grange Senior Fresh Chicken & Rice is a super premium, nutritionally balanced dry dog food specially developed for older dogs. Formulated by nutritional experts, it provides the right balance of proteins, carbohydrates, fats, vitamins, and minerals to support overall health in senior dogs. This advanced recipe includes boosted levels of glucosamine, chondroitin, and MSM to help maintain joint health and mobility, protecting against age-related wear and tear. Enriched with L-Carnitine, it supports fat metabolism and helps maintain lean body mass, keeping your dog active and healthy. Made with highly digestible fresh chicken, this hypoallergenic formula is gentle on the stomach and suitable for dogs with sensitivities. Free from artificial colours, flavours, and preservatives, Arden Grange ensures trusted, natural nutrition for your dog’s golden years.',84,84),('2026-10-09 07:45:49.424867','2026-10