-food-chicken-400g-pack-of-1','Applaws is a complete dry food specially formulated to help support the physical development of kittens. Grain Free Applaws is made with 80% chicken along with a variety of fruit and vegetables to give your kitten the best possible start in life.',116,116),('2026-10-09 07:45:50.616785','2026-10-09 07:45:50.000000','en','Applaws Complete and Grain Free Dry Kitten Food, Kitten Chicken for all Cats, 2 kg Bag (Pack of 1)','applaws-applaws-complete-and-grain-free-dry-kitten-food-kitten-chicken-for-all-cats-2-kg-bag-pack-of-1','Applaws is a complete dry food specially formulated to help support the physical development of kittens. Grain Free Applaws is made with 80% chicken along with a variety of fruit and vegetables to give your kitten the best possible start in life.',117,117),('2026-10-09 07:45:50.634032','2026-10-09 07:45:50.000000','en','Applaws Complete Natural Dry Cat Food 350g Adult Ocean Fish with Salmon','applaws-applaws-complete-natural-dry-cat-food-350g-adult-ocean-fish-with-salmon','The high levels of Ocean Fish with Salmon in Applaws provide excellent levels of protein, as well as vitamins and minerals to support and nourish. GRAIN FREE Applaws is designed to be naturally hypoallergenic by excluding common allergens. It provides a natural source of Omega 3 & 6 fatty acids and also contains pre-biotic and pro-biotic. Coconut Oil is source of Medium Chain Triglycerides (MCTs) fats which are very efficiently converted to fuel for immediate use rather than stored as fat. Applaws Ocean Fish with Salmon is a complete food for adult cats.',118,118),('2026-10-09 07:45:50.666179','2026-10-09 07:45:50.000000','en','Applaws Complete Dry Food, Adult Cat, Ocean Fish with Salmon, 1.8kg (Pack of 1)','applaws-applaws-complete-dry-food-adult-cat-ocean-fish-with-salmon-1-8kg-pack-of-1','The high levels of Ocean Fish with Salmon in Applaws provide excellent levels of protein, as well as vitamins and minerals to support and nourish. GRAIN FREE Ap