tion without worries. The exceptionally tasty all-in-one pellets avoid selective feeding behaviour. That way your rabbit gets all essential nutrients and stays perfectly healthy. The high-fibre food with long fibres is specifically tailored to the nutritional needs of an adult rabbit. Versele-Laga Complete Cuni adult is developed by veterinarians, based on advanced scientific insights.',129,129),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.208309','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','COMPLETE CUNI JUNIOR (Rabbit)','versele-laga-complete-cuni-junior-rabbit','Protein-rich all-in-one extrudates for (dwarf) rabbits 0-8 months Versele-Laga Complete Cuni Junior is nutrition without worries. The tasty all-in-one pellets avoid selective feeding behaviour. That way your young rabbit gets all essential nutrients and stays perfectly healthy. The high-fibre food with long fibres has a higher calcium, protein and vitamin content - all the building blocks for optimal growth. Versele-Laga Complete Cuni Junior is developed by veterinarians, based on advanced scientific insights.',130,130),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.235772','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','COMPLETE CUNI SENSITIVE (Rabbit)','versele-laga-complete-cuni-sensitive-rabbit','Easily digestible all-in-one extrudates for sensitive (dwarf) rabbits Versele-Laga Complete Cuni Sensitive is nutrition without worries. The exceptionally tasty all-in-one pellets avoid selective feeding behaviour. That way your rabbit gets all essential nutrients and stays perfectly healthy. The high-fibre food with naturally long fibres helps prevent hairballs and obesity. The optimal calcium content and cranberry extract helps to maintain a healthy urinary tract. Versele-Laga Complete Cuni sensitive is developed by veterinarians, based on advanced scientific insights.',131,131),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.255340','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Orlux Mineral Clay Bloc LP','versele-laga-orlux-mineral-clay-bloc-lp','Grit stone for big parakeets and parrots Coarser structure and baked longer, for larger bird species. Composed according to the formula of Loro Parque (Tenerife).',132,132),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.319486','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Tropical Finches','versele-laga-prestige-tropical-finches','High quality seed mixture for tropical finches',133,133),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.365756','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Budgies','versele-laga-prestige-budgies','High quality seed mixture for budgies',134,134),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.428599','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Exotic Fruit Mix 600gms','versele-laga-exotic-fruit-mix-600gms','Premium seeds, grains & fruit mix: a real treat for parrots',135,135),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.448420','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Exotic Nut Mix 750gms','versele-laga-exotic-nut-mix-750gms','Premium seeds, grains & nuts mix: a real treat for parrots',136,136),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.462779','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Parrots','versele-laga-prestige-parrots','High quality grain and seed mixture for parrots',137,137),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.478540','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Big Parakeets','versele-laga-prestige-big-parakeets','High quality seed mixture for big parakeets',138,138),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.501170','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Kristal Shell Sand Dredger','versele-laga-prestige-kristal-shell-sand-dredger','White shell sand',139,139),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.542139','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Prestige Grit with Coral','versele-laga-prestige-grit-with-coral','Ideal food supplement for all birds',140,140),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.563610','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Sunflowerseed Striped','versele-laga-sunflowerseed-striped','',141,141),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.600579','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Sunflowerseed Striped 600gms','versele-laga-sunflowerseed-striped-600gms','',142,142),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.616028','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Omni-Vit Liquid','versele-laga-oropharma-omni-vit-liquid','Multi-vitamin mix for top condition & better breeding Oropharma Omni-Vit Liquid is a liquid mixture of vitamins and amino acids. This product is especially indicated for breeding & condition. Omni-Vit Liquid works fast and effectively, making up the shortfalls in the feeding and ensuring optimum fitness. This product is also very effective against reduced resistance as a result of infections, weakening or stress.',143,143),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.625763','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Omni-Vit Powder 200gms','versele-laga-oropharma-omni-vit-powder-200gms','Multi-vitamin mix for top condition & better breeding Oropharma Omni-Vit is a balanced blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements. This dietary supplement is administrated for optimal condition, better breeding results, optimal development of the chicks and in conditions of weakness or stress. Omni-Vit helps in cases of decreased resistance due to infection.',144,144),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.641570','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Ferti-Vit 200gms','versele-laga-oropharma-ferti-vit-200gms','Multi-vitamin mix for better fertility and vitality Oropharma Ferti-Vit is a well-balanced blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements, enriched with vitamin E. To be used during preparation for the breeding season, for the song of canaries and finches and in cases of laying and fertility disorders or in cases of death in the egg. Ferti-Vit promotes sexual drive and fertility. During the breeding season a bird needs an optimal blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements. The essential vitamin E, also called the fertility vitamin, is a strong antioxidant. The combination of the components in Ferti-Vit is not only optimal for breeding, but also increases the resistance to disease and helps protect the heart and muscular tissue.',145,145),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.654139','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Muta-Vit 200gms','versele-laga-oropharma-muta-vit-200gms','Multi-vitamin mix with methionine for better moulting Oropharma Muta-Vit is a special blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements, with high content of sulphurous amino acids and biotin. This dietary supplement promotes feather development and condition, strengthens the plumage, protects the liver and ensures an optimal metabolism. Muta-Vit helps to prevent fright moulting. During the moult, the bird is subject to stress. An optimal supplement to the feed is necessary then. The sulphurous amino acids in Muta-Vit are essential for the production of keratin, the building material for feathers and skin. Biotin ensures good quality keratin. This guarantees a fast and good moult.',146,146),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.704165','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Oro-Digest 500gms','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-500gms','Intestinal conditioner Oropharma Oro-Digest is an intestinal conditioner. This product prevents the adhesion of pathogenic bacteria in the intestines, ensures a better consistency of the droppings, promotes hygienic nests and prevents the cloaca feathers from sticking together. Oro-Digest serves as a prebiotic or food for the good intestinal flora and will also ensure that the pathogenic bacteria are no longer able to adhere to the intestinal wall so that the natural intestinal flora can recover and the digestion proceeds normally again. The added probiotics help to inhibit pathogens thus stimulating the growth of positive bacteria.',147,147),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.725672','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Probi-Zyme 200gms','versele-laga-oropharma-probi-zyme-200gms','Probiotics and digestive enzymes Oropharma Probi-Zyme is a combination of probiotics and digestive enzymes. This dietary supplement promotes the crop and intestinal flora, increases good intestinal flora, ensures a better digestion of the food and gets the intestinal and crop flora of one day old chicks started. Probi-Zyme contains probiotics. These are good bacteria present in the bird\'s intestines (and crop). In addition to the good bacteria, Probi-Zyme contains special enzymes that promote the digestion of the food eaten. The combination of both, if administered at high doses, guarantees optimal functioning of the digestive system. Probi-Zyme is one of the few products in which the concentration of good bacteria is guaranteed.',148,148),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.739235','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Oro-Bath 300gms','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-300gms','Bath salt for glossy plumage Oropharma Oro-Bath is a special bath salts care product for glossy plumage. It makes feathers more supple, keeps the feet and skin free from scaling and ensures glossy feathers. Oro-Bath has a relaxing function on the muscles and cleans the skin and feathers. Everyone knows that birds like to bathe and also need it. Regular bathing is essential for maintaining the feathers. Adding Oro-Bath to the bath water gives the birds supple feathers and helps them to maintain the strength and water-resistant function of the plumage.',149,149),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.751678','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Calci-Lux 150gms','versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-150gms','Water soluble source of calcium Oropharma Calci-Lux is a high quality, water soluble source of calcium. This dietary supplement is administrated for good egg shell formation, for good skeletal development in young birds, during the breeding season to prevent egg-binding and in cases of calcium deficiency or calcium tetany.',150,150),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.769152','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Calci-Lux 500gms','versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-500gms','Water soluble source of calcium Oropharma Calci-Lux is a high quality, water soluble source of calcium. This dietary supplement is administrated for good egg shell formation, for good skeletal development in young birds, during the breeding season to prevent egg-binding and in cases of calcium deficiency or calcium tetany.',151,151),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.816163','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Can-Tax 150 gms','versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-150-gms','Red colourant based on canthaxantin Oropharma Can-Tax is a red colourant based on canthaxantin. This dietary supplement colours red canaries, intensifies the red colour in other birds and ensures a beautiful even red colour. When adding Can-Tax to the food canthaxantin is transported to the place where the feather is growing and it is given the more intense red colour. The feather formed retains its colour until the formation of a new feather.',152,152),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.836340','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Can-Tax 500gms','versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-500gms','Red colourant based on canthaxantin Oropharma Can-Tax is a red colourant based on canthaxantin. This dietary supplement colours red canaries, intensifies the red colour in other birds and ensures a beautiful even red colour. When adding Can-Tax to the food canthaxantin is transported to the place where the feather is growing and it is given the more intense red colour. The feather formed retains its colour until the formation of a new feather.',153,153),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.857716','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Opti-Breed 500gms','versele-laga-oropharma-opti-breed-500gms','Mix of amino acids, vitamins, minerals & trace elements Oropharma Opti-Breed is a well-balanced blend of amino acids, vitamins, minerals, trace elements, Florastimul® and L-carnitine. This dietary supplement is administrated for good growth, optimal skeletal formation, good egg shell formation and perfect skin and feather structure. Opti-Breed supports general health and productivity and contains all the components your birds need for a good development. Adding Opti-Breed to your own eggfood blends ensures optimal breeding and growth. Florastimul® is a prebiotic, feed for good bacteria in the intestines. It supports the quality of the intestinal flora and ensures a good digestion. L-carnitine supports the growth of the chicks. L-carnitine also supports fat combustion, which results in greater availability of energy for physical exertion.',154,154),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.864985','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Jungle Shower','versele-laga-oropharma-jungle-shower','Feather conditioner Oropharma Jungle Shower is a spray with aloe vera for glossy plumage and a healthy skin. This care product cleans the feathers, restores the balance of moisture of the skin and feathers, limits the loss of feather dust and helps to keep the skin healthy.',155,155),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.889252','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma No-Pick','versele-laga-oropharma-no-pick','Bitterspray against feather pecking Oropharma No-Pick is a bitterspray against feather pecking. This product protects growing youngsters from feather plucking by parent animals and helps to prevent feather pecking and self mutilation.',156,156),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.923487','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Oro-Bath 50gms','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-50gms','Bath salt for glossy plumage Oropharma Oro-Bath is a special bath salts care product for glossy plumage. It makes feathers more supple, keeps the feet and skin free from scaling and ensures glossy feathers. Oro-Bath has a relaxing function on the muscles and cleans the skin and feathers. Everyone knows that birds like to bathe and also need it. Regular bathing is essential for maintaining the feathers. Adding Oro-Bath to the bath water gives the birds supple feathers and helps them to maintain the strength and water-resistant function of the plumage.',157,157),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.946200','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Oropharma Oro-Digest 150gms','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-150gms','Intestinal conditioner Oropharma Oro-Digest is an intestinal conditioner. This product prevents the adhesion of pathogenic bacteria in the intestines, ensures a better consistency of the droppings, promotes hygienic nests and prevents the cloaca feathers from sticking together. Oro-Digest serves as a prebiotic or food for the good intestinal flora and will also ensure that the pathogenic bacteria are no longer able to adhere to the intestinal wall so that the natural intestinal flora can recover and the digestion proceeds normally again. The added probiotics help to inhibit pathogens thus stimulating the growth of positive bacteria.',158,158),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.968158','2026-10-09 07:45:51.000000','en','Crispy Muesli Rabbits','versele-laga-crispy-muesli-rabbits','Tasty, fibre-rich high quality mixture for (dwarf) rabbits Fiber-rich mixture for good digestive system and healthy teeth Enriched with the \"Happy & Healthy\" pellet for optimum condition Easy to use thanks to the handy resealable fresh pack',159,159),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.987649','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Crispy Pellets Rabbits','versele-laga-crispy-pellets-rabbits','Tasty and fibre-rich pellet food for all rabbits Complete pellet food for rabbits Without grains; the all-in-one pellets prevent selective eating behaviour Contains all the necessary nutrients thanks to the \"Happy & Healthy\" pellet',160,160),('2026-10-09 07:45:51.999412','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Crispy Pellets Guinea Pigs','versele-laga-crispy-pellets-guinea-pigs','Tasty and fibre-rich pellet food for guinea pigs Complete pellet food for guinea pigs Without grains, rich in herbs and with a healthy dose of vitamin C Contains all the necessary nutrients thanks to the \"Happy & Healthy\" pellet',161,161),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.047157','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Crispy Muesli Guinea Pigs','versele-laga-crispy-muesli-guinea-pigs','Tasty, fibre-rich high quality mixture for guinea pigs Fiber-rich mixture for good digestive system and healthy teeth Enriched with the \"Happy & Healthy\" pellet for optimum condition Easy to use thanks to the handy resealable fresh pack',162,162),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.069634','2026-10-09 07:4