es the resistance to digestive problems (including in young pigeons).',191,191),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.836877','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma Boost X5 500gms','versele-laga-oropharma-boost-x5-500gms','Energy mix supporting the muscles - in powder form Unique mixture of natural products including amino acids, grape seed extracts, ginseng and gamma-oryzanol for maximum support of the muscles and energy production during flights.',192,192),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.860451','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma Ideal Bathsalt','versele-laga-oropharma-ideal-bathsalt','Orange bath salt Orange bath salt that promotes flexible feathers and a perfect plumage.',193,193),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.881769','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma Boost X5 350Caps','versele-laga-oropharma-boost-x5-350caps','Energy mix supporting the muscles - in capsules Unique mixture of natural products including amino acids, grape seed extracts, ginseng and gamma-oryzanol for maximum support of the muscles and energy production during flights. Practical capsules for individual administration.',194,194),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.903414','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma GLOBIFLY','versele-laga-oropharma-globifly','',195,195),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.921507','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma Recovery Caps 350caps','versele-laga-oropharma-recovery-caps-350caps','Recovery caps Capsules with feed rich in proteins and energy to support sick and weakened pigeons.',196,196),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.946533','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma MUSCLE POWER 150 CAPS','versele-laga-oropharma-muscle-power-150-caps','BCAA capsules for quicker and better muscle building Oropharma Muscle Power capsules are BCAAs (Branched Chain Amino-acids). Those three essential amino acids are valine, leucine en isoleucine, used to prevent muscle breakdown and stimulate muscle building.',197,197),('2026-10-09 07:45:52.967530','2026-10-09 07:45:52.000000','en','Oropharma Omniform','versel