ect choice for regular use',202,202),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.110786','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Regular Range Pet Shampoo & Conditioner with Lavender & Shea Butter – Nourishing Care for Dogs & Cats (Anti-Odour, Calming, Refreshing)','naturepaws-naturepaws-regular-range-pet-shampoo-and-conditioner-with-lavender-and-shea-butter-nourishing-care-for-dogs-and-cats-anti-odour-calming-refreshing','NaturePAWS Regular Range Shampoo & Conditioner is specially crafted to provide gentle yet effective cleansing for your pet’s skin and coat. Infused with Lavender Oil, Shea Butter, Tea Tree, and Vitamin E, this botanical blend offers soothing nourishment while leaving your pet’s coat soft, shiny, and refreshed. The calming lavender fragrance helps neutralize odour, making every bath a relaxing experience. Enriched with plant-powered, pH-balanced ingredients, this formula is free from harsh chemicals, SLS, parabens, and synthetic colors—ensuring safe and regular use. Designed to hydrate and protect, it turns routine grooming into a comforting ritual of care for dogs and cats over 8 weeks.',203,203),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.130768','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Sensitive Junior Puppy & Kitten Shampoo & Conditioner | Aloe Vera, Cucumber & Oatmeal | Hypoallergenic, Anti-Itch & Moisturizing Care','naturepaws-naturepaws-sensitive-junior-puppy-and-kitten-shampoo-and-conditioner-aloe-vera-cucumber-and-oatmeal-hypoallergenic-anti-itch-and-moisturizing-care','Give your little one the gentle care they deserve with NaturePAWS Sensitive Junior Shampoo & Conditioner, specially crafted for puppies and kittens. Enriched with Aloe Vera, Cucumber, Oatmeal, and Almond Oil, this plant-powered formula provides soothing hydration while nourishing sensitive skin and coat. Its hypoallergenic, pH-balanced blend ensures safe, effective cleansing—keeping your pet’s fur soft, shiny, and healthy from their very first bath. Free from harsh chemicals, sulphates, and parabens, it’s the perfect choice for daily love and long-term care.',204,204),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.144101','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Sensitive Adult Dog & Cat Shampoo & Conditioner | Aloe Vera, Cucumber & Almond | Anti-Itch, Hypoallergenic & Moisturizing Care','naturepaws-naturepaws-sensitive-adult-dog-and-cat-shampoo-and-conditioner-aloe-vera-cucumber-and-almond-anti-itch-hypoallergenic-and-moisturizing-care','Pamper your furry companion with NaturePAWS Sensitive Adult Shampoo & Conditioner, specially crafted for dogs and cats with delicate, sensitive skin. Infused with Aloe Vera, Cucumber, Oatmeal, and Almond Oil, this plant-powered, pH-balanced formula gently cleanses while providing soothing hydration and nourishment. Free from sulphates, parabens, and harsh chemicals, it helps reduce itching, hot spots, and irritation while leaving your pet’s coat soft, shiny, and refreshed. Safe for regular use, it’s the perfect blend of science and nature for everyday care.',205,205),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.148831','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Dry Bath Mousse for Dogs & Cats | Waterless No-Rinse Pet Shampoo with Lavender, Argan Oil & Tea Tree | Anti-Odour & Nourishing Grooming Foam','naturepaws-naturepaws-dry-bath-mousse-for-dogs-and-cats-waterless-no-rinse-pet-shampoo-with-lavender-argan-oil-and-tea-tree-anti-odour-and-nourishing-grooming-foam','Give your pets a refreshing bath experience without water! NaturePAWS Dry Bath Mousse is a gentle, no-rinse solution enriched with Lavender, Moroccan Argan Oil, Tea Tree Oil, and Vitamin E. It cleanses, nourishes, and deodorizes your pet’s coat while keeping their skin hydrated and healthy. Perfect for in-between baths, travel, or post-walk freshness—leaving your furry friend soft, shiny, and cuddle-ready.',206,206),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.259201','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Anti-Tick & Flea Spray – Tea Tree & Lemon Grass (Natural, Safe & Healing Formula for Pets)','naturepaws-naturepaws-anti-tick-and-flea-spray-tea-tree-and-lemon-grass-natural-safe-and-healing-formula-for-pets','Protect your pets naturally with NaturePAWS Anti-Tick & Flea Spray, a gentle yet effective formula powered by Tea Tree, Lemongrass, and Chamomile. This non-toxic, lick-safe spray repels ticks and fleas while soothing dry, irritated skin. Enriched with Vitamin E, Allantoin, and Pro-Vitamin B5, it nourishes and heals, making it perfect for daily use during tick & flea season. Safe for dogs and cats over 8 weeks, it ensures lasting freshness, comfort, and protection—without harsh chemicals.',207,207),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.337353','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Anti-Itch Spray – Aloe Vera, Cucumber & Oatmeal (Soothing Relief for Sensitive Pet Skin)','naturepaws-naturepaws-anti-itch-spray-aloe-vera-cucumber-and-oatmeal-soothing-relief-for-sensitive-pet-skin','Soothe your pet’s skin naturally with NaturePAWS Anti-Itch Spray, specially formulated for sensitive and irritated skin. Enriched with Aloe Vera, Cucumber, Oatmeal, Hyaluronic Acid, and Vitamin E, this gentle spray provides instant cooling relief while hydrating and nourishing dry, itchy, or rash-prone skin. Its hypoallergenic, chemical-free formula is safe for daily use, helping pets stay comfortable, refreshed, and irritation-free. Suitable for dogs, cats, puppies & kittens (8+ weeks).',208,208),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.386554','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS All-in-One Pet Wipes – Lavender, Tea Tree & Almond (Gentle Cleansing & Refreshing Wipes for Pets) Wipes 30 pulls','naturepaws-naturepaws-all-in-one-pet-wipes-lavender-tea-tree-and-almond-gentle-cleansing-and-refreshing-wipes-for-pets-wipes-30-pulls','Keep your pets fresh and clean anytime, anywhere with NaturePAWS All-in-One Pet Wipes. Enriched with Lavender, Almond Oil, Tea Tree, Vitamin E, and Provitamin B5, these soft, durable wipes gently cleanse, hydrate, and deodorize your pet’s coat, paws, face, and sensitive areas. Designed for daily grooming, post-walk cleanups, travel, or vet visits, they’re safe for pets and humans alike. Alcohol-free, paraben-free, and pH balanced, they offer a convenient, chemical-free solution for healthy skin and coat care.',209,209),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.449233','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Ear Cleanser for Dogs & Cats – Tea Tree & Witch Hazel | Gentle, Alcohol-Free Ear Cleaning Solution | Soothes, Heals & Removes Wax, Dirt & Odor','naturepaws-naturepaws-ear-cleanser-for-dogs-and-cats-tea-tree-and-witch-hazel-gentle-alcohol-free-ear-cleaning-solution-soothes-heals-and-removes-wax-dirt-and-odor','Keep your pet’s ears healthy, clean, and irritation-free with NaturePAWS Tea Tree Ear Cleanser. Specially formulated with Tea Tree Oil, Witch Hazel Extract, and Salicylic Acid, this gentle, plant-powered solution removes wax, dirt, and odor-causing buildup while soothing itchy, irritated ears. The alcohol-free, non-irritating formula hydrates with natural glycerin, helping to heal and protect sensitive or damaged skin. Safe for routine use, it provides effective ear care for dogs and cats over 8 weeks old.',210,210),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.463591','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Healing Gel for Dogs & Cats – Tea Tree, Aloe Vera & Turmeric | Natural Wound Care for Cuts, Burns, Rashes & Hot Spots | Soothes, Heals & Protects','naturepaws-naturepaws-healing-gel-for-dogs-and-cats-tea-tree-aloe-vera-and-turmeric-natural-wound-care-for-cuts-burns-rashes-and-hot-spots-soothes-heals-and-protects','Soothe, heal, and protect your pet’s skin with NaturePAWS Healing Gel, a gentle plant-powered formula enriched with Tea Tree Oil, Aloe Vera, and Turmeric. Designed to naturally support recovery from cuts, scrapes, burns, hot spots, insect bites, and rashes, this fast-absorbing gel calms irritation, hydrates dry or cracked skin, and helps fight microbial infections. With anti-inflammatory and soothing botanical actives, it provides safe, steroid-free wound care for dogs and cats. A must-have addition to every pet parent’s first-aid kit.',211,211),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.472715','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Paw Butter for Dogs & Cats – Shea Butter, Coconut Oil & Blueberry | Lick-Safe, Non-Toxic Moisturizing Balm for Dry, Cracked Paws, Noses & Elbows','naturepaws-naturepaws-paw-butter-for-dogs-and-cats-shea-butter-coconut-oil-and-blueberry-lick-safe-non-toxic-moisturizing-balm-for-dry-cracked-paws-noses-and-elbows','Give your pets soft, nourished paws and noses with NaturePAWS Paw Butter – a 100% lick-safe, toxin-free balm made with Shea Butter, Coconut Oil, Sunflower Oil, Tea Tree Oil, and Vitamin E. This non-greasy, fast-absorbing formula deeply moisturizes and repairs dry, cracked paws, noses, and elbows, while forming a protective barrier against heat, cold, and rough surfaces. Infused with a gentle blueberry fragrance, it soothes irritation, promotes healing, and keeps your pet comfortable and paw-ready every day. Safe for dogs and cats of all breeds over 8 weeks old.',212,212),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.516645','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Pet Perfume Spray – Aqua Mint & Witch Hazel | Alcohol-Free, pH Balanced Deodorizing Spray for Dogs & Cats | Refreshing Daily Coat Freshener','naturepaws-naturepaws-pet-perfume-spray-aqua-mint-and-witch-hazel-alcohol-free-ph-balanced-deodorizing-spray-for-dogs-and-cats-refreshing-daily-coat-freshener','Keep your pets smelling fresh and clean every day with NaturePAWS Aqua Mint Pet Perfume. Crafted with alcohol-free, pH balanced ingredients, this gentle spray combines refreshing mint and aquatic notes with the soothing benefits of Witch Hazel and Vitamin E. It instantly neutralises unpleasant odours, hydrates the coat, and leaves behind a light, invigorating scent—without irritation or dryness. Perfect for daily use, in-between baths, post-grooming, or while travelling, this safe and natural deodorizing spray is suitable for all breeds of dogs and cats over 8 weeks old.',213,213),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.584526','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Alcohol-Free Pet Perfume Spray – Japanese Cherry Blossom with Witch Hazel & Vitamin E | Safe & Refreshing Deodorizer for Dogs & Cats','naturepaws-naturepaws-alcohol-free-pet-perfume-spray-japanese-cherry-blossom-with-witch-hazel-and-vitamin-e-safe-and-refreshing-deodorizer-for-dogs-and-cats','Bring springtime freshness to your pet’s coat with NaturePAWS Japanese Cherry Blossom Pet Perfume. Specially crafted with alcohol-free, pet-safe ingredients, this gentle spray neutralizes odors, conditions fur, and leaves a long-lasting floral fragrance. Enriched with Witch Hazel and Vitamin E, it refreshes your furry friend’s coat while keeping it soft and irritation-free. Perfect for daily use, post-grooming, or in-between baths, this perfume ensures your pet smells as wonderful as they look.',214,214),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.608307','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Pet Soap Bar with Tea Tree, Coconut & Lime – pH Balanced, Antimicrobial & Nourishing Cleanser for Dogs & Cats','naturepaws-naturepaws-pet-soap-bar-with-tea-tree-coconut-and-lime-ph-balanced-antimicrobial-and-nourishing-cleanser-for-dogs-and-cats','Keep your pet’s coat fresh, clean, and protected with the NaturePAWS Tea Tree & Coconut Pet Soap Bar. Enriched with 100% Pure Tea Tree Oil, refreshing Lime, and moisturizing Coconut Oil, this gentle formula cleanses away dirt, deodorizes, and nourishes without stripping natural oils. Its antimicrobial and soothing properties help protect against ticks, insects, and skin irritations, making it ideal for active pets. Safe for daily use on dogs & cats over 8 weeks old, this soap bar provides a deep yet gentle cleanse with natural care.',215,215),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.614367','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS DentaPaste for Dogs & Cats – Tea Tree Oil Pet Toothpaste | Non-Foaming, No-Rinse, Plaque & Tartar Control','naturepaws-naturepaws-dentapaste-for-dogs-and-cats-tea-tree-oil-pet-toothpaste-non-foaming-no-rinse-plaque-and-tartar-control','Promote fresh breath and healthy teeth with NaturePAWS DentaPaste, a safe, non-foaming, no-rinse toothpaste specially designed for dogs and cats. Infused with Tea Tree Oil for natural antibacterial protection and precipitated silica for gentle cleaning, it helps reduce plaque, tartar, and stains while soothing gums. This pet-friendly formula is free from alcohol, SLS, parabens, and artificial colors, making it gentle enough for daily use. Keep your furry friend’s smile bright and their oral health in top shape with every brush.',216,216),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.630254','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS Pet-Safe Floor Cleaner | White Musk Enzyme & Probiotic Powered | Biodegradable, Non-Toxic, Eco-Friendly | Safe for Dogs, Cats & Kids','naturepaws-naturepaws-pet-safe-floor-cleaner-white-musk-enzyme-and-probiotic-powered-biodegradable-non-toxic-eco-friendly-safe-for-dogs-cats-and-kids','Keep your home sparkling clean and pet-safe with NaturePAWS® Pet-Safe Floor Cleaner. Specially designed for pet-loving households, this eco-friendly formula is powered by bio-enzymes and probiotics to effectively remove dirt, stains, paw prints, and pet odors without leaving any harmful residue. Infused with the subtle freshness of White Musk, it not only cleans but also refreshes your living space. Gentle on all types of flooring — including marble, tiles, granite, vinyl, wood, and laminate — this non-toxic cleaner is free from bleach, phosphates, ammonia, alcohol, and harsh chemicals. Safe for daily use around dogs, cats, puppies, kittens, and kids, it’s the perfect solution for a naturally clean and happy home.',217,217),('2026-10-09 07:45:53.663106','2026-10-09 07:45:53.000000','en','NaturePAWS® Jasmine Pet-Friendly Surface Freshener Spray | Natural Odor Neutralizer for Pet Bedding, Sofas, Carpets & Home | Non-Toxic, Biodegradable & Safe for Dogs & Cats','naturepaws-naturepaws-jasmine-pet-friendly-su