his blend supports overall health and wellness, ensuring your cat gets the essential nutrients needed for a happy, active life. The brown rice offers a natural source of fiber and energy, promoting healthy digestion.',234,234),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.193859','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ProDiet Salmon & Brown Rice','prodiet-prodiet-salmon-and-brown-rice','ProDiet Salmon and Brown Rice is a premium cat food that blends the savory taste of salmon with the nutritious benefits of brown rice. This formula is designed to support your cat’s overall well-being, providing essential vitamins and minerals. Brown rice contributes to healthy digestion and sustained energy levels, making this meal both tasty and beneficial for your feline friend.',235,235),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.217402','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ProDiet Chicken & Brown Rice','prodiet-prodiet-chicken-and-brown-rice','ProDiet Chicken and Brown Rice is a premium cat food that blends the savory taste of chicken with the nutritious benefits of brown rice. This formula is designed to support your cat’s overall well-being, providing essential vitamins and minerals. Brown rice contributes to healthy digestion and sustained energy levels, making this meal both tasty and beneficial for your feline friend.',236,236),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.236830','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Cat\'s Best Original','cat-s-best-cat-s-best-original','As a clumping cat litter, Cat’s Best Original harnesses the power of technologically refined active wood fibres. These fibres are created through the Active Wood Fibre Technology procedure. Liquids and odours are effectively absorbed and encapsulated deep within the pellets. So Cat’s Best Original can be left in the cat litter tray for up to 5 weeks before needing to be fully replaced.',237,237),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.257084','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI Citrus','chipsi-chipsi-citrus','Wood chip litter with a fresh and fruity scent of lemon That smells so good! – CHIPSI CITRUS has a deliciously fresh citrus aroma. The scented litter varieties are made using softwood chips from our forests. They absorb moisture very effectively, so keeping the cage pleasantly dry, ensuring maximum cleanliness and providing an exceptionally fresh and fruity scent, without any recourse to chemicals.',238,238),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.277563','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Chipsi Classic','chipsi-chipsi-classic','CHIPSI CLASSIC is the simple basic litter in pet hygiene, and has proved its worth countless times. Many people with pets swear by it, because their pets just love it. With CHIPSI CLASSIC pets are going to feel just as if they are outside in the great outdoors! The dust-free softwood chips, derived from spruce and fir, are naturally absorbent, give off a pleasant scent and provide a clean environment – and an authentically and pleasantly natural one – for your pet to live in.',239,239),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.299789','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI Sunshine Hay','chipsi-chipsi-sunshine-hay','Your animals will love eating CHIPSI SUNSHINE meadow hay. CHIPSI SUNSHINE meadow hay contains all the vitamins and minerals that your pet needs to stay healthy and fit. This means that you are giving your rodents and small animals a healthy and balanced diet as well as ensuring that their digestion functions in the best possible way. Moreover CHIPSI SUNSHINE prevents rodents’ teeth growing too long.',240,240),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.321326','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI TIMOTHY HAY','chipsi-chipsi-timothy-hay','Your animals will love eating CHIPSI SUNSHINE meadow hay. CHIPSI SUNSHINE meadow hay contains all the vitamins and minerals that your pet needs to stay healthy and fit. This means that you are giving your rodents and small animals a healthy and balanced diet, as well as ensuring that their digestion functions in the best possible way. Moreover, CHIPSI SUNSHINE prevents rodents’ teeth growing too long.',241,241),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.357182','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Cat\'s Best Original 3.0KG(40% Free Cat Litter)','cat-s-best-cat-s-best-original-3-0kg-40-free-cat-litter','As a clumping cat litter, Cat’s Best Original harnesses the power of technologically refined active wood fibres. These fibres are created through the Active Wood Fibre Technology procedure. Liquids and odours are effectively absorbed and encapsulated deep within the pellets. So Cat’s Best Original can be left in the cat litter tray for up to 5 weeks before needing to be fully replaced.',242,242),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.423690','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Cat\'s Best Original 5.2KG (20% Free Cat Litter)','cat-s-best-cat-s-best-original-5-2kg-20-free-cat-litter','As a clumping cat litter, Cat’s Best Original harnesses the power of technologically refined active wood fibres. These fibres are created through the Active Wood Fibre Technology procedure. Liquids and odours are effectively absorbed and encapsulated deep within the pellets. So Cat’s Best Original can be left in the cat litter tray for up to 5 weeks before needing to be fully replaced.',243,243),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.443097','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI Carefresh Confetti','carefresh-chipsi-carefresh-confetti','Cuddle flakes made from natural cellulose fibre CHIPSI CAREFRESH CONFETTI provides a cheerfully colourful, happy and at the same time comfortable atmosphere in the environment of your animal companion. This is because CHIPSI CAREFRESH CONFETTI consists of colourfast, extra-fleecy soft and natural cellulose fibres, which are environmentally friendly and biodegradable.',244,244),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.460343','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI Carefresh Original','chipsi-chipsi-carefresh-original','Cuddle flakes made from natural cellulose fibre CHIPSI CAREFRESH ORIGINAL is the perfect litter for your animal friends if you want to give them a natural cage environment to live in. The extra-long top-quality natural cellulose fibres are environmentally friendly and biodegradable, and they are notable for their high absorbency and effective odour neutralisation.',245,245),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.462357','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','CHIPSI Carefresh Pure White','chipsi-chipsi-carefresh-pure-white','Cuddle flakes made from natural cellulose fibre The extra long, fleecy, soft, bleached natural cellulose fibres of CHIPSI CAREFRESH PURE WHITE guarantee hygienic cleanliness for your small animals and provide a clean feel-good atmosphere in their home. CAREFRESH PURE WHITE is practically dust-free. It is environmentally friendly and biodegradable.',246,246),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.497401','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Joe\'s Cat Clumping Cat Litter 3kg Natural Biodegradable Low Dust Wood Fiber and Recycled Paper Odor Control 600 Percent Absorption Eco Friendly','joe-s-cat-joe-s-cat-clumping-cat-litter-3kg-natural-biodegradable-low-dust-wood-fiber-and-recycled-paper-odor-control-600-percent-absorption-eco-friendly','Joe\'s Cat Clumping Litter is designed for cat owners who care about hygiene and the environment. Made from 100 percent natural materials including two thirds wood fiber and one third recycled paper, this biodegradable litter is safe for disposal and gentle on the planet. It delivers powerful 600 percent fluid absorption, keeping the litter box dry and hygienic for up to three weeks. The low dust formula supports cleaner air and is ideal for cats with respiratory sensitivity. Strong clumping action makes it easy to scoop and clean, while advanced odor control technology neutralizes unpleasant smells to keep your home fresh all day. Joe\'s Cat Clumping Litter is an economical and safe choice for your pet. Enjoy a cleaner, more sustainable litter box experience with a product that combines performance, comfort, and responsibility.',247,247),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.525799','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Chipsi Classic Big','chipsi-chipsi-classic-big','CHIPSI CLASSIC is the simple basic litter in pet hygiene, and has proved its worth countless times. Many people with pets swear by it, because their pets just love it. With CHIPSI CLASSIC pets are going to feel just as if they are outside in the great outdoors! The dust-free softwood chips, derived from spruce and fir, are naturally absorbent, give off a pleasant scent and provide a clean environment – and an authentically and pleasantly natural one – for your pet to live in.',248,248),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.547746','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem FruitBlend Flavor with Natural Flavors Avian Diets Small Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-fruitblend-flavor-with-natural-flavors-avian-diets-small-bird-food','FruitBlend® Flavor with natural flavors provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Parakeets, Budgies, Parrotlets and other small birds that prefer this pellet size.',249,249),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.571320','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem FruitBlend Flavor with Natural Flavors Avian Diets Medium Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-fruitblend-flavor-with-natural-flavors-avian-diets-medium-bird-food','FruitBlend® Flavor with natural flavors provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Cockatiels, Quakers, Lovebirds, Small Conures and other medium birds that prefer this pellet size',250,250),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.592252','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem FruitBlend Flavor with Natural Flavors Avian Diets Medium & Large Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-fruitblend-flavor-with-natural-flavors-avian-diets-medium-and-large-bird-food','FruitBlend® Flavor with natural flavors provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Conures, Caiques, African Greys, Senegals, Amazons, Eclectus, Small Cockatoos and other medium to large parrots that prefer this pellet size.',251,251),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.616405','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem FruitBlend Flavor with Natural Flavors Avian Diets Large Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-fruitblend-flavor-with-natural-flavors-avian-diets-large-bird-food','FruitBlend® Flavor with natural flavors provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Amazons, Macaws, Cockatoos and other large parrots that prefer this pellet size',252,252),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.646135','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem NutBlend Flavor Avian Diets Medium & Large Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-nutblend-flavor-avian-diets-medium-and-large-bird-food','NutBlend® Flavor with natural nut flavors provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Conures, Caiques, African Greys, Senegals, Amazons, Eclectus, Macaws, Cockatoos, and other birds that prefer this pellet size',253,253),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.721518','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem Natural Avian Pellet Diet for Medium Birds','zupreem-zupreem-natural-avian-pellet-diet-for-medium-birds','Natural with added vitamins, minerals and amino acids provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Cockatiels, Quakers, Lovebirds, Small Conures and other medium birds that prefer this pellet size.',254,254),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.754621','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem Natural Avian Pellet Diet Medium & Large Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-natural-avian-pellet-diet-medium-and-large-bird-food','Natural with added vitamins, minerals and amino acids provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Conures, Caiques, African Greys, Senegals, Amazons, Eclectus, Small Cockatoos and other medium to large parrots that prefer this pellet size.',255,255),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.768932','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem Natural Avian Pellet Diet Large Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-natural-avian-pellet-diet-large-bird-food','Natural with added vitamins, minerals and amino acids provides healthy and delicious nutrition for everyday feeding for Amazons, Macaws, Cockatoos and other large parrots that prefer this pellet size.',256,256),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.795063','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem NutBlend Flavor With Natural Nut Flavour Medium Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-nutblend-flavor-with-natural-nut-flavour-medium-bird-food','Daily essential nutrition for medium birds. NutBlend®, with nut colors and flavors adds variety to a bird’s daily feeding program. Includes vitamins and minerals birds need every day. Suitable for Cockatiels, Small Conures, lovebirds, Quakers other medium birds that prefer this pellet size.',257,257),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.826535','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem VeggieBlend Flavor With Natural Flavours Medium Bird Food','zupreem-zupreem-veggieblend-flavor-with-natural-flavours-medium-bird-food','Daily essential nutrition for medium birds. VeggieBlend® with veggie colours and flavors adds variety to a bird’s daily feeding program. Includes vitamins and minerals birds need every day. Suitable for cockatiels, small conures, lovebirds, Quakers other medium birds that prefer this pellet size.',258,258),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.852585','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','ZuPreem Bird Food VeggieBlend Flavor With Natural Flavours For Medium & Large Bird','zupreem-zupreem-bird-food-veggieblend-flavor-with-natural-flavours-for-medium-and-large-bird','Daily essential nutrition for medium birds. VeggieBlend® with veggie colours and flavors adds variety to a bird’s daily feeding program. Includes vitamins and minerals birds need every day. Suitable for cockatiels, small conures, lovebirds, Quakers other medium birds that prefer this pellet size.',259,259),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.867245','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Fruit Blend-ML- 2lb/','zupreem-fruit-blend-ml-2lb','',260,260),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.890602','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Essentials Adult Guinea Pig Food','oxbow-essentials-adult-guinea-pig-food','Essentials Adult Guinea Pig is made with premium, purposeful ingredients to support your pet’s healthy, active lifestyle. We start with high fiber Oxbow Western Timothy hay for healthy digestion and add stabilized Vitamin C and prebiotics to help support whole body health. Essentials Adult Guinea Pig provides your pet with daily recommended vitamins and minerals with no artificial preservatives, colors or flavors.',261,261),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.905859','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Essentials Adult Rabbit Food','oxbow-essentials-adult-rabbit-food','Essentials Adult Rabbit is made with premium, purposeful ingredients to support your pet’s healthy, active lifestyle. We start with high fiber Oxbow Western Timothy hay for healthy digestion and add antioxidants and prebiotics to help support whole body health. Essentials Adult Rabbit provides your pet with daily recommended vitamins and minerals with no artificial preservatives, colors or flavors.',262,262),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.940489','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Essentials Young Rabbit Food','oxbow-essentials-young-rabbit-food','Essentials Young Rabbit is made with premium, purposeful ingredients to support healthy growth and development. We start with high fiber, protein-rich Oxbow Alfalfa hay for energy and healthy digestion and add balanced sources of protein and calcium to help support muscle and bone development. Essentials Young Rabbit provides your pet with daily recommended vitamins and minerals with no artificial preservatives, colors or flavors.',263,263),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.958524','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Essentials Young Guinea Pig Food','oxbow-essentials-young-guinea-pig-food','Essentials Young Guinea Pig is made with premium, purposeful ingredients to support healthy growth and development. We start with high fiber, protein-rich Oxbow Alfalfa hay for energy and healthy digestion and add balanced sources of protein and calcium to help support muscle and bone development. Essentials Young Guinea Pig provides your pet with daily recommended vitamins and minerals with no artificial preservatives, colors or flavors.',264,264),('2026-10-09 07:45:54.983108','2026-10-09 07:45:54.000000','en','Essentials Hamster & Gerbil Food','oxbow-essentials-hamster-and-gerbil-food','Essentials Hamster & Gerbil is made with premium, purposeful ingredients to support your pet’s healthy, active lifestyle. We include balanced sources of protein, fat, and carbohydrates for energy and add antioxidants and prebiotics to help support whole body health. Essentials Hamster and Gerbil provides your pet with daily recommended vitamins and minerals with no artificial preservatives, colors or flavors.',265,265),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.005522','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Alfalfa Hay','oxbow-alfalfa-hay','Sweet, soft Oxbow Alfalfa Hay is a legume hay that is high in fiber, protein, and digestible energy. Alfalfa hay is the ideal hay for growing, pregnant, or nursing pets. Or, offer to your rabbit, chinchilla, guinea pig or other small pet as a treat anytime.',266,266),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.027617','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Botanical Hay','oxbow-botanical-hay','How do you make Oxbow’s Western Timothy Hay even better? By blending it with aromatic, irresistible herbs! Oxbow Botanical Hay is a fragrant, enticing hay that pets can’t resist. We mix Western Timothy with chamomile, lavender, lemon balm and clover to create a one-of-a-kind taste experience pets love. Your pet should have unlimited grass hay every day.',267,267),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.047250','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Western Timothy Hay','oxbow-western-timothy-hay','Oxbow’s all-natural Western Timothy Hay is a nutritious, sweet-smelling grass that will stimulate the appetite of your rabbit, guinea pig, chinchilla, or other small pet. Western Timothy is vet-recommended hay for small herbivores.',268,268),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.067286','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Digestive Support','oxbow-natural-science-digestive-support','High fiber support for your pet’s digestive tract. Natural Science Digestive Support contains high fiber Timothy hay and various herbal ingredients to support the digestive health of rabbits, guinea pigs, chinchillas, rats, and other small pets. Chicory root supports the growth of beneficial bacteria in the GI tract while Ginger Root supports gastric motility.',269,269),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.089416','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Joint Support','oxbow-natural-science-joint-support','High fiber support for the joint health of your pet. Natural Science Joint Support contains high fiber Timothy hay and various beneficial ingredients to support the overall joint health of your rabbit, guinea pig, chinchilla, rat, or other small pet. Glucosamine aids in the prevention of cartilage degeneration, and turmeric and yucca exhibit anti-inflammatory properties.',270,270),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.118449','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Multi Vitamin','oxbow-natural-science-multi-vitamin','High fiber, daily support for your best friend! Natural Science Multi-Vitamin is a hay-based, high-fiber supplement containing essential vitamins to support all of your pet’s body systems. It is also a beneficial source of essential Omega 3 and 6 fatty acids.',271,271),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.142500','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Skin & Coat Support','oxbow-natural-science-skin-and-coat-support','High fiber support for your pet’s skin and coat health! Natural Science Skin & Coat Support promotes the skin and coat health of rabbits, guinea pigs, chinchillas, rats, and other small animals.',272,272),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.194272','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Urinary Support','oxbow-natural-science-urinary-support','High fiber support for your pet’s overall urinary health! Natural Science Urinary Support is a high fiber supplement containing various beneficial ingredients to support the overall urinary health of your pet. Cranberry and Dandelion Leaf support urinary health, while herbs such as Astragalus Root support renal function.',273,273),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.213335','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Natural Science Vitamin C Support','oxbow-natural-science-vitamin-c-support','Stabilized Vitamin C for your best friend! Natural Science Vitamin C contains high fiber Timothy hay and the stabilized vitamin C that guinea pigs need and other animals benefit from during times of stress, illness, or recovery. Offer Natural Science supplements to support the wellness of your small pets.',274,274),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.217350','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Critical Care Herbivore Anise','oxbow-critical-care-herbivore-anise','Developed with the assistance of top exotics veterinarians and nutritionists, Critical Care is the industry standard in recovery nutrition for herbivores with poor nutritional status resulting from illness or surgery. Critical Care contains all the essential nutrients of a complete diet, as well as high-fiber timothy hay to support proper gut physiology and digestion.',275,275),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.231986','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Critical Care Herbivore Apple-Banana','oxbow-critical-care-herbivore-apple-banana','Developed with the assistance of top exotics veterinarians and nutritionists, Critical Care is the industry standard in recovery nutrition for herbivores with poor nutritional status resulting from illness or surgery. Critical Care contains all the essential nutrients of a complete diet, as well as high-fiber timothy hay to support proper gut physiology and digestion.',276,276),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.253686','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Oxbow Critical Care Herbivore Anise','oxbow-oxbow-critical-care-herbivore-anise','',277,277),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.291550','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10647-Natural Science Papaya Support','oxbow-10647-natural-science-papaya-support','',278,278),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.312959','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10553-Garden Select Adult Rabbit Food','oxbow-10553-garden-select-adult-rabbit-food','',279,279),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.326657','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10364-Oat Hay','oxbow-10364-oat-hay','',280,280),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.336859','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10366-Orchard Grass Hay','oxbow-10366-orchard-grass-hay','',281,281),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.356876','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10593-Organic Bounty Adult Rabbit Food','oxbow-10593-organic-bounty-adult-rabbit-food','',282,282),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.396553','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','10134-Critical Care Herbivore Fine Grind Papaya','oxbow-10134-critical-care-herbivore-fine-grind-papaya','',283,283),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.420862','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Rewards Baked Treats Veggies 85gms','oxbow-rewards-baked-treats-veggies-85gms','',284,284),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.440128','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Rewards Baked Treats Cranberry 85gms','oxbow-rewards-baked-treats-cranberry-85gms','Oxbow Simple Rewards Baked Treats with Cranberry are crafted to provide your small pets with a healthy, flavorful reward. Made using high-quality Timothy hay and natural cranberries, these oven-baked treats deliver both nutrition and taste in every bite. These treats are specially designed to support digestive health while also serving as an excellent source of enrichment. Whether you\'re bonding with your pet or simply adding variety to their diet, Oxbow treats are a perfect choice. Free from artificial colors and added sugars, they ensure your pet enjoys only the best.',285,285),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.463789','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Rewards Baked Treats Apple & Banana','oxbow-rewards-baked-treats-apple-and-banana','Oxbow Simple Rewards Baked Treats with Apple & Banana are specially crafted to provide small pets with a naturally sweet and healthy reward. Combining the irresistible taste of real fruits with the goodness of Timothy hay, these treats offer both nutrition and enjoyment. Perfect for adding variety to your pet’s diet, these oven-baked treats also support digestive health and provide essential enrichment. Free from artificial colors and added sugars, they are a safe and delicious choice for your furry companions.',286,286),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.478135','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Energy and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-energy-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-energy-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-55-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional energy concentrate in the multi-crisps contains high-quality oils to improve fish vitality. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',287,287),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.510708','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Algae and Prebiotic for clear water 45 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-algae-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-algae-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-45-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional algae concentrate in the Algae Multi-Crisps enhances fishes’ resistance. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',288,288),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.533440','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Menu Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food 4 in 1 Menu Prebiotic for clear water 64 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-menu-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-4-in-1-menu-prebiotic-for-clear-water-64-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Menu Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This boosts the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish use the fat for movement and the protein specifically to build muscle. TetraPRO Menu combines all the benefits of the various multi-crisps: while the additional energy concentrate in the Energy Multi-Crisps improves vitality, the Colour Multi-Crisps bring out fishes’ natural colouration. The Algae Multi-Crisps promote resistance and the Growth Multi-Crisps encourage growth. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents the additional benefits of the various multi-crisps. They also crumble significantly less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',289,289),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.556440','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','TetraBits Brilliant Colour Fish Food A daily diet for all tropical fishes to enhance natural colour and vibrancy increased nutrient absorption 75 Gram Pack','tetra-tetrabits-brilliant-colour-fish-food-a-daily-diet-for-all-tropical-fishes-to-enhance-natural-colour-and-vibrancy-increased-nutrient-absorption-75-gram-pack','TetraBits Brilliant Colour is a premium daily diet meticulously crafted to enhance the natural color and vibrancy of all tropical fish. This staple food is designed to support optimal fish color development and unparalleled radiance, ensuring your aquatic pets display their most stunning hues. Enriched with carotenoids derived from natural ingredients, TetraBits Brilliant Colour significantly boosts fish coloration, bringing out their inherent beauty. The highly digestible formulation of TetraBits Brilliant Colour ensures superior nutrient absorption, promoting overall health and vitality in your fish. This advanced recipe reduces waste, keeping your aquarium water clean and clear, contributing to a healthier and more beautiful aquatic environment. TetraBits Brilliant Colour is known for its excellent palatability, making it a favorite among various tropical fish species. The slowly sinking granules create enticing movements in the water, stimulating the natural feeding behavior of top and mid-water feeding fish. This dynamic feeding action not only enhances the feeding experience but also ensures that fish receive the necessary nutrition at their preferred feeding levels. Whether you are a seasoned aquarist or a beginner, TetraBits Brilliant Colour provides a convenient and effective solution for maintaining the vibrancy and health of your tropical fish. By incorporating this high-quality food into your daily feeding regimen, you can enjoy the sight of your fish thriving in vivid, brilliant colors, transforming your aquarium into a captivating underwater paradise. Experience the remarkable benefits of TetraBits Brilliant Colour and give your tropical fish the nourishment they deserve, ensuring their natural beauty shines through every day.',290,290),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.578723','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Rubin Flakes 52 Gram Colour-Enhancing Complete Food for Ornamental Fish | Boosts Red, Orange & Yellow Tones | Supports Growth, Digestion & Immunity','tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-52-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-fish-boosts-red-orange-and-yellow-tones-supports-growth-digestion-and-immunity','Tetra Rubin Flakes is a premium complete food designed to naturally enhance the vibrant colours of all ornamental fish, especially red, orange, and yellow species. Enriched with natural colour enhancers, it intensifies fish colours in just two weeks without the use of artificial dyes. Formulated with the BioActive formula, Tetra Rubin Flakes support a healthy immune system, ensuring the overall well-being of your fish. The high-quality protein content promotes strong growth, while prebiotics aid digestion and improve food conversion for maximum nutrient absorption. These highly digestible flakes are carefully crafted to prevent water clouding, keeping your aquarium clear. Suitable for daily feeding, Tetra Rubin Flakes provide a balanced and nutritious diet for a wide range of ornamental fish. For added variety, alternate with TetraMin, TetraPhyll, or FreshDelica.',291,291),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.582246','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks 270gms/','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-270gms','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks is a premium, complete food specially formulated for adult turtles. With 36% high-quality protein, it supports healthy growth, energy, and vitality. This scientifically balanced formula includes an optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to promote strong bones and a durable shell. The unique worm-shaped food sticks are designed for easy consumption, catering to the natural feeding habits of turtles. Additionally, the specialized formula helps reduce unpleasant tank odours, keeping your aquarium environment fresher for longer. Made with natural ingredients and free from artificial colourants, Tetra ReptoMin ensures a wholesome, digestible diet that supports immune health, digestion, and overall well-being. Ideal for daily feeding, it is the perfect choice for turtle owners who want to provide optimal nutrition in an easy-to-feed format.',292,292),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.615241','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Pleco Spirulina Wafers Complete Food Wafers for Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 85 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-pleco-spirulina-wafers-complete-food-wafers-for-herbivorous-bottom-feeding-fish-85-gram-pack','Tetra Pleco Spirulina Wafers offer optimum nutrition for herbivorous bottom-dwelling fish. The proportion of Spirulina in the formula helps to meet the specific nutritional needs of algae-grazing fish. The food is rich in essential fibres that support healthy digestion. Furthermore, the wafers are characterised by great dimensional stability, with all the essential nutrients being retained in the food until the very last bite. Thanks to their solid consistency, the wafers do not cloud the water.',293,293),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.637670','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 30 Gram 75 Tablets','tetra-tetra-funtips-fish-food-for-healthy-feeding-fun-and-exciting-diversity-biologically-balanced-adhesive-food-tablets-good-treats-for-fish-30-gram-75-tablets','Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets for tropical fish. For healthy feeding fun and exciting variety. Feeding fun Complete food,Treats. With their biologically balanced ingredients, Tetra FunTips Tablets are ideal treats for all tropical fish. The two-coloured adhesive food tablets provide your fish with twice the dietary benefits: the orange side is made from shrimps and carotenoids, ingredients that help enhance the colours of the fish to make them more vibrant, while the green part contains several vegetable ingredients as well as premium fats and oils that are essential for healthy and vital fish. The FunTips Tablets include animal constituents such as daphnia, krill and shrimps, which make up over 20 percent of the overall ingredients. However, the adhesive tablets are also made from plant ingredients, including several types of algae. Therefore Tetra FunTips Tablets are made up of 42 percent protein and five percent fat. The adhesive food tablets are more than just a healthy treat for your fish to snack on. The fact that the food tablets stick to the aquarium glass offers a great way to watch your fish up-close and see how they behave. They also make it far easier to take photos of your fish – perhaps even in the case of shy species, which swim up to the adhesive tablets to eat. There is also another major advantage to your fish spending time so close to the glass: you can keep a very close eye on them and detect any possible illnesses. This ultimately enables you also to take targeted action to combat illness, treat the fish and, ideally, even prevent diseases from spreading. All in all, Tetra FunTips Tablets not only make feeding time fun and exciting, but provide a practical way to add healthy variety to your fish’s diet.',294,294),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.674756','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms 48 Grams Nutrient-Rich Gel Treats for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins','tetra-tetra-freshdelica-bloodworms-48-grams-nutrient-rich-gel-treats-for-all-ornamental-fish-with-natural-aquatic-animals-and-essential-vitamins','Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms is a high-quality gel food treat designed to provide a natural, fresh, and highly nutritious snack for all ornamental fish. Containing 30% red mosquito larvae (bloodworms), this complete and balanced food is rich in essential vitamins, minerals, and proteins, supporting fish health, color enhancement, and vitality. Unlike frozen food, Tetra FreshDelica contains up to twice as many nutrients and comes in a convenient, sterile, germ-free gel format. It remains fresh for up to three years without refrigeration, making it a practical and mess-free feeding option. The gel consistency allows for precise and targeted feeding, reducing waste while providing an engaging feeding experience for both aquarists and fish. The soft, worm-like texture of the gel mimics live food, maximizing acceptance and promoting natural feeding behaviors. This treat is available in four varieties—Bloodworms, Brine Shrimps, Krill, and Daphnia—offering a varied diet that complements Tetra’s staple foods. Whether used as a treat or a dietary supplement, Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms ensures a fun, nutritious, and interactive feeding experience for your fish.',295,295),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.698693','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra TetraLuoHan Large Pellets For Fish Magnificent, Brilliant Colouring and Growth 86 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetraluohan-large-pellets-for-fish-magnificent-brilliant-colouring-and-growth-86-gram-pack','Floating pellets for fish longer than approx. 15 cm. For magnificent, brilliant colouring and growth. • Scientifically formulated diet tailored to meet the unique nutritional needs of Flowerhorn Cichlids. • Guaranteed to improve the fish\'s colour and growth. • Carefully selected high-quality nutritional ingredients that Luo Han love to eat. • Superior digestibility reduces water pollution. • manufactured in Germany, meeting the highest quality standard (ISO 9001), including thorough testing procedures to ensure a healthy diet.',296,296),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.722434','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Micro Pellets Complete Food For Small Ornamental Fish 46 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-micro-pellets-complete-food-for-small-ornamental-fish-46-gram-pack','Tetra Micro Pellets are particularly suitable as a complete food for all small ornamental fish which feed in the top and middle regions of the water. With a diameter of 0.4 to 1.2 mm, even fish with small mouths can easily eat the food. The small Tetra Micro Pellets are therefore ideal for small fish as they soften up quickly in the water, making them easy to eat. Tetra Micro Pellets contain top-quality nutrients and have a balanced formula comprising plant and animal based ingredients. As such, they offer everything that plant and meat-eating fish require for a balanced diet that is tailored to their needs. The red pellets also contain carotenoids to enhance the colour vibrancy of the fish, whereas the green pellets are made from plant ingredients to support health and vitality. Furthermore, this complete food is really highly digestible, which helps to keep the water clear. All in all, Tetra Micro Pellets are an ideal complete food for all small ornamental fish as well as young, growing cichlids and marine fish.',297,297),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.749150','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps 48 Gram Nutrient-Rich Gel Treat for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins','tetra-tetra-freshdelica-brine-shrimps-48-gram-nutrient-rich-gel-treat-for-all-ornamental-fish-with-natural-aquatic-animals-and-essential-vitamins','Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps is a high-quality gel food treat designed to provide a natural, fresh, and highly nutritious snack for all ornamental fish. Containing 39% Artemia salina (brine shrimp), this complete and balanced food is rich in essential vitamins, minerals, and proteins, supporting fish health, color enhancement, and vitality. Unlike frozen food, Tetra FreshDelica contains up to twice as many nutrients and comes in a convenient, sterile, germ-free gel format. It remains fresh for up to three years without refrigeration, making it a practical and mess-free feeding option. The gel consistency allows for precise and targeted feeding, reducing waste while providing an engaging feeding experience for both aquarists and fish. The soft, worm-like texture of the gel mimics live food, maximizing acceptance and promoting natural feeding behaviors. This treat is available in four varieties—Bloodworms, Brine Shrimps, Krill, and Daphnia—offering a varied diet that complements Tetra’s staple foods. Whether used as a treat or a dietary supplement, Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps ensures a fun, nutritious, and interactive feeding experience for your fish.',298,298),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.770954','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Arowana Mini Sticks Complete Food With Shrimps and Krill High acceptance for Taste, Growth, Colour and Vitality Bio Active Formula 85 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-arowana-mini-sticks-complete-food-with-shrimps-and-krill-high-acceptance-for-taste-growth-colour-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-85-gram-pack','Tetra Arowana is the highly nutritious food for Red, Golden, Silver, Black and Australian Arowanas as well as other Ostoglossidae species. The food has a high content of Krill and Shrimps for varied feeding. High content of natural attractants ensure great palatability. Natural colour enhancers increase the colourfulness of your fish.',299,299),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.793834','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Wafer Mix 48 Gram Complete & Balanced Sinking Wafers for Bottom Fish & Crustaceans with Shrimp & Spirulina for Growth & Immunity','tetra-tetra-wafer-mix-48-gram-complete-and-balanced-sinking-wafers-for-bottom-fish-and-crustaceans-with-shrimp-and-spirulina-for-growth-and-immunity','Tetra Wafer Mix is a premium, complete food designed to provide balanced nutrition for all bottom-dwelling fish and crustaceans. Formulated with high-quality ingredients, these sinking wafers ensure an optimal and varied diet to support overall fish health, growth, and vitality. With 5.6% shrimp, Tetra Wafer Mix delivers essential proteins and amino acids that promote healthy development. Additionally, 1.5% spirulina algae is included to strengthen the immune system, enhancing fish resistance against diseases. The wafers sink quickly to the bottom, making them an ideal food source for species such as blue antennae catfish, armored scale catfish, and loaches. These wafers maintain their solid consistency, softening gradually without dissolving, ensuring easy intake while preventing water clouding. Their highly digestible formula reduces waste and maintains a clean aquarium environment. With Tetra Wafer Mix, your bottom feeders and crustaceans receive high-quality nutrition for long-term health and well-being.',300,300),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.813693','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Magnetic Cleaner','tetra-tetra-magnetic-cleaner','',301,301),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.834466','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks Floating Fish Food 34g/','tetra-tetra-goldfish-wave-sticks-floating-fish-food-34g','Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks are a complete daily food specially formulated to meet the nutritional needs of goldfish. These highly palatable, floating wavy sticks are designed to make feeding easier while supporting a more natural feeding behaviour at the water surface. The balanced formula provides quality nutrients and a suitable protein blend to support vitality, healthy growth and overall well-being. Natural colour activators help enhance the vibrant, natural colours of goldfish, making them look brighter and more attractive. The sticks are highly digestible and easy to ingest, helping goldfish receive effective nutrition while supporting cleaner and clearer aquarium water. Their floating format also makes it easier to observe feeding and remove uneaten food when necessary. With no added colours or preservatives, Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks offer a practical, tasty and nutritionally balanced feeding solution for regular goldfish care.',302,302),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.854385','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra RedParrot Healthy Staple Food for Superior Colouration and Growth 110 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-redparrot-healthy-staple-food-for-superior-colouration-and-growth-110-gram-pack','Staple food for Red Parrot has been scientifically developed to meet their specific nutritional needs. • Concentrated natural colour enhancers enhance bright red coloring. • Effects are visible within just two weeks of only feeding with Tetra Red Parrot. • Manufactured in Germany, meeting the highest quality standard (ISO 9001), including thorough testing procedures to ensure a healthy diet. • The optimised formula guarantees high digestibility for improved growth.',303,303),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.873778','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra RedParrot Healthy Staple Food for Superior Colouration and Growth 320 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-redparrot-healthy-staple-food-for-superior-colouration-and-growth-320-gram-pack','Staple food for Red Parrot has been scientifically developed to meet their specific nutritional needs. • Concentrated natural colour enhancers enhance bright red coloring. • Effects are visible within just two weeks of only feeding with Tetra Red Parrot. • Manufactured in Germany, meeting the highest quality standard (ISO 9001), including thorough testing procedures to ensure a healthy diet. • The optimised formula guarantees high digestibility for improved growth.',304,304),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.894524','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Pond KOI Sticks Comeplete Food For All Koi Fish For Health, Colour Vibrancy & Clear Water 1.5 kg pack','tetra-tetra-pond-koi-sticks-comeplete-food-for-all-koi-fish-for-health-colour-vibrancy-and-clear-water-1-5-kg-pack','Tetra Pond Koi Sticks contain all essential nutrients, vitamins and trace elements needed for healthy and biologically balanced daily nutrition. Specially developed for koi, the food sticks float on the surface of the water, where they can be easily eaten, reflecting the koi\'s natural feeding behaviour. The high carotenoid content acts as a natural colour enhancer for particularly brightly coloured fish. As the food sticks are highly digestible, the water remains clean and its quality unimpaired. All in all, Tetra Pond Koi Sticks are an ideal complete food product for all koi.',305,305),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.915276','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Pond KOI Sticks Comeplete Food For All Koi Fish For Health, Colour Vibrancy & Clear Water 7.5 kg Gram pack','tetra-tetra-pond-koi-sticks-comeplete-food-for-all-koi-fish-for-health-colour-vibrancy-and-clear-water-7-5-kg-gram-pack','Tetra Pond Koi Sticks contain all essential nutrients, vitamins and trace elements needed for healthy and biologically balanced daily nutrition. Specially developed for koi, the food sticks float on the surface of the water, where they can be easily eaten, reflecting the koi\'s natural feeding behaviour. The high carotenoid content acts as a natural colour enhancer for particularly brightly coloured fish. As the food sticks are highly digestible, the water remains clean and its quality unimpaired. All in all, Tetra Pond Koi Sticks are an ideal complete food product for all koi.',306,306),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.936223','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Pond KOI Sticks Comeplete Food For All Koi Fish For Health, Colour Vibrancy & Clear Water 650 Gram pack','tetra-tetra-pond-koi-sticks-comeplete-food-for-all-koi-fish-for-health-colour-vibrancy-and-clear-water-650-gram-pack','Tetra Pond Koi Sticks contain all essential nutrients, vitamins and trace elements needed for healthy and biologically balanced daily nutrition. Specially developed for koi, the food sticks float on the surface of the water, where they can be easily eaten, reflecting the koi\'s natural feeding behaviour. The high carotenoid content acts as a natural colour enhancer for particularly brightly coloured fish. As the food sticks are highly digestible, the water remains clean and its quality unimpaired. All in all, Tetra Pond Koi Sticks are an ideal complete food product for all koi.',307,307),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.955498','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Goldfish Gold Growth Premium Food For Healthy Growth and Vitality Bio Active Formula 113 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-growth-premium-food-for-healthy-growth-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-113-gram-pack','Premium food for all Goldfish. • High quality proteins promote growth and improve fish condition. • Essential nutrients and special ingredients ensure high digestibility resulting in low waste levels. • With Clean and Clear Water Formula plus BioActive formula to support a long and healthy life. • Excellent digestibility at both high and low temperatures. • Ideal, high quality diet keeps your fish in top condition. • Granules soften quickly making them very easy to eat.',308,308),('2026-10-09 07:45:55.978020','2026-10-09 07:45:55.000000','en','Tetra Goldfish Gold Colour Premium Food For Goldfish for Excellent Colouration Bio Active Formula 75 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-colour-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-excellent-colouration-bio-active-formula-75-gram-pack','Premium granulated food for all goldfish and other coldwater fish - for more intense colours. • Carotinoids, spirulina algae and other colour enhancers ensure excellent colouration. • With Clean and Clear Water Formula plus BioActive formula to support a long and healthy life. • Excellent digestibility at both high and low temperatures. • Ideal, high quality diet keeps your fish in top condition. • Granules soften quickly making them very easy to eat.',309,309),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.001406','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraMin Complete Food For All Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Prebiotic 20 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetramin-complete-food-for-all-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-prebiotic-20-gram-pack','TetraMin is a biologically balanced flake food providing a complete diet for daily feeding of all ornamental fish. The flakes float for a long time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for a mixed stock of fish. This carefully selected mix of over 40 ingredients contains high quality, functional nutrients with essential vitamins, minerals and trace elements. The food also includes prebiotics to improve the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, vitality and colour vibrancy, and keeps the aquarium water clear.',310,310),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.033585','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Cichlid XL Sticks Complete Food For Large Cichlids for Health, Colour and Growth 320 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-cichlid-xl-sticks-complete-food-for-large-cichlids-for-health-colour-and-growth-320-gram-pack','Staple food for all Cichlids and other large ornamental fish. • The sticks float on the surface of the water and suit the fish\'s natural eating habits, due to their worm-like size and shape. • The nutrient content meets Cichlids\' increased requirements for animal proteins and ensures a naturally balanced nutrition, as in the wild. • Promotes well-being, naturally intense colouring and growth.',311,311),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.063657','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Colour and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-colour-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-colour-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-55-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional colour concentrate in the multi-crisps, made from carotenoids, improves natural colouration. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',312,312),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.085774','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Colour and Prebiotic for clear water 20 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-colour-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-colour-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-20-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional colour concentrate in the multi-crisps, made from carotenoids, improves natural colouration. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',313,313),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.109625','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetramin Baby 30gms /','tetra-tetramin-baby-30gms','Complete food in the form of micro flakes, combining high quality and functional nutrients. A full diet for daily feeding of baby ornamental fish up to 1 cm in length that supports healthy growth during the early stage of a fish\'s life. Complete food Strong immune system and vitality Digestive Growth-promoting TetraMin Baby is a biologically balanced micro food with very finely sieved flakes, providing a complete diet for daily feeding of baby ornamental fish up to 1 cm in length. This carefully selected mix contains high quality, functional nutrients with essential vitamins, minerals and trace elements. The food includes prebiotics that support the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, particularly in the early stages of life, and increased resilience. The unique recipe, which is with high-quality natural ingredients, without colourants and added preservatives, promotes a strong immune system and enhanced water quality. With TetraMin Baby, your ornamental fish will thrive, and your aquarium water will stay clean and clear.',314,314),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.129968','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','TetraBits Mini Fish Food A Daily diet for all small and young tropical fishes optimal growth of fish and minimal waste clean and clear water 35 Gram Pack','tetra-tetrabits-mini-fish-food-a-daily-diet-for-all-small-and-young-tropical-fishes-optimal-growth-of-fish-and-minimal-waste-clean-and-clear-water-35-gram-pack','Introducing our premium Daily Diet for Small and Young Tropical Fishes, meticulously crafted to cater to the unique nutritional and size requirements of your delicate aquatic companions. This staple food is specifically developed to support the healthy development of small and young fishes, ensuring they receive the essential nutrients needed for optimal growth and vitality. Our formula contains high-quality protein sources that promote robust growth and overall well-being. Each granule is designed to be exceptionally palatable, ensuring even the pickiest of eaters are satisfied, which leads to minimal waste and helps maintain clean and clear water in your aquarium. The slowly sinking granules create natural movement in the water, stimulating the natural feeding behavior of top and mid-water feeding fish. This feature encourages your fish to feed as they would in their natural habitat, promoting a more active and engaged lifestyle. Key Features: Specialized Nutrition: Tailored to meet the specific dietary needs of small and young tropical fish for healthy development. High-Quality Protein: Supports optimal growth and health. Excellent Palatability: Minimizes waste, keeping the water clean and clear. Natural Feeding Behavior: Slowly sinking granules encourage top-mid water feeding fish to exhibit natural feeding behaviors. Provide your fish with the best possible start in life with our Daily Diet for Small and Young Tropical Fishes. Watch as they thrive, grow, and display vibrant colors, a true testament to their excellent health and well-being. Choose our specially formulated granules to ensure your aquarium remains a pristine and lively environment, filled with happy and healthy fish. For more information on this premium staple food, explore our extensive range of high-quality granules designed for the discerning aquarist who seeks the best for their aquatic pets.',315,315),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.150256','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','TetraBits Brilliant Colour Fish Food A daily diet for all tropical fishes to enhance natural colour and vibrancy increased nutrient absorption 30 Gram Pack','tetra-tetrabits-brilliant-colour-fish-food-a-daily-diet-for-all-tropical-fishes-to-enhance-natural-colour-and-vibrancy-increased-nutrient-absorption-30-gram-pack','TetraBits Brilliant Colour is a premium daily diet meticulously crafted to enhance the natural color and vibrancy of all tropical fish. This staple food is designed to support optimal fish color development and unparalleled radiance, ensuring your aquatic pets display their most stunning hues. Enriched with carotenoids derived from natural ingredients, TetraBits Brilliant Colour significantly boosts fish coloration, bringing out their inherent beauty. The highly digestible formulation of TetraBits Brilliant Colour ensures superior nutrient absorption, promoting overall health and vitality in your fish. This advanced recipe reduces waste, keeping your aquarium water clean and clear, contributing to a healthier and more beautiful aquatic environment. TetraBits Brilliant Colour is known for its excellent palatability, making it a favorite among various tropical fish species. The slowly sinking granules create enticing movements in the water, stimulating the natural feeding behavior of top and mid-water feeding fish. This dynamic feeding action not only enhances the feeding experience but also ensures that fish receive the necessary nutrition at their preferred feeding levels. Whether you are a seasoned aquarist or a beginner, TetraBits Brilliant Colour provides a convenient and effective solution for maintaining the vibrancy and health of your tropical fish. By incorporating this high-quality food into your daily feeding regimen, you can enjoy the sight of your fish thriving in vivid, brilliant colors, transforming your aquarium into a captivating underwater paradise. Experience the remarkable benefits of TetraBits Brilliant Colour and give your tropical fish the nourishment they deserve, ensuring their natural beauty shines through every day.',316,316),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.173971','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','TetraBits Breeding plus Fish food A daily diet for all tropical parent fishes increased nutrient absorption and minimal waste clean & clear water','tetra-tetrabits-breeding-plus-fish-food-a-daily-diet-for-all-tropical-parent-fishes-increased-nutrient-absorption-and-minimal-waste-clean-and-clear-water','A daily diet for all tropical parent fishes to improve quality of spawning. Formulated specially for parent fish to support nutritional demand needed before and after spawning No hormone additives are used The Bioactive Formula contains omega-3 fatty acids and immune stimulators to support the fishes\' immune system Highly digestible food for increased nutrient absorption Excellent palatability for minimal waste resulting in clean and clear water Slowly sinking granules create movements which stimulate natural feeding behaviour for top-mid water feeding fish',317,317),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.194008','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Tortoise 100 Gram Nutrient-Rich Complete Food for Tortoises & Herbivorous Reptiles | Supports Growth, Digestion, Strong Immunity & Shell Development','tetra-tetra-tortoise-100-gram-nutrient-rich-complete-food-for-tortoises-and-herbivorous-reptiles-supports-growth-digestion-strong-immunity-and-shell-development','Tetra Tortoise is a complete and balanced staple food formulated to meet the dietary needs of all tortoises and herbivorous reptiles. This premium formula supports natural growth, digestion, and immune system strength. Rich in essential fibers, it promotes healthy digestion and optimal nutrient absorption. The multivitamin complex and carefully selected minerals enhance disease resistance, while the balanced fiber-protein and calcium-phosphorus ratios contribute to strong shell and bone development. Tetra Tortoise food sticks are highly palatable and easy to digest, ensuring high acceptance by tortoises. Designed for both young and adult tortoises, as well as herbivorous reptiles like green iguanas, this food supports vitality, longevity, and overall well-being. Free from artificial colorants, Tetra Tortoise guarantees a natural and species-appropriate diet for your reptile\'s daily nutritional needs.',318,318),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.215992','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Tortoise 50 Gram Nutrient-Rich Complete Food for Tortoises & Herbivorous Reptiles | Supports Growth, Digestion, Strong Immunity & Shell Development','tetra-tetra-tortoise-50-gram-nutrient-rich-complete-food-for-tortoises-and-herbivorous-reptiles-supports-growth-digestion-strong-immunity-and-shell-development','Tetra Tortoise is a complete and balanced staple food formulated to meet the dietary needs of all tortoises and herbivorous reptiles. This premium formula supports natural growth, digestion, and immune system strength. Rich in essential fibers, it promotes healthy digestion and optimal nutrient absorption. The multivitamin complex and carefully selected minerals enhance disease resistance, while the balanced fiber-protein and calcium-phosphorus ratios contribute to strong shell and bone development. Tetra Tortoise food sticks are highly palatable and easy to digest, ensuring high acceptance by tortoises. Designed for both young and adult tortoises, as well as herbivorous reptiles like green iguanas, this food supports vitality, longevity, and overall well-being. Free from artificial colorants, Tetra Tortoise guarantees a natural and species-appropriate diet for your reptile\'s daily nutritional needs.',319,319),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.236924','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraMini Granules Complete Food For All Small Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Vitalitas Bio Active Formula 112 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetramini-granules-complete-food-for-all-small-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-vitalitas-bio-active-formula-112-gram-pack','TetraMin Mini Granules is a biologically balanced mini-granular food providing a complete diet for daily feeding of smaller ornamental fish. The fine-grained granules soften quickly and sink slowly, making them ideal for fish that feed in the middle of the aquarium. The food contains prebiotics to help support the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, vitality and colour vibrancy, and keeps the aquarium water clear.',320,320),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.259537','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraMin Complete Food For All Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Prebiotic 52 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetramin-complete-food-for-all-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-prebiotic-52-gram-pack','TetraMin is a biologically balanced flake food providing a complete diet for daily feeding of all ornamental fish. The flakes float for a long time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for a mixed stock of fish. This carefully selected mix of over 40 ingredients contains high quality, functional nutrients with essential vitamins, minerals and trace elements. The food also includes prebiotics to improve the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, vitality and colour vibrancy, and keeps the aquarium water clear.',321,321),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.305581','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraBits Complete Food For all Discus and other demanding Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Formula 30 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrabits-complete-food-for-all-discus-and-other-demanding-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-formula-30-gram-pack','TetraBits Complete is the high quality and biologically balanced food for your tropical fish. A carefully selected mix of highly nutritious and functional ingredients provide a complete diet for daily feeding. The food is rich in vitamins, minerals and trace elements for healthy fish. Due to the great digestibility, the nutrients can be absorbed very well.',322,322),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.324718','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraBits Complete Food For all Discus and other demanding Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Formula 93 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrabits-complete-food-for-all-discus-and-other-demanding-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-formula-93-gram-pack','TetraBits Complete is the high quality and biologically balanced food for your tropical fish. A carefully selected mix of highly nutritious and functional ingredients provide a complete diet for daily feeding. The food is rich in vitamins, minerals and trace elements for healthy fish. Due to the great digestibility, the nutrients can be absorbed very well.',323,323),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.342940','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TabiMin 36g, 120 Tablets Complete Sinking Food Tablets for Bottom-Feeding & Timid Fish with Shrimp for Growth, Health & Vibrant Colors','tetra-tetra-tabimin-36g-120-tablets-complete-sinking-food-tablets-for-bottom-feeding-and-timid-fish-with-shrimp-for-growth-health-and-vibrant-colors','Tetra TabiMin is a premium complete food in tablet form, designed to provide optimal and varied nutrition for bottom-feeding and timid fish. These quick-sinking tablets ensure that shy fish can feed undisturbed, as they can be strategically placed in the aquarium. The slow-release formula allows for gradual food intake, preventing overeating and maintaining clean water. Each Tetra TabiMin tablet features a dual-color design, providing a balanced diet. The brown side is rich in algae and essential minerals, while the yellow/beige side contains high-quality fish oil as a source of omega-3 fatty acids, carotenoids for vibrant colors, and trace elements to support fish health. The added shrimp (5%) enhances palatability, ensuring fish eagerly consume the food. With its highly digestible and nutrient-rich composition, Tetra TabiMin promotes strong immune function, vibrant coloration, and overall vitality in bottom-dwelling fish. Whether feeding catfish, loaches, or other timid species, these tablets provide the essential nutrients required for long-term health and well-being.',324,324),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.344569','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks 55 Gram Premium Complete Food for Adult Turtles 36% High-Quality Protein Supports Shell & Bone Health Odour-Reducing Formula','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-55-gram-premium-complete-food-for-adult-turtles-36-high-quality-protein-supports-shell-and-bone-health-odour-reducing-formula','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks 55g is a premium, complete food specially formulated for adult turtles. With 36% high-quality protein, it supports healthy growth, energy, and vitality. This scientifically balanced formula includes an optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to promote strong bones and a durable shell. The unique worm-shaped food sticks are designed for easy consumption, catering to the natural feeding habits of turtles. Additionally, the specialized formula helps reduce unpleasant tank odours, keeping your aquarium environment fresher for longer. Made with natural ingredients and free from artificial colourants, Tetra ReptoMin ensures a wholesome, digestible diet that supports immune health, digestion, and overall well-being. Ideal for daily feeding, it is the perfect choice for turtle owners who want to provide optimal nutrition in an easy-to-feed format.',325,325),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.355644','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks Complete Food for Water Turtles with Natural Ingredients 22 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-complete-food-for-water-turtles-with-natural-ingredients-22-gram-pack','Tetra ReptoMin is a balanced and nutrient-rich complete food for adult turtles. The food contains 36% high-quality protein. This is supplemented by the optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to keep shells healthy and bones strong. The specially-developed food formula of Tetra ReptoMin also reduces unpleasant tank odours and is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants. The Tetra ReptoMin food sticks are specially adapted to the requirements and eating habits of adult turtles, making it easier to feed them.',326,326),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.407635','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks Complete Food for Water Turtles with Natural Ingredients 270 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-complete-food-for-water-turtles-with-natural-ingredients-270-gram-pack','Tetra ReptoMin is a balanced and nutrient-rich complete food for adult turtles. The food contains 36% high-quality protein. This is supplemented by the optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to keep shells healthy and bones strong. The specially-developed food formula of Tetra ReptoMin also reduces unpleasant tank odours and is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants. The Tetra ReptoMin food sticks are specially adapted to the requirements and eating habits of adult turtles, making it easier to feed them.',327,327),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.427171','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Energy Complete Food for Water Turtles Extra Energy for Vitality with Natural Ingredients 34 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-reptomin-energy-complete-food-for-water-turtles-extra-energy-for-vitality-with-natural-ingredients-34-gram-pack','Tetra ReptoMin Energy is a balanced and nutrient-rich supplementary food for turtles. The high content of krill and shrimp ensures that the feed is rich in unsaturated fatty acids (Omega 3). These natural fats are high-quality energy sources and so promote metabolism and strengthen turtles’ immune systems. The optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio promotes healthy shells and strong bones. The specially-developed food formula of Tetra ReptoMin Energy is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants.',328,328),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.449976','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra ReptoMin Energy Complete Food for Water Turtles Extra Energy for Vitality with Natural Ingredients 85 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-reptomin-energy-complete-food-for-water-turtles-extra-energy-for-vitality-with-natural-ingredients-85-gram-pack','Tetra ReptoMin Energy is a balanced and nutrient-rich supplementary food for turtles. The high content of krill and shrimp ensures that the feed is rich in unsaturated fatty acids (Omega 3). These natural fats are high-quality energy sources and so promote metabolism and strengthen turtles’ immune systems. The optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio promotes healthy shells and strong bones. The specially-developed food formula of Tetra ReptoMin Energy is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants.',329,329),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.467247','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Pleco Tablets Complete Food Tablets For All Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 36 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-pleco-tablets-complete-food-tablets-for-all-herbivorous-bottom-feeding-fish-36-gram-pack','Tetra Pleco Tablets offer optimum nutrition for herbivorous and timid bottom-dwelling fish. The two-coloured multi-tablets promote good health, colour vibrancy and vitality. The contained plant proteins contribute to meet the specific nutritional needs of herbivorous fish. Spirulina algae specifically supports good health and vitality, whilst omega-3 fatty acids promote healthy development. Thanks to the tablet form, the food releases slowly in the water. The Tetra Pleco Tablets are particularly ideal for fish like small plecos, Siamese algae eaters, gobies and whiptail catfish.',330,330),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.467539','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Micro Sticks Complete Food for Small Tropical Fish 45 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-micro-sticks-complete-food-for-small-tropical-fish-45-gram-pack','Tetra Micro Sticks are particularly suitable as a complete food for all small ornamental fish which feed in the top and middle regions of the water. With a diameter of 1.5 to 2.5 mm, even fish with small mouths can easily eat the food. The small Tetra Micro Sticks are therefore ideal for small fish as they soften up quickly in the water, making them easy to eat. Tetra Micro Sticks contain top-quality nutrients and have a balanced formula comprising plant and animal based ingredients. As such, they offer everything that plant and meat-eating fish require for a balanced diet that is tailored to their needs. The red sticks also contain carotenoids to enhance the colour vibrancy of the fish, whereas the green ones are made from plant ingredients to support health and vitality. Furthermore, this complete food is really highly digestible, which helps to keep the water clear. All in all, Tetra Micro Sticks are an ideal complete food for all small ornamental fish as well as young, growing cichlids and marine fish.',331,331),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.519018','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Micro Granules 45 Gram Premium Slowly Sinking Granulated Fish Food for Small Ornamental Fish','tetra-tetra-micro-granules-45-gram-premium-slowly-sinking-granulated-fish-food-for-small-ornamental-fish','Tetra Micro Granules provide a complete and balanced diet for small ornamental fish, including young cichlids and marine fish. These premium-quality, slowly sinking granules (0.3-1mm) cater to fish feeding in the middle and bottom layers of the aquarium. With a carefully crafted formula containing both plant-based and animal-based ingredients, they ensure optimal nutrition for enhanced color, vitality, and growth. The red granules are enriched with carotenoids to enhance the natural vibrancy of fish colors, while the green granules contain plant-based nutrients that support overall health and energy. The granules soften quickly in water, making them easy to consume for small fish, ensuring efficient nutrient absorption. With a high protein content of 44% and essential vitamins like Vitamin D3, Tetra Micro Granules promote healthy development, a strong immune system, and sustained energy. Their highly digestible nature helps prevent excess waste, keeping aquarium water clear and reducing pollution. Free from artificial colorants, these granules are an excellent daily food option for small ornamental fish, young cichlids, and marine fish.',332,332),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.544059','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Holiday Fish gel food block provides fish with up to 14 days of nutrition Enriched with extra-tasty daphnia For optimum water values 30 Gram pack','tetra-tetra-holiday-fish-gel-food-block-provides-fish-with-up-to-14-days-of-nutrition-enriched-with-extra-tasty-daphnia-for-optimum-water-values-30-gram-pack','Tetra Holiday provides your fish with an optimum and reliable food supply while you are on holiday. The gel food block provides fish with up to 14 days of nutrition and is 100% edible. It contains all essential nutritional elements to keep your fish healthy. Tetra Holiday provides your fish with an optimum and reliable food supply while you are on holiday and lasts for up to 14 days, depending on the size of your aquarium and the number of fish. Thanks to Tetra’s gel food technology, this holiday fish food is produced on a gel basis rather than as a gypsum block. The main advantage of this is that the food does not negatively affect the water quality in the long term and therefore the water values remain stable. The gel food block with Tetra’s BioActive formula is 100% edible and contains all the essential vitamins, trace elements and minerals that fish need to stay healthy and that are perfectly tailored to their needs. The holiday food is enriched with daphnia to make feeding fish during your holidays a particularly tasty experience. The aquarium fish can nibble at the block as needed, because it does not dissolve by itself. Detail Ideal holiday fish food for up to 14 days 100% edible gel food block Contains all essential vitamins, trace elements and minerals Enriched with extra-tasty daphnia For optimum water values without turning the water cloudy More information gel products Molluscs and crustaceans (Daphnia 7%), Yeasts, Minerals. Ingredients Moisture Content 90,0%. Preservatives, Colourants.',333,333),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.568658','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Guppy Complete Food For All Guppies For Health, Colour & Vitality 30 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-guppy-complete-food-for-all-guppies-for-health-colour-and-vitality-30-gram-pack','Tetra Guppy Mini Flakes have been specially developed for the nutritional needs of guppies and other live-bearing toothcarps such as platies, mollies and swordtails. The balanced complete food is ideal for daily feeding of these fish types. The mini flakes float on the surface for a short time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for fish that feed in the top region of the water. The flake size is designed to suit the small mouths of the fish, making it easier for them to feed. The special combination of nutrients ensures that your fish are getting everything they need. The food is rich in plant ingredients and contains added minerals. This means it is more readily accepted by fish and promotes growth. Meanwhile, the colour enhancers increase colouration. The BioActive formula promotes a healthy immune system. Tetra Guppy Mini Flakes increase vitality and help keep the water clear.',334,334),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.589891','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Guppy Colour Mini Flakes For Vibrant Colours 30 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-guppy-colour-mini-flakes-for-vibrant-colours-30-gram-pack','The balanced mini flakes promote intense, vibrant colours and have been specially developed for the nutritional needs of guppies and other live-bearing toothcarps such as platies, mollies and swordtails. The highly nutritious complete food contains natural colour enhancers and is ideal for daily feeding of these fish types. The mini flakes float on the surface for a short time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for fish that feed in the top region of the water. The flake size is designed to suit the small mouths of the fish, making it easier for them to feed. The special combination of nutrients ensures that your fish are getting everything they need. The food is rich in plant ingredients and contains added minerals. This means it is more readily accepted by fish and promotes growth. The BioActive formula promotes a healthy immune system.',335,335),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.613021','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Goldfish Gold Exotic Premium Food For Goldfish For Health, Colour & Vitality Bio Active Formula 80 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-exotic-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-health-colour-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-80-gram-pack','Premium food for all Goldfish. • Rich in quality vegetable ingredients and wheatgerm which precisely meet the natural feeding requirements of goldfish. • With Clean and Clear Water Formula plus BioActive formula to support a long and healthy life. • Excellent digestibility at both high and low temperatures. • Ideal, high quality diet keeps your fish in top condition. • Granules soften quickly making them very easy to eat.',336,336),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.636493','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Goldfish Flakes 52 Gram Complete & Balanced Nutritious Food for Goldfish with Unique Protein Mix for Growth, Vitality & Clean Water','tetra-tetra-goldfish-flakes-52-gram-complete-and-balanced-nutritious-food-for-goldfish-with-unique-protein-mix-for-growth-vitality-and-clean-water','Tetra Goldfish Flakes is a premium, balanced complete food designed to support the health, vitality, and growth of goldfish. This carefully formulated flake mix provides essential nutrients, including vitamins, minerals, and trace elements, to keep your goldfish active and strong. With a unique protein mix, these flakes ensure optimal growth, energy, and resilience. The high-quality ingredients are free from artificial colorants and preservatives, promoting a natural and nutritious diet. The flakes are designed to float for an extended period before slowly sinking, making them ideal for all goldfish and cold-water ornamental fish. Tetra Goldfish Flakes are highly digestible, helping to reduce waste and maintain clean, clear water in your aquarium. With this complete food, your goldfish will thrive, displaying enhanced color, energy, and overall well-being.',337,337),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.658134','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 8 Gram 20 Tablets','tetra-tetra-funtips-fish-food-for-healthy-feeding-fun-and-exciting-diversity-biologically-balanced-adhesive-food-tablets-good-treats-for-fish-8-gram-20-tablets','Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets for tropical fish. For healthy feeding fun and exciting variety. Feeding fun Complete food,Treats. With their biologically balanced ingredients, Tetra FunTips Tablets are ideal treats for all tropical fish. The two-coloured adhesive food tablets provide your fish with twice the dietary benefits: the orange side is made from shrimps and carotenoids, ingredients that help enhance the colours of the fish to make them more vibrant, while the green part contains several vegetable ingredients as well as premium fats and oils that are essential for healthy and vital fish. The FunTips Tablets include animal constituents such as daphnia, krill and shrimps, which make up over 20 percent of the overall ingredients. However, the adhesive tablets are also made from plant ingredients, including several types of algae. Therefore Tetra FunTips Tablets are made up of 42 percent protein and five percent fat. The adhesive food tablets are more than just a healthy treat for your fish to snack on. The fact that the food tablets stick to the aquarium glass offers a great way to watch your fish up-close and see how they behave. They also make it far easier to take photos of your fish – perhaps even in the case of shy species, which swim up to the adhesive tablets to eat. There is also another major advantage to your fish spending time so close to the glass: you can keep a very close eye on them and detect any possible illnesses. This ultimately enables you also to take targeted action to combat illness, treat the fish and, ideally, even prevent diseases from spreading. All in all, Tetra FunTips Tablets not only make feeding time fun and exciting, but provide a practical way to add healthy variety to your fish’s diet.',338,338),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.678078','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Betta Larva Sticks 28 Gram Complete Floating Worm-Shaped Food for Betta Fish & Anabantids, Enhances Color, Digestion & Growth','tetra-tetra-betta-larva-sticks-28-gram-complete-floating-worm-shaped-food-for-betta-fish-and-anabantids-enhances-color-digestion-and-growth','Tetra Betta Larva Sticks is a premium complete food designed specifically for Betta fish and other anabantids, ensuring they receive a balanced and nutritious diet. These worm-shaped floating sticks closely resemble natural prey, making them highly palatable and enjoyable for fish. With a high protein content of 43%, natural color activators, and essential vitamins, this exclusive recipe supports optimal growth, enhanced color vibrancy, and a strong immune system. The sticks are easily digestible, reducing waste and keeping aquarium water clean and clear. Made with high-quality natural ingredients and free from artificial colorants or preservatives, Tetra Betta Larva Sticks provide a nutritious, well-rounded diet that promotes the overall well-being of your fighting fish and other anabantids. Give your Betta the best with a food that supports vitality, brilliant colors, and a healthy aquarium environment.',339,339),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.699023','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Arowana Mini Sticks Complete Food With Shrimps and Krill High acceptance for Taste, Growth, Colour and Vitality Bio Active Formula 340 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-arowana-mini-sticks-complete-food-with-shrimps-and-krill-high-acceptance-for-taste-growth-colour-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-340-gram-pack','Tetra Arowana is the highly nutritious food for Red, Golden, Silver, Black and Australian Arowanas as well as other Ostoglossidae species. The food has a high content of Krill and Shrimps for varied feeding. High content of natural attractants ensure great palatability. Natural colour enhancers increase the colourfulness of your fish.',340,340),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.724290','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Algae and Prebiotic for clear water 18 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-algae-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-algae-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-18-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional algae concentrate in the Algae Multi-Crisps enhances fishes’ resistance. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',341,341),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.755379','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Energy and Prebiotic for clear water 20 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-energy-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-energy-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-20-gram-pack','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional energy concentrate in the multi-crisps contains high-quality oils to improve fish vitality. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.',342,342),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.786205','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraMini Granules Complete Food For All Small Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Vitalitas Bio Active Formula 45 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetramini-granules-complete-food-for-all-small-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-vitalitas-bio-active-formula-45-gram-pack','TetraMin Mini Granules is a biologically balanced mini-granular food providing a complete diet for daily feeding of smaller ornamental fish. The fine-grained granules soften quickly and sink slowly, making them ideal for fish that feed in the middle of the aquarium. The food contains prebiotics to help support the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, vitality and colour vibrancy, and keeps the aquarium water clear.',343,343),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.814739','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra TetraBits Complete Food For all Discus and other demanding Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Formula 300 Gram Pack','tetra-tetra-tetrabits-complete-food-for-all-discus-and-other-demanding-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-formula-300-gram-pack','TetraBits Complete is the high quality and biologically balanced food for your tropical fish. A carefully selected mix of highly nutritious and functional ingredients provide a complete diet for daily feeding. The food is rich in vitamins, minerals and trace elements for healthy fish. Due to the great digestibility, the nutrients can be absorbed very well.',344,344),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.853778','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Rubin Flakes 20 Gram Colour-Enhancing Complete Food for Ornamental Fish | Boosts Red, Orange & Yellow Tones | Supports Growth, Digestion & Immunity','tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-20-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-fish-boosts-red-orange-and-yellow-tones-supports-growth-digestion-and-immunity','Tetra Rubin Flakes is a premium complete food designed to naturally enhance the vibrant colours of all ornamental fish, especially red, orange, and yellow species. Enriched with natural colour enhancers, it intensifies fish colours in just two weeks without the use of artificial dyes. Formulated with the BioActive formula, Tetra Rubin Flakes support a healthy immune system, ensuring the overall well-being of your fish. The high-quality protein content promotes strong growth, while prebiotics aid digestion and improve food conversion for maximum nutrient absorption. These highly digestible flakes are carefully crafted to prevent water clouding, keeping your aquarium clear. Suitable for daily feeding, Tetra Rubin Flakes provide a balanced and nutritious diet for a wide range of ornamental fish. For added variety, alternate with TetraMin, TetraPhyll, or FreshDelica.',345,345),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.885948','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Tetra Betta 27 Gram Premium Complete Food for Betta & Labyrinth Fish Enhances Colour & Fin Growth Rich in Krill & Shrimps High Protein for Vitality','tetra-tetra-betta-27-gram-premium-complete-food-for-betta-and-labyrinth-fish-enhances-colour-and-fin-growth-rich-in-krill-and-shrimps-high-protein-for-vitality','Tetra Betta is a high-quality, complete food specifically developed for Betta splendens (Fighting Fish) and other Labyrinth fish. This premium formula provides a species-appropriate protein content sourced from krill (6.5%) and shrimp (7%), promoting strong growth and impressive fin development. With natural colour enhancers, Tetra Betta intensifies the vibrant hues of your fish, ensuring they display their brightest and most striking colours. Its high-protein content (43%) supports energy, vitality, and overall well-being. The balanced formula is designed for easy digestion, minimizing waste production and maintaining water clarity. Tetra Betta flakes provide essential vitamins, minerals, and trace elements to strengthen the immune system, keeping your fish healthy and active. Ideal for daily feeding, this scientifically formulated diet ensures optimal nutrition for your Betta fish, enhancing both their appearance and longevity.',346,346),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.912591','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 100 ml Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-100-ml-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',347,347),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.936255','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 250 ml Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-250-ml-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',348,348),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.959373','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 500 ml Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-500-ml-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',349,349),('2026-10-09 07:45:56.983057','2026-10-09 07:45:56.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 1 Ltr Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-1-ltr-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',350,350),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.006223','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 5 Ltr ml Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-5-ltr-ml-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',351,351),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.027583','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Rex Wheat Germ Oil 20 ml Rich In Vitamin E, Omega 3 & 6 For Healthy Skin & Shiny Coat Help For Breeding For Dogs Cats Horses Rabbits Guinea Pigs Ferrets Hamsters Birds Parrots Canaries No Preservatives','rex-rex-wheat-germ-oil-20-ml-rich-in-vitamin-e-omega-3-and-6-for-healthy-skin-and-shiny-coat-help-for-breeding-for-dogs-cats-horses-rabbits-guinea-pigs-ferrets-hamsters-birds-parrots-canaries-no-preservatives','REX wheat germ oil is 100% Pure with no preservatives, loaded with natural nutrients like Vitamin E and Essential Fatty Acids to provide animals with benefits for skin, coat and overall health. Veterinarians and professional animal organizations have been using and recommending REX Pure wheat germ oil over wheat germ oil blends diluted with soy oil for over 80 years.',352,352),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.049441','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','ProDen PlaqueOff Powder Supports Normal, Healthy Teeth, Gums, and Breath Odour in Dogs','sweden-care-proden-plaqueoff-powder-supports-normal-healthy-teeth-gums-and-breath-odour-in-dogs','ProDen PlaqueOff Powder is your 100% natural and easy solution to pet oral problems – just sprinkle the powder once a day on dry or wet food to reduce problems and pain in the future, as well as treating bad breath today. ProDen PlaqueOff Powder is approved by the VOHC (Veterinary Oral Health Council) and is available for both dogs and cats. ProDen PlaqueOff® Powder is a 100% natural pet food supplement containing the natural and organic seaweed ingredient A.N ProDen™ – shown in clinical trials to reduce plaque and tartar and to improve bad breath. The results are usually seen between 3 to 8 weeks, with continued use. Sprinkle the powder over the dog’s ordinary food once a day with the supplied scoop. For a 10kg dog, a 60g bottle lasts roughly 6 months.',353,353),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.088708','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','ProDen Plague Off Original PlaqueOff for Cats, Natural Tooth Care Powder, Protects Against Bad Breath, Helps with Tartar and Plaque, Pack of 1 (1 x 20 g), Feed Supplement for Cats','sweden-care-proden-plague-off-original-plaqueoff-for-cats-natural-tooth-care-powder-protects-against-bad-breath-helps-with-tartar-and-plaque-pack-of-1-1-x-20-g-feed-supplement-for-cats','ProDen PlaqueOff® Powder Cat The natural kelp ingredient A.N ProDen™ helps control and improve plaque, tartar and bad breath when used as directed. Dosage: One scoop daily. A dose contains 330mg. Cats having problems with the thyroid gland must be careful with their intake of iodine. Since kelp, including our unique ingredient, have a haturally high iodine content, we do not recommend that cats with thyroid problems use this product. Store in a cool, dry place.',354,354),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.128144','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Earth Rated Dog Poop Bag Holder with Poop Bags Durable and Leakproof Unscented Made from recycled plastic 1 Dispenser and 15 Bags In 1 Roll','earth-rated-earth-rated-dog-poop-bag-holder-with-poop-bags-durable-and-leakproof-unscented-made-from-recycled-plastic-1-dispenser-and-15-bags-in-1-roll','Introducing the ultimate companion for responsible pet owners - the Poop Bag Dispenser! Engineered for convenience and durability, this lightweight dispenser is your go-to solution for hassle-free cleanups on the go. With its click-and-lock closure, rest assured that your bags stay securely in place until you need them. Crafted with a sturdy, minimal-swing silicone strap, this dispenser effortlessly attaches to any style of leash, ensuring it\'s always within reach when Your pets nature calls. Say goodbye to juggling bags and leashes - our signature hook keeps used bags securely in place, leaving your hands free and clean until you reach the nearest trash bin. Gone are the days of chasing runaway rolls - our locking mechanism keeps bags neatly contained, ready for whenever duty calls. Versatile and easy to use, this dispenser seamlessly integrates into your daily walks, providing peace of mind and convenience with every step. Elevate your pet parenting experience with the Poop Bag Dispenser - because keeping your surroundings clean shouldn\'t be a chore, but a breeze.',355,355),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.176805','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Earth Rated Dog Poop Bag Refill Extra long strong and leak-proof scented Lavender from recycled plastic 60 Bags In 4 Rolls','earth-rated-earth-rated-dog-poop-bag-refill-extra-long-strong-and-leak-proof-scented-lavender-from-recycled-plastic-60-bags-in-4-rolls','Introducing our versatile, eco-conscious waste management solution! Whether you\'re strolling through the park with your furry friend or embarking on an outdoor adventure, our bags are designed to meet your needs with unparalleled convenience and sustainability. Crafted for durability and reliability, these bags boast extra length and strength, ensuring a hassle-free cleanup experience every time. With a leak-proof, you can bid farewell to messy mishaps and focus on enjoying your outings to the fullest. But that\'s not all – our commitment to the planet goes beyond functionality. Made from 65% certified post-consumer recycled plastic, each bag breathes new life into over 5 million pounds of plastic waste annually. By choosing our bags, you\'re not only keeping your surroundings clean but also contributing to a greener, healthier planet for generations to come. Whether you prefer to use them on their own or pair them with our convenient dispenser, these bags fit seamlessly into your daily routine. Slip them into your pocket, treat pouch, backpack, car, or stroller, ensuring you\'re always prepared for any cleanup situation that arises. Join us in our mission to make a positive impact on the environment, one waste bag at a time. With our extra-long, extra-strong, and eco-friendly solution by your side, you can take on the world with confidence, knowing you\'re doing your part to protect our planet.g Scented-Lavender-60 Bags in 4 Rolls',356,356),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.203699','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Earth Rated Dog Poop Bag Refill Extra long strong and leak-proof Unscented From recy