-wipes-for-gentle-cleaning-of-paws-body-and-bums','Say goodbye to muddy paws and dirty fur with our gentle grooming wipes. Perfect for busy pet parents who want quick, effective cleaning without the hassle of a full bath. Enriched with soothing chamomile, moisturizing aloe vera, nourishing shea butter, refreshing cucumber extract, antioxidant pomegranate, and protective vitamin E. Available in unscented and calming lavender varieties.',363,363),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.374342','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Earth Rated Hypoallergenic Ear Wipes for Dogs and Cats, Wild Oat Scent,','earth-rated-earth-rated-hypoallergenic-ear-wipes-for-dogs-and-cats-wild-oat-scent','Simplify ear care for your dog and cat with easy to use Earth Rated Pet Ear Wipes. Hypoallergenic and formulated with soothing aloe vera, each wipe measures 5 in x 5 in/12.7 cm x 12.7 cm - large enough to give both ears a good clean. Made from 100% FSC-Certified plant-based viscose fibres, this super soft material is durable enough to lift dirt, wax buildup, and unpleasant odors, gently and effectively. These wipes are Leaping Bunny cruelty-free certified and contain the perfect amount of moisture. Wild Oat scent keeps dogs\' ears smelling fresh. No added alcohol and free from parabens, sulphates, EDTA and propylene glycol. Earth Rated Pet Ear Wipes are thoughtfully designed to cleanse the sensitive folds, flaps, and fur of your dog\'s ears in just a few swipes.',364,364),('2026-10-09 07:45:57.391336','2026-10-09 07:45:57.000000','en','Earth Rated Hypoallergenic Eye Wipes for Dogs and Cats, Fragrance-Free,','earth-rated-earth-rated-hypoallergenic-eye-wipes-for-dogs-and-cats-fragrance-free','Cleanse your dog or cat\'s eyes and reduce tear stains in a blink with Earth Rated Pet Eye Wipes. Hypoallergenic and formulated with calming chamomile and the perfect amount of moisture, each wipe measures 5 in x 5 in/ 12.7 cm x 12.7 cm - large enough to give both eyes a good clean. Made from 100% FSC-Certified plant-based viscose fibres, this super soft material is durable enough to lift dirt, discharge, and brown or reddish stains around the eyes, gently and effectively. Leaping Bunny cruelty-free certified and fragrance-free for a non-irritating clean. Earth Rated Pet Eye Wipes are thoughtfully designed to help you take care of your pet\'s eyes in just a few swipes.',365,365);
