e Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed','Intersand Odourlock Calming Breeze Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 6 kg','Our OdourLock mineral litter is produced from high-quality clay 100% pure and natural for maximum efficiency without compromise:','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-calming-breeze-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammonia-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed','ODOURLOCK-INTERSAND-ODOURLOCK-CALMING-BREEZE-CAT-LITTER-MOISTURE-ACTIVATED-FRAGRANCE-BLOCK-AMMONIA-QUICK-ABSORPTION-NO-TRACKING-AND-DUST-FREE-FOR-ALL-BREED-F-21406-WEIGHT-6-KG','4,6,2,3,7,5,1','4,6,11,12,13,19,23,206,210','6,159,163','cat,cat-clean-and-hygiene,cat-clean-and-hygiene-cat-litter','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791532141/petsupright/preview-02-odourlock-intersand-odourlock-calming-breeze-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragr-1jzvuadn4wjrpeymqu1lqvmyxaicia-rw__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,27,1,13,98,NULL,144068,170000),('en',1,'Intersand Odourlock Baby Powder Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 Kg Bag','Intersand Odourlock Baby Powder Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 Kg Bag 12 kg','Thanks to its patented technology, our OdourLock litter neutralizes ammonia formation for unparalleled control of urine and feces odours. Cat urine does not contain ammonia per se; rather, it is formed in the litter box when the urine comes into contact with oxygen and develops bacteria. Ammonia is responsible for the unpleasant smell that comes from the litter box. Our technology is activated when it comes into contact with urine to neutralize odours for more than 40 days. OdourLock is perfect for a multi-cat environment: Just scoop once a day for optimal cleanliness that will delight you and your cats! Our OdourLock litter is made of a 100% pure natural clay, sodium bentonite. This mineral essential to our exclusive formula comes directly from Wyoming mines. We pay close attention to its extraction and processing to ensure a clay of very high quality while respecting the environment. The high capacity and rapid absorption of our litter allows the formation of smaller and stronger clumps, which greatly facilitates cleaning and daily maintenance. OdourLock can absorb up to 6 times its weight in liquid! As it generates less waste, it lasts longer than a competing litter and therefore costs you less. The amount of litter used each year can be reduced by up to 45%!','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-baby-powder-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammonia-quick-absorption-no-tracking-and-dust-free-for-all-breed-12-kg-bag','ODOURLOCK-INTERSAND-ODOURLOCK-BABY-POWDER-CAT-LITTER-MOISTURE-ACTIVATED-FRAGRANCE-BLOCK-AMMONIA-QUICK-ABSORPTION-NO-TRACKING-AND-DUST-FREE-FOR-ALL-BREED-12-KG-BAG-F-21012-WEIGHT-12-KG','4,6,2,3,7,5,1','4,6,11,12,13,19,23,206,210','6,159,163','cat,cat-clean-and-hygiene,cat-clean-and-hygiene-cat-litter','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791532179/petsupright/preview-8a-odourlock-intersand-odourlock-baby-powder-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragranc-1j8vn7v2qchcqsvi1p85plhre7jsrbuf7__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,28,1,14,114,NULL,237288,280000),('en',1,'Intersand Odourlock Calming Breeze Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed','Intersand Odourlock Calming Breeze Cat Litter Moisture Activated Fragrance Block Ammonia Quick Absorption No Tracking and Dust Free For All Breed 12 kg','Our OdourLock mineral litter is produced from high-quality clay 100% pure and natural for maximum efficiency without compromise:','odourlock-intersand-odourlock-calming-breeze-cat-litter-moisture-activated-fragrance-block-ammo