nd-immunity','VITAPOL-VITAPOL-KARMEO-PREMIUM-FOOD-FOR-GUINEA-PIGS-400-GRAM-HIGH-FIBER-COMPLETE-DIET-WITH-CARROT-PARSNIP-BEETROOT-BLACK-CURRANTS-AND-THYME-SUPPORTS-DIGESTION-AND-IMMUNITY-ZVP-0131-WEIGHT-0-4-KG','4,6,3,1,5,7,2','4,6,12,24,26,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food-dry-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791532342/petsupright/preview-66-vitapol-vitapol-karmeo-premium-food-for-guinea-pigs-400-gram-high-fiber-complete-1jotybxqhtjmyez-1hdyo26vimxnm3ci3__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,48,1,30,172,NULL,21186,25000),('en',1,'Vitapol Small Animal Food For Hamster','Vitapol Small Animal Food For Hamster 0.4 kg','Complete mixture for hamsters, properly balanced, which includes components of the diet of rodents found in the natural environment. It is a mixture of the best quality grains, seeds and granules. In addition, the food has been enriched with extruded ingredients with a composition and shape adapted to the nutritional requirements of this species of rodents. This makes the food more digestible. The feed has also been enriched with carrots, legumes and carob. Carob provides many vitamins such as A, B2, B3, D, E and mineral salts: calcium, phosphorus, potassium, magnesium and iron. It has a positive effect on the digestive system and contributes to lowering the level of cholesterol in the blood. The addition of carrots with a high content of beta-carotene, i.e. provitamin A, provides important minerals such as calcium, iron, phosphorus, copper, zinc, molybdenum, magnesium, iodine and potassium. The addition of linseed, rich in unsaturated fatty acids, affects the skin and coat, improving their overall condition. The varied composition ensures that the food is tasty, attractive and provides the necessary nutrients for the proper development and functioning of the hamster\'s organism.','vitapol-vitapol-small-animal-food-for-hamster',