.4','Arden Grange Kitten Grain Free Dry Cat Food with Fresh Chicken & Potato is a premium complete diet designed to support your kitten’s healthy growth from weaning up to 12 months. Crafted with fresh chicken as a primary ingredient, this high-protein recipe helps build strong muscles while being highly palatable for even the fussiest eaters. This grain-free cat food contains no added cereals, making it ideal for kittens with sensitive stomachs or grain intolerance. The carefully balanced formula is enriched with essential vitamins and minerals to promote healthy bones, a strong immune system, and optimal digestion. The small kibble size is designed for young kittens, ensuring easy chewing and better nutrient absorption. Additionally, this nutritionally complete formula is suitable for pregnant and lactating cats, providing the extra energy and nourishment required during this critical stage. Whether you’re raising a playful kitten or caring for a mother cat, Arden Grange ensures premium nutrition, great taste, and overall wellbeing in every bite.','arden-grange-arden-grange-kitten-grain-free-dry-cat-food-with-fresh-chicken-and-potato','ARDEN-GRANGE-ARDEN-GRANGE-KITTEN-GRAIN-FREE-DRY-CAT-FOOD-WITH-FRESH-CHICKEN-AND-POTATO-F-KIT5015-WEIGHT-0-4','5,2,7,1,3','5,11,13,14,49,50,181','6,7,134','cat,cat-food,cat-food-dry-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791532687/petsupright/preview-8e-arden-grange-arden-grange-kitten-grain-free-dry-cat-food-with-fresh-chicken-and-1dhuc-pmlxuduntq9oyqoaqwibzj0foei__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,91,1,72,302,NULL,88983,105000),('en',1,'Arden Grange Weaning Puppy Fresh Chicken Dry Dog Food','Arden Grange Weaning Puppy Fresh Chicken Dry Dog Food 2','Arden Grange Weaning / Puppy Dry Dog Food with Fresh Chicken & Rice is a premium complete diet designed for weaning puppies from as early as 3 weeks of age. With a high chicken content of 44%, this nutrient-rich formula provides high-quality protein to support muscle d