r breeding results, optimal development of the chicks and in conditions of weakness or stress. Omni-Vit helps in cases of decreased resistance due to infection.','versele-laga-oropharma-omni-vit-powder-200gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-OMNI-VIT-POWDER-200GMS-460204-WEIGHT-0-2-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,36,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533129/petsupright/preview-11-versele-laga-oropharma-omni-vit-powder-200gms-1b6dypkcmjkh-gpynmk5up9ekic1bevei__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,211,1,144,654,NULL,199153,235000),('en',1,'Oropharma Ferti-Vit 200gms','Oropharma Ferti-Vit 200gms 0.2 kg','Multi-vitamin mix for better fertility and vitality Oropharma Ferti-Vit is a well-balanced blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements, enriched with vitamin E. To be used during preparation for the breeding season, for the song of canaries and finches and in cases of laying and fertility disorders or in cases of death in the egg. Ferti-Vit promotes sexual drive and fertility. During the breeding season a bird needs an optimal blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements. The essential vitamin E, also called the fertility vitamin, is a strong antioxidant. The combination of the components in Ferti-Vit is not only optimal for breeding, but also increases the resistance to disease and helps protect the heart and muscular tissue.','versele-laga-oropharma-ferti-vit-200gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-FERTI-VIT-200GMS-460206-WEIGHT-0-2-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,36,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533132/petsupright/preview-f9-versele-laga-oropharma-ferti-vit-200gms-1oldsmdfgopds4bzwbb5fgnnahc52dm1m__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,212,1,145,657,NULL,199153,235000),('en',1,'Oropharma Muta-Vit 200gms','Oropharma Muta-Vit 200gms 0.2 kg','Multi-vitamin mix with methionine for better moulting Oropharma Muta-Vit is a special blend of vitamins, amino acids and trace elements, with high content of sulphurous amino acids and biotin. This dietary supplement promotes feather development and condition, strengthens the plumage, protects the liver and ensures an optimal metabolism. Muta-Vit helps to prevent fright moulting. During the moult, the bird is subject to stress. An optimal supplement to the feed is necessary then. The sulphurous amino acids in Muta-Vit are essential for the production of keratin, the building material for feathers and skin. Biotin ensures good quality keratin. This guarantees a fast and good moult.','versele-laga-oropharma-muta-vit-200gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-MUTA-VIT-200GMS-460208-WEIGHT-0-2-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,36,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533130/petsupright/preview-59-versele-laga-oropharma-muta-vit-200gms-1feppjrmode3yw7nwtq6owp5pszthlz3l__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,213,1,146,656,NULL,199153,235000),('en',1,'Oropharma Oro-Digest 500gms','Oropharma Oro-Digest 500gms 0.5 kg','Intestinal conditioner Oropharma Oro-Digest is an intestinal conditioner. This product prevents the adhesion of pathogenic bacteria in the intestines, ensures a better consistency of the droppings, promotes hygienic nests and prevents the cloaca feathers from sticking together. Oro-Digest serves as a prebiotic or food for the good intestinal flora and will also ensure that the pathogenic bacteria are no longer able to adhere to the intestinal wall so that the natural intestinal flora can recover and the digestion proceeds normally again. The added probiotics help to inhibit pathogens thus stimulating the growth of positive bacteria.','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-500gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-ORO-DIGEST-500GMS-460210-WEIGHT-0-5-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533135/petsupright/preview-0e-versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-500gms-1zkbtq-fstfpx-xkmlsjxsuiimm2rxu01__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,214,1,147,658,NULL,457627,540000),('en',1,'Oropharma Probi-Zyme 200gms','Oropharma Probi-Zyme 200gms 0.2 kg','Probiotics and digestive enzymes Oropharma Probi-Zyme is a combination of probiotics and digestive enzymes. This dietary supplement promotes the crop and intestinal flora, increases good intestinal flora, ensures a better digestion of the food and gets the intestinal and crop flora of one day old chicks started. Probi-Zyme contains probiotics. These are good bacteria present in the bird\'s intestines (and crop). In addition to the good bacteria, Probi-Zyme contains special enzymes that promote the digestion of the food eaten. The combination of both, if administered at high doses, guarantees optimal functioning of the digestive system. Probi-Zyme is one of the few products in which the concentration of good bacteria is guaranteed.','versele-laga-oropharma-probi-zyme-200gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-PROBI-ZYME-200GMS-460211-WEIGHT-0-2-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533136/petsupright/preview-b7-versele-laga-oropharma-probi-zyme-200gms-1wrvnwt65abikj9t-ds3sllqx0zhkyxjg__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,215,1,148,659,NULL,305085,360000),('en',1,'Oropharma Oro-Bath 300gms','Oropharma Oro-Bath 300gms 0.3 kg','Bath salt for glossy plumage Oropharma Oro-Bath is a special bath salts care product for glossy plumage. It makes feathers more supple, keeps the feet and skin free from scaling and ensures glossy feathers. Oro-Bath has a relaxing function on the muscles and cleans the skin and feathers. Everyone knows that birds like to bathe and also need it. Regular bathing is essential for maintaining the feathers. Adding Oro-Bath to the bath water gives the birds supple feathers and helps them to maintain the strength and water-resistant function of the plumage.','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-300gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-ORO-BATH-300GMS-460213-WEIGHT-0-3-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533141/petsupright/preview-f2-versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-300gms-1iy-7tih6ncnxxhndxugdtcrrfyuhiab6__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,216,1,149,662,NULL,194915,230000),('en',1,'Oropharma Calci-Lux 150gms','Oropharma Calci-Lux 150gms 0.15 kg','Water soluble source of calcium Oropharma Calci-Lux is a high quality, water soluble source of calcium. This dietary supplement is administrated for good egg shell formation, for good skeletal development in young birds, during the breeding season to prevent egg-binding and in cases of calcium deficiency or calcium tetany.','versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-150gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-CALCI-LUX-150GMS-460214-WEIGHT-0-15-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533137/petsupright/preview-eb-versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-150gms-1y98ggwzdjch7-htyqfdkrsed7j1l5ydq__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,217,1,150,660,NULL,169492,200000),('en',1,'Oropharma Calci-Lux 500gms','Oropharma Calci-Lux 500gms 0.5 kg','Water soluble source of calcium Oropharma Calci-Lux is a high quality, water soluble source of calcium. This dietary supplement is administrated for good egg shell formation, for good skeletal development in young birds, during the breeding season to prevent egg-binding and in cases of calcium deficiency or calcium tetany.','versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-500gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-CALCI-LUX-500GMS-460215-WEIGHT-0-5-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533139/petsupright/preview-4f-versele-laga-oropharma-calci-lux-500gms-1twytfrdaesxzmanmebskoftri6hzhuwj__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,218,1,151,661,NULL,279661,330000),('en',1,'Oropharma Can-Tax 150 gms','Oropharma Can-Tax 150 gms 0.15 kg','Red colourant based on canthaxantin Oropharma Can-Tax is a red colourant based on canthaxantin. This dietary supplement colours red canaries, intensifies the red colour in other birds and ensures a beautiful even red colour. When adding Can-Tax to the food canthaxantin is transported to the place where the feather is growing and it is given the more intense red colour. The feather formed retains its colour until the formation of a new feather.','versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-150-gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-CAN-TAX-150-GMS-460217-WEIGHT-0-15-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533143/petsupright/preview-f9-versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-150-gms-1cr-gv-l9ntc9rpii02cry6w0efh-csat__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,219,1,152,663,NULL,319915,377500),('en',1,'Oropharma Can-Tax 500gms','Oropharma Can-Tax 500gms 0.5 kg','Red colourant based on canthaxantin Oropharma Can-Tax is a red colourant based on canthaxantin. This dietary supplement colours red canaries, intensifies the red colour in other birds and ensures a beautiful even red colour. When adding Can-Tax to the food canthaxantin is transported to the place where the feather is growing and it is given the more intense red colour. The feather formed retains its colour until the formation of a new feather.','versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-500gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-CAN-TAX-500GMS-460218-WEIGHT-0-5-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533143/petsupright/preview-59-versele-laga-oropharma-can-tax-500gms-1nhmnz8q-xvayu4iktabmql18wvrlxrwd__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,220,1,153,664,NULL,593220,700000),('en',1,'Oropharma Jungle Shower','Oropharma Jungle Shower 0.5 kg','Feather conditioner Oropharma Jungle Shower is a spray with aloe vera for glossy plumage and a healthy skin. This care product cleans the feathers, restores the balance of moisture of the skin and feathers, limits the loss of feather dust and helps to keep the skin healthy.','versele-laga-oropharma-jungle-shower','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-JUNGLE-SHOWER-460223-WEIGHT-0-5-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,45,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533146/petsupright/preview-fd-versele-laga-oropharma-jungle-shower-1tzaupez2klhs6feufdftyff-vfua-fkw__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,221,1,155,665,NULL,266949,315000),('en',1,'Oropharma Opti-Breed 500gms','Oropharma Opti-Breed 500gms 0.5 kg','Mix of amino acids, vitamins, minerals & trace elements Oropharma Opti-Breed is a well-balanced blend of amino acids, vitamins, minerals, trace elements, Florastimul® and L-carnitine. This dietary supplement is administrated for good growth, optimal skeletal formation, good egg shell formation and perfect skin and feather structure. Opti-Breed supports general health and productivity and contains all the components your birds need for a good development. Adding Opti-Breed to your own eggfood blends ensures optimal breeding and growth. Florastimul® is a prebiotic, feed for good bacteria in the intestines. It supports the quality of the intestinal flora and ensures a good digestion. L-carnitine supports the growth of the chicks. L-carnitine also supports fat combustion, which results in greater availability of energy for physical exertion.','versele-laga-oropharma-opti-breed-500gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-OPTI-BREED-500GMS-460221-WEIGHT-0-5-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533146/petsupright/preview-88-versele-laga-oropharma-opti-breed-500gms-1-jljtm-njlbrawpc29gfsh5thmdosqzo__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,222,1,154,666,NULL,216102,255000),('en',1,'Oropharma No-Pick','Oropharma No-Pick 0.1 kg','Bitterspray against feather pecking Oropharma No-Pick is a bitterspray against feather pecking. This product protects growing youngsters from feather plucking by parent animals and helps to prevent feather pecking and self mutilation.','versele-laga-oropharma-no-pick','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-NO-PICK-460225-WEIGHT-0-1-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,45,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533147/petsupright/preview-55-versele-laga-oropharma-no-pick-1oap9evjcmjdhcsbsyw-4uw0zbef88xpk__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,223,1,156,667,NULL,161017,190000),('en',1,'Oropharma Oro-Bath 50gms','Oropharma Oro-Bath 50gms 0.05 kg','Bath salt for glossy plumage Oropharma Oro-Bath is a special bath salts care product for glossy plumage. It makes feathers more supple, keeps the feet and skin free from scaling and ensures glossy feathers. Oro-Bath has a relaxing function on the muscles and cleans the skin and feathers. Everyone knows that birds like to bathe and also need it. Regular bathing is essential for maintaining the feathers. Adding Oro-Bath to the bath water gives the birds supple feathers and helps them to maintain the strength and water-resistant function of the plumage.','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-50gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-ORO-BATH-50GMS-460243-WEIGHT-0-05-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533151/petsupright/preview-6d-versele-laga-oropharma-oro-bath-50gms-1c82n7b4mr-zhb09682hl4ev2eecmj5bi__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,224,1,157,668,NULL,78390,92500),('en',1,'Oropharma Oro-Digest 150gms','Oropharma Oro-Digest 150gms 0.15 kg','Intestinal conditioner Oropharma Oro-Digest is an intestinal conditioner. This product prevents the adhesion of pathogenic bacteria in the intestines, ensures a better consistency of the droppings, promotes hygienic nests and prevents the cloaca feathers from sticking together. Oro-Digest serves as a prebiotic or food for the good intestinal flora and will also ensure that the pathogenic bacteria are no longer able to adhere to the intestinal wall so that the natural intestinal flora can recover and the digestion proceeds normally again. The added probiotics help to inhibit pathogens thus stimulating the growth of positive bacteria.','versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-150gms','VERSELE-LAGA-OROPHARMA-ORO-DIGEST-150GMS-460244-WEIGHT-0-15-KG','4,3,2,5,7,6,1','4,12,25,26,27,55,62,213,214','13,166,167','bird,bird-health-and-wellness,bird-health-and-wellness-health-supplement','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791533153/petsupright/preview-b6-versele-laga-oropharma-oro-digest-150gms-1avdlmvp1s41xsi9ofxypas2gqaylloec__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,225,1,158,669,NULL,216102,255000),('en',1,'Crispy Pellets Rabbits','Crispy Pellets Rabbits 2 kg','Tasty and fibre-rich pellet food for all rabbits Complete pellet food for rabbits Without grains; the all-in-one pellets prevent selective eating behaviour Contains all the necessary nutrients thanks to the \"Happy & Healthy\" pellet','versele-laga-crispy-pellets-rabbits','VERSELE-LAGA-CR