 Cat Clumping Litter is designed for cat owners who care about hygiene and the environment. Made from 100 percent natural materials including two thirds wood fiber and one third recycled paper, this biodegradable litter is safe for disposal and gentle on the planet. It delivers powerful 600 percent fluid absorption, keeping the litter box dry and hygienic for up to three weeks. The low dust formula supports cleaner air and is ideal for cats with respiratory sensitivity. Strong clumping action makes it easy to scoop and clean, while advanced odor control technology neutralizes unpleasant smells to keep your home fresh all day. Joe\'s Cat Clumping Litter is an economical and safe choice for your pet. Enjoy a cleaner, more sustainable litter box experience with a product that combines performance, comfort, and responsibility.','joe-s-cat-joe-s-cat-clumping-cat-litter-3kg-natural-biodegradable-low-dust-wood-fiber-and-recycled-paper-odor-control-600-percent-absorption-eco-friendly','JOE-S-CAT-JOE-S-CAT-CLUMPING-CAT-LITTER-3KG-NATURAL-BIODEGRADABLE-LOW-DUST-WOOD-FIBER-AND-RECYCLED-PAPER-ODOR-CONTROL-600-PERCENT-ABSORPTION-ECO-FRIENDLY-F-JCRPC3-0-WEIGHT-3-KG','4,6,2,3,7,5,1','4,6,11,12,13,26,111,206,210','6,159,163','cat,cat-clean-and-hygiene,cat-clean-and-hygiene-cat-litter','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791534839/petsupright/preview-e7-joe-s-cat-joe-s-cat-clumping-cat-litter-3kg-natural-biodegradable-low-dust-wood-17chaij7ppr8xu7au-cevbey3chel-zxr__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,363,1,247,1142,NULL,165254,195000),('en',1,'Chipsi Classic Big','Chipsi Classic Big 12.5 kg','CHIPSI CLASSIC is the simple basic litter in pet hygiene, and has proved its worth countless times. Many people with pets swear by it, because their pets just love it. With CHIPSI CLASSIC pets are going to feel just as if they are outside in the great outdoors! The dust-free softwood chips, derived from spruce and fir, are naturally absorbent, give off a pleasant scent and provid