ana 0.085 kg','Oxbow Simple Rewards Baked Treats with Apple & Banana are specially crafted to provide small pets with a naturally sweet and healthy reward. Combining the irresistible taste of real fruits with the goodness of Timothy hay, these treats offer both nutrition and enjoyment. Perfect for adding variety to your pet’s diet, these oven-baked treats also support digestive health and provide essential enrichment. Free from artificial colors and added sugars, they are a safe and delicious choice for your furry companions.','oxbow-rewards-baked-treats-apple-and-banana','OXBOW-REWARDS-BAKED-TREATS-APPLE-AND-BANANA-496023-WEIGHT-0-085-KG','4,3,5,6,1,7,2','4,12,26,44,116,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food-dry-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,410,1,286,NULL,NULL,50847,60000),('en',1,'Tetra TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Energy and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Energy and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack 0.055','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Energy Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional energy concentrate in the multi-crisps contains high-quality oils to improve fish vitality. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-energy-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-energy-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-55-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRAPRO-ENERGY-MULTI-CRISPS-PREMIUM-COMPLETE-FOOD-EXTRA-ENERGY-AND-PREBIOTIC-FOR-CLEAR-WATER-55-GRAM-PACK-T713565-WEIGHT-0-055','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535562/petsupright/preview-37-tetra-tetra-tetrapro-energy-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-energy-and-1g7vvk6skbpfvobhxvvkmzz-daewypmb5__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,411,1,287,1380,NULL,52966,62500),('en',1,'Tetra TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Algae and Prebiotic for clear water 45 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Algae and Prebiotic for clear water 45 Gram Pack 0.045','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Algae Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional algae concentrate in the Algae Multi-Crisps enhances fishes’ resistance. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-algae-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-algae-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-45-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRAPRO-ALGAE-MULTI-CRISPS-PREMIUM-COMPLETE-FOOD-EXTRA-ALGAE-AND-PREBIOTIC-FOR-CLEAR-WATER-45-GRAM-PACK-T713555-WEIGHT-0-045','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535582/petsupright/preview-72-tetra-tetra-tetrapro-algae-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-algae-and-pr-1scks0zxqq1clsepmblzg54dikpruwedn__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,412,1,288,1389,NULL,52966,62500),('en',1,'Tetra TetraPRO Menu Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food 4 in 1 Menu Prebiotic for clear water 64 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraPRO Menu Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food 4 in 1 Menu Prebiotic for clear water 64 Gram Pack 0.064','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Menu Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This boosts the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish use the fat for movement and the protein specifically to build muscle. TetraPRO Menu combines all the benefits of the various multi-crisps: while the additional energy concentrate in the Energy Multi-Crisps improves vitality, the Colour Multi-Crisps bring out fishes’ natural colouration. The Algae Multi-Crisps promote resistance and the Growth Multi-Crisps encourage growth. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents the additional benefits of the various multi-crisps. They also crumble significantly less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-menu-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-4-in-1-menu-prebiotic-for-clear-water-64-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRAPRO-MENU-MULTI-CRISPS-PREMIUM-COMPLETE-FOOD-4-IN-1-MENU-PREBIOTIC-FOR-CLEAR-WATER-64-GRAM-PACK-T713625-WEIGHT-0-064','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535596/petsupright/preview-94-tetra-tetra-tetrapro-menu-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-4-in-1-menu-prebiot-1m0bv66sf1lm3sa8nnbcrkhx0gzqk6iss__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,413,1,289,1395,NULL,52966,62500),('en',1,'TetraBits Brilliant Colour Fish Food A daily diet for all tropical fishes to enhance natural colour and vibrancy increased nutrient absorption 75 Gram Pack','TetraBits Brilliant Colour Fish Food A daily diet for all tropical fishes to enhance natural colour and vibrancy increased nutrient absorption 75 Gram Pack 0.075','TetraBits Brilliant Colour is a premium daily diet meticulously crafted to enhance the natural color and vibrancy of all tropical fish. This staple food is designed to support optimal fish color development and unparalleled radiance, ensuring your aquatic pets display their most stunning hues. Enriched with carotenoids derived from natural ingredients, TetraBits Brilliant Colour significantly boosts fish coloration, bringing out their inherent beauty. The highly digestible formulation of TetraBits Brilliant Colour ensures superior nutrient absorption, promoting overall health and vitality in your fish. This advanced recipe reduces waste, keeping your aquarium water clean and clear, contributing to a healthier and more beautiful aquatic environment. TetraBits Brilliant Colour is known for its excellent palatability, making it a favorite among various tropical fish species. The slowly sinking granules create enticing movements in the water, stimulating the natural feeding behavior of top and mid-water feeding fish. This dynamic feeding action not only enhances the feeding experience but also ensures that fish receive the necessary nutrition at their preferred feeding levels. Whether you are a seasoned aquarist or a beginner, TetraBits Brilliant Colour provides a convenient and effective solution for maintaining the vibrancy and health of your tropical fish. By incorporating this high-quality food into your daily feeding regimen, you can enjoy the sight of your fish thriving in vivid, brilliant colors, transforming your aquarium into a captivating underwater paradise. Experience the remarkable benefits of TetraBits Brilliant Colour and give your tropical fish the nourishment they deserve, ensuring their natural beauty shines through every day.','tetra-tetrabits-brilliant-colour-fish-food-a-daily-diet-for-all-tropical-fishes-to-enhance-natural-colour-and-vibrancy-increased-nutrient-absorption-75-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRABITS-BRILLIANT-COLOUR-FISH-FOOD-A-DAILY-DIET-FOR-ALL-TROPICAL-FISHES-TO-ENHANCE-NATURAL-COLOUR-AND-VIBRANCY-INCREASED-NUTRIENT-ABSORPTION-75-GRAM-PACK-T712856-WEIGHT-0-075','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,414,1,290,NULL,NULL,64407,76000),('en',1,'Tetra Rubin Flakes 52 Gram Colour-Enhancing Complete Food for Ornamental Fish | Boosts Red, Orange & Yellow Tones | Supports Growth, Digestion & Immunity','Tetra Rubin Flakes 52 Gram Colour-Enhancing Complete Food for Ornamental Fish | Boosts Red, Orange & Yellow Tones | Supports Growth, Digestion & Immunity 0.052','Tetra Rubin Flakes is a premium complete food designed to naturally enhance the vibrant colours of all ornamental fish, especially red, orange, and yellow species. Enriched with natural colour enhancers, it intensifies fish colours in just two weeks without the use of artificial dyes. Formulated with the BioActive formula, Tetra Rubin Flakes support a healthy immune system, ensuring the overall well-being of your fish. The high-quality protein content promotes strong growth, while prebiotics aid digestion and improve food conversion for maximum nutrient absorption. These highly digestible flakes are carefully crafted to prevent water clouding, keeping your aquarium clear. Suitable for daily feeding, Tetra Rubin Flakes provide a balanced and nutritious diet for a wide range of ornamental fish. For added variety, alternate with TetraMin, TetraPhyll, or FreshDelica.','tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-52-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-fish-boosts-red-orange-and-yellow-tones-supports-growth-digestion-and-immunity','TETRA-TETRA-RUBIN-FLAKES-52-GRAM-COLOUR-ENHANCING-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-BOOSTS-RED-ORANGE-AND-YELLOW-TONES-SUPPORTS-GROWTH-DIGESTION-AND-IMMUNITY-T713273-WEIGHT-0-052','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535642/petsupright/preview-26-tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-52-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-f-1yk9kglkqqvkaf0rn0jxdnprrrtjl-bqp__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,415,1,291,1419,NULL,44068,52000),('en',1,'Tetra ReptoMin Sticks 270gms/','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks 270gms/ 0.22','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks is a premium, complete food specially formulated for adult turtles. With 36% high-quality protein, it supports healthy growth, energy, and vitality. This scientifically balanced formula includes an optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to promote strong bones and a durable shell. The unique worm-shaped food sticks are designed for easy consumption, catering to the natural feeding habits of turtles. Additionally, the specialized formula helps reduce unpleasant tank odours, keeping your aquarium environment fresher for longer. Made with natural ingredients and free from artificial colourants, Tetra ReptoMin ensures a wholesome, digestible diet that supports immune health, digestion, and overall well-being. Ideal for daily feeding, it is the perfect choice for turtle owners who want to provide optimal nutrition in an easy-to-feed format.','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-270gms','TETRA-TETRA-REPTOMIN-STICKS-270GMS-T713156-WEIGHT-0-22','4,5,3,6,1,7,2','4,5,12,45,121,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food-dry-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535679/petsupright/preview-08-tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-270gms-1tohejh3nqwundlzl42oyrv1mcburd4mg__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,416,1,292,1434,NULL,152542,180000),('en',1,'Tetra Pleco Spirulina Wafers Complete Food Wafers for Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 85 Gram Pack','Tetra Pleco Spirulina Wafers Complete Food Wafers for Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 85 Gram Pack 0.085','Tetra Pleco Spirulina Wafers offer optimum nutrition for herbivorous bottom-dwelling fish. The proportion of Spirulina in the formula helps to meet the specific nutritional needs of algae-grazing fish. The food is rich in essential fibres that support healthy digestion. Furthermore, the wafers are characterised by great dimensional stability, with all the essential nutrients being retained in the food until the very last bite. Thanks to their solid consistency, the wafers do not cloud the water.','tetra-tetra-pleco-spirulina-wafers-complete-food-wafers-for-herbivorous-bottom-feeding-fish-85-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-PLECO-SPIRULINA-WAFERS-COMPLETE-FOOD-WAFERS-FOR-HERBIVOROUS-BOTTOM-FEEDING-FISH-85-GRAM-PACK-T709359-WEIGHT-0-085','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535682/petsupright/preview-49-tetra-tetra-pleco-spirulina-wafers-complete-food-wafers-for-herbivorous-bottom-f-1nctjge1uahkka6acr-8zclvwzxonl9ze__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,417,1,293,1436,NULL,57203,67500),('en',1,'Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 30 Gram 75 Tablets','Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 30 Gram 75 Tablets 0.03','Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets for tropical fish. For healthy feeding fun and exciting variety. Feeding fun Complete food,Treats. With their biologically balanced ingredients, Tetra FunTips Tablets are ideal treats for all tropical fish. The two-coloured adhesive food tablets provide your fish with twice the dietary benefits: the orange side is made from shrimps and carotenoids, ingredients that help enhance the colours of the fish to make them more vibrant, while the green part contains several vegetable ingredients as well as premium fats and oils that are essential for healthy and vital fish. The FunTips Tablets include animal constituents such as daphnia, krill and shrimps, which make up over 20 percent of the overall ingredients. However, the adhesive tablets are also made from plant ingredients, including several types of algae. Therefore Tetra FunTips Tablets are made up of 42 percent protein and five percent fat. The adhesive food tablets are more than just a healthy treat for your fish to snack on. The fact that the food tablets stick to the aquarium glass offers a great way to watch your fish up-close and see how they behave. They also make it far easier to take photos of your fish – perhaps even in the case of shy species, which swim up to the adhesive tablets to eat. There is also another major advantage to your fish spending time so close to the glass: you can keep a very close eye on them and detect any possible illnesses. This ultimately enables you also to take targeted action to combat illness, treat the fish and, ideally, even prevent diseases from spreading. All in all, Tetra FunTips Tablets not only make feeding time fun and exciting, but provide a practical way to add healthy variety to your fish’s diet.','tetra-tetra-funtips-fish-food-for-healthy-feeding-fun-and-exciting-diversity-biologically-balanced-adhesive-food-tablets-good-treats-for-fish-30-gram-75-tablets','TETRA-TETRA-FUNTIPS-FISH-FOOD-FOR-HEALTHY-FEEDING-FUN-AND-EXCITING-DIVERSITY-BIOLOGICALLY-BALANCED-ADHESIVE-FOOD-TABLETS-GOOD-TREATS-FOR-FISH-30-GRAM-75-TABLETS-T712365-WEIGHT-0-03','4,5,3,2,7,6,1','4,5,12,51,52,117,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,418,1,294,NULL,NULL,67797,80000),('en',1,'Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms 48 Grams Nutrient-Rich Gel Treats for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins','Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms 48 Grams Nutrient-Rich Gel Treats for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins 0.048','Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms is a high-quality gel food treat designed to provide a natural, fresh, and highly nutritious snack for all ornamental fish. Containing 30% red mosquito larvae (bloodworms), this complete and balanced food is rich in essential vitamins, minerals, and proteins, supporting fish health, color enhancement, and vitality. Unlike frozen food, Tetra FreshDelica contains up to twice as many nutrients and comes in a convenient, sterile, germ-free gel format. It remains fresh for up to three years without refrigeration, making it a practical and mess-free feeding option. The gel consistency allows for precise and targeted feeding, reducing waste while providing an engaging feeding experience for both aquarists and fish. The soft, worm-like texture of the gel mimics live food, maximizing acceptance and promoting natural feeding behaviors. This treat is available in four varieties—Bloodworms, Brine Shrimps, Krill, and Daphnia—offering a varied diet that complements Tetra’s staple foods. Whether used as a treat or a dietary supplement, Tetra FreshDelica Bloodworms ensures a fun, nutritious, and interactive feeding experience for your fish.','tetra-tetra-freshdelica-bloodworms-48-grams-nutrient-rich-gel-treats-for-all-ornamental-fish-with-natural-aquatic-animals-and-essential-vitamins','TETRA-TETRA-FRESHDELICA-BLOODWORMS-48-GRAMS-NUTRIENT-RICH-GEL-TREATS-FOR-ALL-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-WITH-NATURAL-AQUATIC-ANIMALS-AND-ESSENTIAL-VITAMINS-T712367-WEIGHT-0-048','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535690/petsupright/preview-6a-tetra-tetra-freshdelica-bloodworms-48-grams-nutrient-rich-gel-treats-for-all-orn-1gmj8leg9kjzjixg4jwf9pew6mpeazddj__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,419,1,295,1442,NULL,63559,75000),('en',1,'Tetra TetraLuoHan Large Pellets For Fish Magnificent, Brilliant Colouring and Growth 86 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraLuoHan Large Pellets For Fish Magnificent, Brilliant Colouring and Growth 86 Gram Pack 0.086','Floating pellets for fish longer than approx. 15 cm. For magnificent, brilliant colouring and growth. • Scientifically formulated diet tailored to meet the unique nutritional needs of Flowerhorn Cichlids. • Guaranteed to improve the fish\'s colour and growth. • Carefully selected high-quality nutritional ingredients that Luo Han love to eat. • Superior digestibility reduces water pollution. • manufactured in Germany, meeting the highest quality standard (ISO 9001), including thorough testing procedures to ensure a healthy diet.','tetra-tetra-tetraluohan-large-pellets-for-fish-magnificent-brilliant-colouring-and-growth-86-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRALUOHAN-LARGE-PELLETS-FOR-FISH-MAGNIFICENT-BRILLIANT-COLOURING-AND-GROWTH-86-GRAM-PACK-T709011-WEIGHT-0-086','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535702/petsupright/preview-d4-tetra-tetra-tetraluohan-large-pellets-for-fish-magnificent-brilliant-colouring-a-1-jcfw0c7nwbtfaftd-7ekyzwvwuh2s1a__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,420,1,296,1446,NULL,46610,55000),('en',1,'Tetra Micro Pellets Complete Food For Small Ornamental Fish 46 Gram Pack','Tetra Micro Pellets Complete Food For Small Ornamental Fish 46 Gram Pack 0.046','Tetra Micro Pellets are particularly suitable as a complete food for all small ornamental fish which feed in the top and middle regions of the water. With a diameter of 0.4 to 1.2 mm, even fish with small mouths can easily eat the food. The small Tetra Micro Pellets are therefore ideal for small fish as they soften up quickly in the water, making them easy to eat. Tetra Micro Pellets contain top-quality nutrients and have a balanced formula comprising plant and animal based ingredients. As such, they offer everything that plant and meat-eating fish require for a balanced diet that is tailored to their needs. The red pellets also contain carotenoids to enhance the colour vibrancy of the fish, whereas the green pellets are made from plant ingredients to support health and vitality. Furthermore, this complete food is really highly digestible, which helps to keep the water clear. All in all, Tetra Micro Pellets are an ideal complete food for all small ornamental fish as well as young, growing cichlids and marine fish.','tetra-tetra-micro-pellets-complete-food-for-small-ornamental-fish-46-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-MICRO-PELLETS-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-SMALL-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-46-GRAM-PACK-T710338-WEIGHT-0-046','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535723/petsupright/preview-f3-tetra-tetra-micro-pellets-complete-food-for-small-ornamental-fish-46-gram-pack-1hgvjmymmepghfver5nxeoerfrnxnpz6i__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,421,1,297,1457,NULL,48729,57500),('en',1,'Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps 48 Gram Nutrient-Rich Gel Treat for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins','Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps 48 Gram Nutrient-Rich Gel Treat for All Ornamental Fish with Natural Aquatic Animals & Essential Vitamins 0.048','Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps is a high-quality gel food treat designed to provide a natural, fresh, and highly nutritious snack for all ornamental fish. Containing 39% Artemia salina (brine shrimp), this complete and balanced food is rich in essential vitamins, minerals, and proteins, supporting fish health, color enhancement, and vitality. Unlike frozen food, Tetra FreshDelica contains up to twice as many nutrients and comes in a convenient, sterile, germ-free gel format. It remains fresh for up to three years without refrigeration, making it a practical and mess-free feeding option. The gel consistency allows for precise and targeted feeding, reducing waste while providing an engaging feeding experience for both aquarists and fish. The soft, worm-like texture of the gel mimics live food, maximizing acceptance and promoting natural feeding behaviors. This treat is available in four varieties—Bloodworms, Brine Shrimps, Krill, and Daphnia—offering a varied diet that complements Tetra’s staple foods. Whether used as a treat or a dietary supplement, Tetra FreshDelica Brine Shrimps ensures a fun, nutritious, and interactive feeding experience for your fish.','tetra-tetra-freshdelica-brine-shrimps-48-gram-nutrient-rich-gel-treat-for-all-ornamental-fish-with-natural-aquatic-animals-and-essential-vitamins','TETRA-TETRA-FRESHDELICA-BRINE-SHRIMPS-48-GRAM-NUTRIENT-RICH-GEL-TREAT-FOR-ALL-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-WITH-NATURAL-AQUATIC-ANIMALS-AND-ESSENTIAL-VITAMINS-T712366-WEIGHT-0-048','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535788/petsupright/preview-29-tetra-tetra-freshdelica-brine-shrimps-48-gram-nutrient-rich-gel-treat-for-all-or-1fq1p5gnkdeoflug2j6dhzzbj-a2oavup__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,422,1,298,1477,NULL,63559,75000),('en',1,'Tetra Arowana Mini Sticks Complete Food With Shrimps and Krill High acceptance for Taste, Growth, Colour and Vitality Bio Active Formula 85 Gram Pack','Tetra Arowana Mini Sticks Complete Food With Shrimps and Krill High acceptance for Taste, Growth, Colour and Vitality Bio Active Formula 85 Gram Pack 0.085','Tetra Arowana is the highly nutritious food for Red, Golden, Silver, Black and Australian Arowanas as well as other Ostoglossidae species. The food has a high content of Krill and Shrimps for varied feeding. High content of natural attractants ensure great palatability. Natural colour enhancers increase the colourfulness of your fish.','tetra-tetra-arowana-mini-sticks-complete-food-with-shrimps-and-krill-high-acceptance-for-taste-growth-colour-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-85-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-AROWANA-MINI-STICKS-COMPLETE-FOOD-WITH-SHRIMPS-AND-KRILL-HIGH-ACCEPTANCE-FOR-TASTE-GROWTH-COLOUR-AND-VITALITY-BIO-ACTIVE-FORMULA-85-GRAM-PACK-T708654-WEIGHT-0-085','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535788/petsupright/preview-66-tetra-tetra-arowana-mini-sticks-complete-food-with-shrimps-and-krill-high-accept-1qcxjym-p6ama5smvl6aa4kudd8qjfs-k__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,423,1,299,1476,NULL,46610,55000),('en',1,'Tetra Wafer Mix 48 Gram Complete & Balanced Sinking Wafers for Bottom Fish & Crustaceans with Shrimp & Spirulina for Growth & Immunity','Tetra Wafer Mix 48 Gram Complete & Balanced Sinking Wafers for Bottom Fish & Crustaceans with Shrimp & Spirulina for Growth & Immunity 0.048','Tetra Wafer Mix is a premium, complete food designed to provide balanced nutrition for all bottom-dwelling fish and crustaceans. Formulated with high-quality ingredients, these sinking wafers ensure an optimal and varied diet to support overall fish health, growth, and vitality. With 5.6% shrimp, Tetra Wafer Mix delivers essential proteins and amino acids that promote healthy development. Additionally, 1.5% spirulina algae is included to strengthen the immune system, enhancing fish resistance against diseases. The wafers sink quickly to the bottom, making them an ideal food source for species such as blue antennae catfish, armored scale catfish, and loaches. These wafers maintain their solid consistency, softening gradually without dissolving, ensuring easy intake while preventing water clouding. Their highly digestible formula reduces waste and maintains a clean aquarium environment. With Tetra Wafer Mix, your bottom feeders and crustaceans receive high-quality nutrition for long-term health and well-being.','tetra-tetra-wafer-mix-48-gram-complete-and-balanced-sinking-wafers-for-bottom-fish-and-crustaceans-with-shrimp-and-spirulina-for-growth-and-immunity','TETRA-TETRA-WAFER-MIX-48-GRAM-COMPLETE-AND-BALANCED-SINKING-WAFERS-FOR-BOTTOM-FISH-AND-CRUSTACEANS-WITH-SHRIMP-AND-SPIRULINA-FOR-GROWTH-AND-IMMUNITY-T700583-WEIGHT-0-048','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535816/petsupright/preview-4e-tetra-tetra-wafer-mix-48-gram-complete-and-balanced-sinking-wafers-for-bottom-fi-1jiehzqxznge-igsawb1zt73h6k2-qx3__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,424,1,300,1486,NULL,32203,38000),('en',1,'Tetra Magnetic Cleaner','Tetra Magnetic Cleaner 0.063','','tetra-tetra-magnetic-cleaner','TETRA-TETRA-MAGNETIC-CLEANER-TMC1-0-WEIGHT-0-063','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121','31','fish','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,425,1,301,NULL,NULL,42373,50000),('en',1,'Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks Floating Fish Food 34g/','Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks Floating Fish Food 34g/ 0.034','Tetra Goldfish Wave Sticks are a complete daily food specially formulated to meet the nutritional needs of goldfish. These highly palatable, floating wavy sticks are designed to make feeding easier while supporting a more natural feeding behaviour at the water surface. The balanced formula provides quality nutrients and a suitable protein blend to support vitality, healthy growth and overall well-being. Natural colour activators help enhance the vibrant, natural colours of goldfish, making them look brighter and more attractive. The sticks 