ckly making them very easy to eat.','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-growth-premium-food-for-healthy-growth-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-113-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-GOLDFISH-GOLD-GROWTH-PREMIUM-FOOD-FOR-HEALTHY-GROWTH-AND-VITALITY-BIO-ACTIVE-FORMULA-113-GRAM-PACK-T713307-WEIGHT-0-113','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535919/petsupright/preview-ad-tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-growth-premium-food-for-healthy-growth-and-vitality-bi-1k0-ns3snjzfpomrjshliaw-fkkradhce__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,432,1,308,1528,NULL,29661,35000),('en',1,'Tetra Goldfish Gold Colour Premium Food For Goldfish for Excellent Colouration Bio Active Formula 75 Gram Pack','Tetra Goldfish Gold Colour Premium Food For Goldfish for Excellent Colouration Bio Active Formula 75 Gram Pack 0.075','Premium granulated food for all goldfish and other coldwater fish - for more intense colours. • Carotinoids, spirulina algae and other colour enhancers ensure excellent colouration. • With Clean and Clear Water Formula plus BioActive formula to support a long and healthy life. • Excellent digestibility at both high and low temperatures. • Ideal, high quality diet keeps your fish in top condition. • Granules soften quickly making them very easy to eat.','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-colour-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-excellent-colouration-bio-active-formula-75-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-GOLDFISH-GOLD-COLOUR-PREMIUM-FOOD-FOR-GOLDFISH-FOR-EXCELLENT-COLOURATION-BIO-ACTIVE-FORMULA-75-GRAM-PACK-T713303-WEIGHT-0-075','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535921/petsupright/preview-f4-tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-colour-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-excellent-coloura-1rvl6480yuftmoojv3nxulqqaswjdreiy__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,433,1,309,1529,NULL,29661,35000),('en',1,'Tetra TetraMin Complete Food For All Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Prebiotic 20 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraMin Complete Food For All Tropical Fish Good Health, Colour and Growth Bio Active Prebiotic 20 Gram Pack 0.02','TetraMin is a biologically balanced flake food providing a complete diet for daily feeding of all ornamental fish. The flakes float for a long time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for a mixed stock of fish. This carefully selected mix of over 40 ingredients contains high quality, functional nutrients with essential vitamins, minerals and trace elements. The food also includes prebiotics to improve the bodily functions of fish and food conversion. This ensures healthy fish growth, vitality and colour vibrancy, and keeps the aquarium water clear.','tetra-tetra-tetramin-complete-food-for-all-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-growth-bio-active-prebiotic-20-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRAMIN-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-ALL-TROPICAL-FISH-GOOD-HEALTH-COLOUR-AND-GROWTH-BIO-ACTIVE-PREBIOTIC-20-GRAM-PACK-T712753-WEIGHT-0-02','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535922/petsupright/preview-14-tetra-tetra-tetramin-complete-food-for-all-tropical-fish-good-health-colour-and-1nhkrw7el2lnrgucqxkc643a9p-7rmpyf__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,434,1,310,1530,NULL,21186,25000),('en',1,'Tetra Cichlid XL Sticks Complete Food For Large Cichlids for Health, Colour and Growth 320 Gram Pack','Tetra Cichlid XL Sticks Complete Food For Large Cichlids for Health, Colour and Growth 320 Gram Pack 0.32','Staple food for all Cichlids and other large ornamental fish. • The sticks float on the surface of the water and suit the fish\'s natural eating habits, due to their worm-like size and shape. • The nutrient content meets Cichlids\' increased requirements for animal proteins and ensures a naturally balanced nutrition, as in the wild. • Promotes well-being, naturally intense colouring and growth.','tetra-tetra-cichlid-xl-sticks-complete-food-for-large-cichlids-for-health-colour-and-growth-320-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-CICHLID-XL-STICKS-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-LARGE-CICHLIDS-FOR-HEALTH-COLOUR-AND-GROWTH-320-GRAM-PACK-T713101-WEIGHT-0-32','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535975/petsupright/preview-c2-tetra-tetra-cichlid-xl-sticks-complete-food-for-large-cichlids-for-health-colour-1k1-0yhhyr1phy5oxpo3ckaatyxwxrzgf__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,435,1,311,1559,NULL,97458,115000),('en',1,'Tetra TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Colour and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack','Tetra TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps Premium Complete Food Extra Colour and Prebiotic for clear water 55 Gram Pack 0.055','TetraPRO has set a new standard in fish nutrition. The premium complete food is manufactured using a gentle, low-heat process. This special manufacturing method gives TetraPRO Colour Multi-Crisps a very high nutritional value. The multi-crisps also absorb less water than normal flake food. This increases the nutrient content per volume. All TetraPRO foods offer also an optimised protein-fat ratio. This ensures that the fish can use the protein specifically to build muscle by providing plenty of essential fatty acids for energy generation. The additional colour concentrate in the multi-crisps, made from carotenoids, improves natural colouration. The innovative 2-colour technology visually represents these additional benefits. The multi-crisps also crumble much less than normal flakes, significantly reducing the amount of food dust in the containers. The high-quality prebiotics specifically stimulate growth and the metabolism of health-promoting bacteria in the intestinal tract by acting as a preferred source of food for useful bacteria. This minimises water pollution.','tetra-tetra-tetrapro-colour-multi-crisps-premium-complete-food-extra-colour-and-prebiotic-for-clear-water-55-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-TETRAPRO-COLOUR-MULTI-CR