gestion, and overall well-being. Ideal for daily feeding, it is the perfect choice for turtle owners who want to provide optimal nutrition in an easy-to-feed format.','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-55-gram-premium-complete-food-for-adult-turtles-36-high-quality-protein-supports-shell-and-bone-health-odour-reducing-formula','TETRA-TETRA-REPTOMIN-STICKS-55-GRAM-PREMIUM-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-ADULT-TURTLES-36-HIGH-QUALITY-PROTEIN-SUPPORTS-SHELL-AND-BONE-HEALTH-ODOUR-REDUCING-FORMULA-T708635-WEIGHT-0-055','4,5,3,6,1,7,2','4,5,12,45,121,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food-dry-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536113/petsupright/preview-54-tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-55-gram-premium-complete-food-for-adult-turtles-36-h-1fzo-oq9xk-df8gpfuggy8eiworrfipph__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,450,1,325,1650,NULL,50847,60000),('en',1,'Tetra ReptoMin Sticks Complete Food for Water Turtles with Natural Ingredients 22 Gram Pack','Tetra ReptoMin Sticks Complete Food for Water Turtles with Natural Ingredients 22 Gram Pack 0.022','Tetra ReptoMin is a balanced and nutrient-rich complete food for adult turtles. The food contains 36% high-quality protein. This is supplemented by the optimal calcium-phosphorus ratio to keep shells healthy and bones strong. The specially-developed food formula of Tetra ReptoMin also reduces unpleasant tank odours and is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants. The Tetra ReptoMin food sticks are specially adapted to the requirements and eating habits of adult turtles, making it easier to feed them.','tetra-tetra-reptomin-sticks-complete-food-for-water-turtles-with-natural-ingredients-22-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-REPTOMIN-STICKS-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-WATER-TURTLES-WITH-NATURAL-INGREDIENTS-22-GRAM-PACK-T713151-WEIGHT-0-022','4,5,3,6,1,7,2','4,5,12,45,121,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig