Energy is made with natural ingredients. This means that the food contains no colourants.','tetra-tetra-reptomin-energy-complete-food-for-water-turtles-extra-energy-for-vitality-with-natural-ingredients-85-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-REPTOMIN-ENERGY-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-WATER-TURTLES-EXTRA-ENERGY-FOR-VITALITY-WITH-NATURAL-INGREDIENTS-85-GRAM-PACK-T713166-WEIGHT-0-085','4,5,3,6,1,7,2','4,5,12,45,121,221,222,223,234','174,175,176','hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food,hamster-guinea-pig-turtle-rabbit-food-dry-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536121/petsupright/preview-69-tetra-tetra-reptomin-energy-complete-food-for-water-turtles-extra-energy-for-vit-1d2ztw-eba4gtrzdhs7fd-f0heiox1gs9__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,454,1,329,1657,NULL,69915,82500),('en',1,'Tetra Micro Sticks Complete Food for Small Tropical Fish 45 Gram Pack','Tetra Micro Sticks Complete Food for Small Tropical Fish 45 Gram Pack 0.045','Tetra Micro Sticks are particularly suitable as a complete food for all small ornamental fish which feed in the top and middle regions of the water. With a diameter of 1.5 to 2.5 mm, even fish with small mouths can easily eat the food. The small Tetra Micro Sticks are therefore ideal for small fish as they soften up quickly in the water, making them easy to eat. Tetra Micro Sticks contain top-quality nutrients and have a balanced formula comprising plant and animal based ingredients. As such, they offer everything that plant and meat-eating fish require for a balanced diet that is tailored to their needs. The red sticks also contain carotenoids to enhance the colour vibrancy of the fish, whereas the green ones are made from plant ingredients to support health and vitality. Furthermore, this complete food is really highly digestible, which helps to keep the water clear. All in all, Tetra Micro Sticks are an ideal complete food for all small ornamental fish as well as young, growing cichlids and marine fish.','tetra-tetra-micro-sticks-complete-food-for-small-tropical-fish-45-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-MICRO-STICKS-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-SMALL-TROPICAL-FISH-45-GRAM-PACK-T712373-WEIGHT-0-045','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536138/petsupright/preview-77-tetra-tetra-micro-sticks-complete-food-for-small-tropical-fish-45-gram-pack-1-o1fend4o3qxhzqabpr6-cdanwpo-v8v__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,455,1,331,1666,NULL,48729,57500),('en',1,'Tetra Pleco Tablets Complete Food Tablets For All Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 36 Gram Pack','Tetra Pleco Tablets Complete Food Tablets For All Herbivorous Bottom Feeding Fish 36 Gram Pack 0.036','Tetra Pleco Tablets offer optimum nutrition for herbivorous and timid bottom-dwelling fish. The two-coloured multi-tablets promote good health, colour vibrancy and vitality. The contained plant proteins contribute to meet the specific nutritional needs of herbivorous fish. Spirulina algae specifically supports good health and vitality, whilst omega-3 fatty acids promote healthy development. Thanks to the tablet form, the food releases slowly in the water. The Tetra Pleco Tablets are particularly ideal for fish like small plecos, Siamese algae eaters, gobies and whiptail catfish.','tetra-tetra-pleco-tablets-complete-food-tablets-for-all-herbivorous-bottom-feeding-fish-36-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-PLECO-TABLETS-COMPLETE-FOOD-TABLETS-FOR-ALL-HERBIVOROUS-BOTTOM-FEEDING-FISH-36-GRAM-PACK-T713488-WEIGHT-0-036','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536139/petsupright/preview-56-tetra-tetra-pleco-tablets-complete-food-tablets-for-all-herbivorous-bottom-feedi-1wp-k4w23db8elgkozehbdackkt-tmkmb__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,456,1,330,1668,NULL,25424,30000),('en',1,'Tetra Micro Granules 45 Gram Premium Slowly Sinking Granulated Fish Food for Small Ornamental Fish','Tetra Micro Granules 45 Gram Premium Slowly Sinking Granulated Fish Food for Small Ornamental Fish 0.045','Tetra Micro Granules provide a complete and balanced diet for small ornamental fish, including young cichlids and marine fish. These premium-quality, slowly sinking granules (0.3-1mm) cater to fish feeding in the middle and bottom layers of the aquarium. With a carefully crafted formula containing both plant-based and animal-based ingredients, they ensure optimal nutrition for enhanced color, vitality, and growth. The red granules are enriched with carotenoids to enhance the natural vibrancy of fish colors, while the green granules contain plant-based nutrients that support overall health and energy. The granules soften quickly in water, making them easy to consume for small fish, ensuring efficient nutrient absorption. With a high protein content of 44% and essential vitamins like Vitamin D3, Tetra Micro Granules promote healthy development, a strong immune system, and sustained energy. Their highly digestible nature helps prevent excess waste, keeping aquarium water clear and reducing pollution. Free from artificial colorants, these granules are an excellent daily food option for small ornamental fish, young cichlids, and marine fish.','tetra-tetra-micro-granules-45-gram-premium-slowly-sinking-granulated-fish-food-for-small-ornamental-fish','TETRA-TETRA-MICRO-GRANULES-45-GRAM-PREMIUM-SLOWLY-SINKING-GRANULATED-FISH-FOOD-FOR-SMALL-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-T713673-WEIGHT-0-045','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,457,1,332,NULL,NULL,52966,62500),('en',1,'Tetra Holiday Fish gel food block provides fish with up to 14 days of nutrition Enriched with extra-tasty daphnia For optimum water values 30 Gram pack','Tetra Holiday Fish gel food block provides fish with up to 14 days of nutrition Enriched with extra-tasty daphnia For optimum water values 30 Gram pack 0.03','Tetra Holiday provides your fish with an optimum and reliable food supply while you are on holiday. The gel food block provides fish with up to 14 days of nutrition and is 100% edible. It contains all essential nutritional elements to keep your fish healthy. Tetra Holiday provides your fish with an optimum and reliable food supply while you are on holiday and lasts for up to 14 days, depending on the size of your aquarium and the number of fish. Thanks to Tetra’s gel food technology, this holiday fish food is produced on a gel basis rather than as a gypsum block. The main advantage of this is that the food does not negatively affect the water quality in the long term and therefore the water values remain stable. The gel food block with Tetra’s BioActive formula is 100% edible and contains all the essential vitamins, trace elements and minerals that fish need to stay healthy and that are perfectly tailored to their needs. The holiday food is enriched with daphnia to make feeding fish during your holidays a particularly tasty experience. The aquarium fish can nibble at the block as needed, because it does not dissolve by itself. Detail Ideal holiday fish food for up to 14 days 100% edible gel food block Contains all essential vitamins, trace elements and minerals Enriched with extra-tasty daphnia For optimum water values without turning the water cloudy More information gel products Molluscs and crustaceans (Daphnia 7%), Yeasts, Minerals. Ingredients Moisture Content 90,0%. Preservatives, Colourants.','tetra-tetra-holiday-fish-gel-food-block-provides-fish-with-up-to-14-days-of-nutrition-enriched-with-extra-tasty-daphnia-for-optimum-water-values-30-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-HOLIDAY-FISH-GEL-FOOD-BLOCK-PROVIDES-FISH-WITH-UP-TO-14-DAYS-OF-NUTRITION-ENRICHED-WITH-EXTRA-TASTY-DAPHNIA-FOR-OPTIMUM-WATER-VALUES-30-GRAM-PACK-T712382-WEIGHT-0-03','4,5,3,2,7,6,1','4,5,12,51,52,117,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,458,1,333,NULL,NULL,44492,52500),('en',1,'Tetra Guppy Complete Food For All Guppies For Health, Colour & Vitality 30 Gram Pack','Tetra Guppy Complete Food For All Guppies For Health, Colour & Vitality 30 Gram Pack 0.03','Tetra Guppy Mini Flakes have been specially developed for the nutritional needs of guppies and other live-bearing toothcarps such as platies, mollies and swordtails. The balanced complete food is ideal for daily feeding of these fish types. The mini flakes float on the surface for a short time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for fish that feed in the top region of the water. The flake size is designed to suit the small mouths of the fish, making it easier for them to feed. The special combination of nutrients ensures that your fish are getting everything they need. The food is rich in plant ingredients and contains added minerals. This means it is more readily accepted by fish and promotes growth. Meanwhile, the colour enhancers increase colouration. The BioActive formula promotes a healthy immune system. Tetra Guppy Mini Flakes increase vitality and help keep the water clear.','tetra-tetra-guppy-complete-food-for-all-guppies-for-health-colour-and-vitality-30-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-GUPPY-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-ALL-GUPPIES-FOR-HEALTH-COLOUR-AND-VITALITY-30-GRAM-PACK-T713949-WEIGHT-0-03','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536158/petsupright/preview-17-tetra-tetra-guppy-complete-food-for-all-guppies-for-health-colour-and-vitality-3-1im3qvzhadous0i2j9hxqnh0exwpcqewi__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,459,1,334,1677,NULL,21186,25000),('en',1,'Tetra Guppy Colour Mini Flakes For Vibrant Colours 30 Gram Pack','Tetra Guppy Colour Mini Flakes For Vibrant Colours 30 Gram Pack 0.03','The balanced mini flakes promote intense, vibrant colours and have been specially developed for the nutritional needs of guppies and other live-bearing toothcarps such as platies, mollies and swordtails. The highly nutritious complete food contains natural colour enhancers and is ideal for daily feeding of these fish types. The mini flakes float on the surface for a short time before slowly sinking, making them ideal for fish that feed in the top region of the water. The flake size is designed to suit the small mouths of the fish, making it easier for them to feed. The special combination of nutrients ensures that your fish are getting everything they need. The food is rich in plant ingredients and contains added minerals. This means it is more readily accepted by fish and promotes growth. The BioActive formula promotes a healthy immune system.','tetra-tetra-guppy-colour-mini-flakes-for-vibrant-colours-30-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-GUPPY-COLOUR-MINI-FLAKES-FOR-VIBRANT-COLOURS-30-GRAM-PACK-T713198-WEIGHT-0-03','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536174/petsupright/preview-1b-tetra-tetra-guppy-colour-mini-flakes-for-vibrant-colours-30-gram-pack-1yv2zdpu13b3jrme1x-mpezxcjhrrniwl__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,460,1,335,1689,NULL,25424,30000),('en',1,'Tetra Goldfish Gold Exotic Premium Food For Goldfish For Health, Colour & Vitality Bio Active Formula 80 Gram Pack','Tetra Goldfish Gold Exotic Premium Food For Goldfish For Health, Colour & Vitality Bio Active Formula 80 Gram Pack 0.08','Premium food for all Goldfish. • Rich in quality vegetable ingredients and wheatgerm which precisely meet the natural feeding requirements of goldfish. • With Clean and Clear Water Formula plus BioActive formula to support a long and healthy life. • Excellent digestibility at both high and low temperatures. • Ideal, high quality diet keeps your fish in top condition. • Granules soften quickly making them very easy to eat.','tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-exotic-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-health-colour-and-vitality-bio-active-formula-80-gram-pack','TETRA-TETRA-GOLDFISH-GOLD-EXOTIC-PREMIUM-FOOD-FOR-GOLDFISH-FOR-HEALTH-COLOUR-AND-VITALITY-BIO-ACTIVE-FORMULA-80-GRAM-PACK-T713306-WEIGHT-0-08','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791536182/petsupright/preview-61-tetra-tetra-goldfish-gold-exotic-premium-food-for-goldfish-for-health-colour-and-1jphl8hxt8rlgbdjd8kpyimrzny6xcqzt__preview.png',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,461,1,336,1694,NULL,28390,33500),('en',1,'Tetra Goldfish Flakes 52 Gram Complete & Balanced Nutritious Food for Goldfish with Unique Protein Mix for Growth, Vitality & Clean Water','Tetra Goldfish Flakes 52 Gram Complete & Balanced Nutritious Food for Goldfish with Unique Protein Mix for Growth, Vitality & Clean Water 0.052','Tetra Goldfish Flakes is a premium, balanced complete food designed to support the health, vitality, and growth of goldfish. This carefully formulated flake mix provides essential nutrients, including vitamins, minerals, and trace elements, to keep your goldfish active and strong. With a unique protein mix, these flakes ensure optimal growth, energy, and resilience. The high-quality ingredients are free from artificial colorants and preservatives, promoting a natural and nutritious diet. The flakes are designed to float for an extended period before slowly sinking, making them ideal for all goldfish and cold-water ornamental fish. Tetra Goldfish Flakes are highly digestible, helping to reduce waste and maintain clean, clear water in your aquarium. With this complete food, your goldfish will thrive, displaying enhanced color, energy, and overall well-being.','tetra-tetra-goldfish-flakes-52-gram-complete-and-balanced-nutritious-food-for-goldfish-with-unique-protein-mix-for-growth-vitality-and-clean-water','TETRA-TETRA-GOLDFISH-FLAKES-52-GRAM-COMPLETE-AND-BALANCED-NUTRITIOUS-FOOD-FOR-GOLDFISH-WITH-UNIQUE-PROTEIN-MIX-FOR-GROWTH-VITALITY-AND-CLEAN-WATER-T713333-WEIGHT-0-052','4,5,3,2,7,1','4,5,12,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,462,1,337,NULL,NULL,27542,32500),('en',1,'Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 8 Gram 20 Tablets','Tetra FunTips Fish food For Healthy feeding fun and exciting diversity Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets Good Treats For Fish 8 Gram 20 Tablets 0.008','Biologically balanced adhesive food tablets for tropical fish. For healthy feeding fun and exciting variety. Feeding fun Complete food,Treats. With their biologically balanced ingredients, Tetra FunTips Tablets are ideal treats for all tropical fish. The two-coloured adhesive food tablets provide your fish with twice the dietary benefits: the orange side is made from shrimps and carotenoids, ingredients that help enhance the colours of the fish to make them more vibrant, while the green part contains several vegetable ingredients as well as premium fats and oils that are essential for healthy and vital fish. The FunTips Tablets include animal constituents such as daphnia, krill and shrimps, which make up over 20 percent of the overall ingredients. However, the adhesive tablets are also made from plant ingredients, including several types of algae. Therefore Tetra FunTips Tablets are made up of 42 percent protein and five percent fat. The adhesive food tablets are more than just a healthy treat for your fish to snack on. The fact that the food tablets stick to the aquarium glass offers a great way to watch your fish up-close and see how they behave. They also make it far easier to take photos of your fish – perhaps even in the case of shy species, which swim up to the adhesive tablets to eat. There is also another major advantage to your fish spending time so close to the glass: you can keep a very close eye on them and detect any possible illnesses. This ultimately enables you also to take targeted action to combat illness, treat the fish and, ideally, even prevent diseases from spreading. All in all, Tetra FunTips Tablets not only make feeding time fun and exciting, but provide a practical way to add healthy variety to your fish’s diet.','tetra-tetra-funtips-fish-food-for-healthy-feeding-fun-and-exciting-diversity-biologically-balanced-adhesive-food-tablets-good-treats-for-fish-8-gram-20-tablets','TETRA-TETRA-FUNTIPS-FISH-FOOD-FOR-HEALTHY-FEEDING-FUN-AND-EXCITING-DIVERSITY-BIOLOGICALLY-BALANCED-ADHESIVE-FOOD-TABLETS-GOOD-TREATS-FOR-FISH-8-GRAM-20-TABLETS-T713619-WEIGHT-0-008','4,5,3,2,7,6,1','4,5,12,51,52,117,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,463,1,338,NULL,NULL,29661,35000),('en',1,'Tetra Betta Larva Sticks 28 Gram Complete Floating Worm-Shaped Food for Betta Fish & Anabantids, Enhances Color, Digestion & Growth','Tetra Betta Larva Sticks 28 Gram Complete Floating Worm-Shaped Food for Betta Fish & Anabantids, Enhances Color, Digestion & Growth 0.028','Tetra Betta Larva Sticks is a premium complete food designed specifically for Betta fish and other anabantids, ensuring they receive a balanced and nutritious diet. These worm-shaped floating sticks closely resemble natural prey, making them highly palatable and enjoyable for fish. With a high protein content of 43%, natural color activators, and essential vitamins, this exclusive recipe supports optimal growth, enhanced color vibrancy, and a strong immune system. The sticks are easily digestible, reducing waste and keeping aquarium water clean and clear. Made with high-quality natural ingredients and free from artificial colorants or preservatives, Tetra Betta Larva Sticks provide a nutritious, well-rounded diet that promotes the overall well-being of your fighting fish and other anabantids. Give your Betta the best with a food that supports vitality, brilliant colors, and a healthy aquarium environment.','tetra-tetra-betta-larva-sticks-28-gram-complete-floating-worm-shaped-food-for-betta-fish-and-anabantids-enhances-color-digestion-and-growth','TETRA-TETRA-BETTA-LARVA-STICKS-28-GRAM-COMPLETE-FLOATING-WORM-SHAPED-FOOD-FOR-BETTA-FISH-AND-ANABANTIDS-ENHANCES-COLOR-DIGESTION-AND-GROWTH-T713112-WEIGHT-0-028','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,1