 and yellow species. Enriched with natural colour enhancers, it intensifies fish colours in just two weeks without the use of artificial dyes. Formulated with the BioActive formula, Tetra Rubin Flakes support a healthy immune system, ensuring the overall well-being of your fish. The high-quality protein content promotes strong growth, while prebiotics aid digestion and improve food conversion for maximum nutrient absorption. These highly digestible flakes are carefully crafted to prevent water clouding, keeping your aquarium clear. Suitable for daily feeding, Tetra Rubin Flakes provide a balanced and nutritious diet for a wide range of ornamental fish. For added variety, alternate with TetraMin, TetraPhyll, or FreshDelica.','tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-20-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-fish-boosts-red-orange-and-yellow-tones-supports-growth-digestion-and-immunity','TETRA-TETRA-RUBIN-FLAKES-20-GRAM-COLOUR-ENHANCING-COMPLETE-FOOD-FOR-ORNAMENTAL-FISH-BOOSTS-RED-ORANGE-AND-YELLOW-TONES-SUPPORTS-GROWTH-DIGESTION-AND-IMMUNITY-T713269-WEIGHT-0-052','4,5,3,6,2,7,1','4,5,12,45,51,52,121,122','31,80','fish,fish-food','1','https://res.cloudinary.com/jldplnly/image/upload/v1791535642/petsupright/preview-26-tetra-tetra-rubin-flakes-52-gram-colour-enhancing-complete-food-for-ornamental-f-1yk9kglkqqvkaf0rn0jxdnprrrtjl-bqp__preview.jpg',NULL,'',NULL,0,0,470,1,345,1419,NULL,23305,27500),('en',1,'Tetra Betta 27 Gram Premium Complete Food for Betta & Labyrinth Fish Enhances Colour & Fin Growth Rich in Krill & Shrimps High Protein for Vitality','Tetra Betta 27 Gram Premium Complete Food for Betta & Labyrinth Fish Enhances Colour & Fin Growth Rich in Krill & Shrimps High Protein for Vitality 0.027','Tetra Betta is a high-quality, complete food specifically developed for Betta splendens (Fighting Fish) and other Labyrinth fish. This premium formula provides a species-appropriate protein content sourced from krill (6.5%) and shrimp (7%), promoting strong growth and impres